ix or more creatures.\\nCreatures you control also get +1/+0 and have double strike as long as you control nine or more creatures.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn. Citizens you control get an additional +1/+1 and gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Crooked Custodian enters the battlefield tapped.', "Dapper Shieldmate enters the battlefield with a shield counter on it. (If it would be dealt damage or destroyed, remove a shield counter from it instead.)\\nAs long as it's your turn, Dapper Shieldmate gets +2/+0.", 'Deathtouch, haste\\nWhenever Maestros Diabolist attacks, if you don\'t control a Devil token, create a tapped and attacking 1/1 red Devil creature token with "When this creature dies, it deals 1 damage to any target."', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever another nontoken creature you control dies, Body Launderer connives.\\nWhen Body Launderer dies, return another target non-Rogue creature card with equal or lesser power from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Defender\\nAs long as there are two or more counters among creatures you control, Backstreet Bruiser can attack as though it didn't have defender.", "Defender\\n{3}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'Destroy all artifacts, then Structural Assault deals damage to each creature equal to the number of artifacts that were put into graveyards from the battlefield this turn.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or creature with flying.', 'Destroy target attacking creature.', 'Destroy target creature.', 'Double strike\\nDisciplined Duelist enters the battlefield with a shield counter on it. (If it would be dealt damage or destroyed, remove a shield counter from it instead.)', 'Double strike\\nWhenever Illuminator Virtuoso becomes the target of a spell you control, it connives. (Draw a card, then discard a card. If you discarded a nonland card, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', "Draw two cards, then look at the top card of each player's library.", 'Draw two cards. Then