starter: []
rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate Tavern Swindler\'s ability if your life total is less than 3. You can activate it if your life total is exactly 3, but it\'s probably a bad idea. You\'ll lose the game before the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Activating Suspicious Bookcase\'s ability after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, the ability triggers after you draw whichever is the second one for the turn. You choose a target (if any) for the ability after you\'ve drawn and looked at all of the cards and finished resolving the spell or ability that caused you to draw them."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter whether the permanent with that ability was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X when determining the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "A face-down spell has mana value 0 and can\'t be targeted by Disdainful Stroke."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "A permanent that is somehow both a creature and a planeswalker as Brokers Ascendancy\'s ability resolves will get both a +1/+1 counter and a loyalty counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Activated abilities contain a colon. They\'re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If an ability that Scheming Fence gains refers to the permanent it is on by name, the ability Scheming Fence has refers to Scheming Fence instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Scheming Fence gains only activated abilities. It doesn\'t gain keyword abilities (unless those keyword abilities are activated), triggered abilities, or static abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Some activated abilities won\'t do anything when activated by Scheming Fence. For example, if the chosen permanent is an Equipment with an equip ability, activating that equip ability will not cause Scheming Fence to become attached because it isn\'t one of the subtypes which can be attached to permanents (Aura, Equipment, and Fortification)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Activating mana abilities is done before paying costs when activating an ability. This means that if you control a creature which can be tapped for mana, such as Avacyn\'s Pilgrim, you may both tap it for mana and untap it to pay costs for Halo Fountain\'s activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Untapping creatures is part of the cost of all of Halo Fountain\'s abilities. Once you\'ve begun activating an ability, other players can\'t take actions until you have finished activating it, including paying its costs. Notably, players can\'t take actions to remove the creatures from the battlefield to prevent you from untapping them to pay for the ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "As Dusk Mangler\'s triggered ability resolves, each opponent, starting with the next player in turn order, chooses a creature, knowing the choices made before them. All of those creatures are sacrificed at the same time. Next, each opponent chooses a card in their hand without revealing it, and all of those cards are discarded at the same time. Then, each opponent loses 4 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Backstreet Bruiser\'s ability looks for two or more individual counters. It doesn\'t matter if the counters are the same kind or different kinds or whether they are on the same permanent or different permanents."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Black Market Tycoon\'s ability triggers at the beginning of your upkeep whether or not you actually have any Treasures, and it counts the number of Treasures you have as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Colorless is not a color. Similarly, colorless mana isn\'t counted when determining the number of colors that were spent on an ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Costs to activate an ability are determined only once, before mana abilities are activated. If cards are removed from your graveyard after that point, such as by exiling Jack-o\'-Lantern from your graveyard to pay for its mana ability, this won\'t affect the cost of activating Sewer Crocodile, even if that reduces the number of mana values in your graveyard to below five."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a land card is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'X is 0 when determining the mana value of a card in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard” means there are at least five different mana values among those cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Damage that would be dealt to you will be prevented even if you can\'t mill twice that many cards."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If the damage can\'t be prevented for some reason, you\'ll still mill twice that many cards."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you would mill more cards than are in your library, you mill all cards in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Don\'t play with this card near any important paperwork. We can\'t take responsibility for what happens."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. If you discard a nonland card this way, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives” will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If no card is discarded, most likely because that player\'s hand is empty and an effect says they can\'t draw cards, the conniving creature does not receive a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to connive begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the conniving creature after you discard a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Spells that were cast before Ledger Shredder entered the battlefield count. If Ledger Shredder was the first spell you cast this turn, the next spell you cast this turn is your second spell.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Each opponent in turn order may choose to tap an untapped creature as Reservoir Kraken\'s triggered ability resolves, even if a player earlier in the turn order already chose to tap a creature. Reservoir Kraken\'s controller will create a maximum of one Fish creature token each combat, no matter how many creatures were tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Players won\'t know which player or planeswalker Reservoir Kraken will attack, if any, when deciding whether to tap an untapped creature for its triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Endless Detour doesn\'t counter spells. A spell that can\'t be countered can still be put on the top or bottom of its owner\'s library this way."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If Endless Detour is targeting a spell and that spell is countered or otherwise goes to its owner\'s graveyard before Endless Detour resolves, it is no longer the same object and it will not be put on the top or bottom of its owner\'s library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Evolving Door\'s ability instructs you to count the number of colors, but it doesn\'t track what those colors were. For example, if you sacrifice a creature that is green and no other colors, you\'ll search for any creature card that is exactly two colors, even if the card you search for isn\'t green."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you choose to cast the spell, you must cast it as Evolving Door\'s ability resolves. You cannot wait and cast it later."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a colorless creature, you must search your library for a creature card with exactly one color. If you sacrifice a creature that is all five colors, you won\'t be able to find any creatures because there are no creature cards in Magic with six colors."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'You count the colors of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield. Notably, if it was a double-faced card or a copy of another creature, that may be different from what its colors are in the graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'You must pay all costs for a spell you cast this way.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "For Riveteers Charm\'s first mode, if the target opponent controls more than one creature or planeswalker with the highest mana value among creatures and planeswalkers they control, that player chooses which one to sacrifice as Riveteers Charm resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "For the second mode, you must pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played this way. For example, you may play lands this way only during your main phase while no spells or abilities are on the stack and only if you haven\'t played a land yet this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "For the first mode, you don\'t have to choose a card if you don\'t want to, even if the opponent has a creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card in their hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If Arcane Bombardment leaves the battlefield, the exiled cards remain in exile. If it returns to the battlefield or you play another copy of it, you won\'t get to cast copies of the cards previously exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell with {X} in its cost without paying its mana cost, you must choose 0 for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you\'ve already cast an instant or sorcery spell the turn that Arcane Bombardment enters the battlefield, it won\'t trigger until you cast an instant or sorcery spell on a later turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The spell that caused Arcane Bombardment\'s ability to trigger is normally still on the stack while that ability resolves. That spell won\'t be among the cards in your graveyard when you exile an instant or sorcery from it at random."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You cast the desired copies as the triggered ability resolves. You don\'t get to cast them later in the turn. You choose the order of copies as you cast them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If Spara\'s Adjudicators is removed from exile without being cast, the land will continue to have this ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may use the mana ability Spara\'s Adjudicators grants to the land while casting Spara\'s Adjudicators from exile."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield as a copy of or becomes a copy of a creature whose blitz cost was paid, the copy won\'t have haste, won\'t be sacrificed, and its controller won\'t draw a card when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you choose to pay the blitz cost rather than the mana cost, you\'re still casting the spell. It goes on the stack and can be responded to and countered. You can cast a creature spell for its blitz cost only if you could cast that creature spell. Most of the time, this means during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you pay the blitz cost to cast a creature spell, that permanent will be sacrificed only if it\'s still on the battlefield when that triggered ability resolves. If it dies or goes to another zone before then, it will stay where it is."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that lets its controller draw a card triggers when it dies for any reason, not just when you sacrifice it during the end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to attack with the creature with blitz unless another ability says you do."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "“If you don\'t” in the second ability refers to whether you played a land or cast a spell from the top of your library, not just whether or not you cast a spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield as a copy of or becomes a copy of a creature whose blitz cost was paid, the copy won\'t have haste, won\'t be sacrificed, and its controller won\'t draw a card when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you choose to pay the blitz cost rather than the mana cost, you\'re still casting the spell. It goes on the stack and can be responded to and countered. You can cast a creature spell for its blitz cost only if you could cast that creature spell. Most of the time, this means during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you pay the blitz cost to cast a creature spell, that permanent will be sacrificed only if it\'s still on the battlefield when that triggered ability resolves. If it dies or goes to another zone before then, it will stay where it is."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that lets its controller draw a card triggers when it dies for any reason, not just when you sacrifice it during the end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to attack with the creature with blitz unless another ability says you do."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a creature with double strike loses double strike after dealing damage during the first combat damage step but before dealing damage in the second combat damage step, it will not deal damage during that second combat damage step. Notably, this means that if your ninth creature dies in the first combat damage step, the rest of your creatures won\'t deal combat damage again unless something else is granting them double strike."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a permanent is no longer a legal target as Soul of Emancipation\'s triggered ability resolves, that target\'s controller will not create an Angel for that permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a permanent is still a legal target as Soul of Emancipation\'s triggered ability resolves but it isn\'t destroyed, perhaps because it had a shield counter, its controller will create an Angel token for that permanent."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a player controls an artifact creature with a shield counter on it as Structural Assault destroys all artifacts, a shield counter will be removed before Structural Assault deals damage to each creature. Unless that artifact creature has another shield counter on it, the damage won\'t be prevented."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Structural Assault counts the number of artifacts that were put into graveyards from the battlefield this turn for any reason, not just because they were destroyed by Structural Assault.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. If you discard a nonland card this way, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives” will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If no card is discarded, most likely because that player\'s hand is empty and an effect says they can\'t draw cards, the conniving creature does not receive a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to connive begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the conniving creature after you discard a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Use Body Launderer\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine legal targets for its last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. If you discard a nonland card this way, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives” will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If no card is discarded, most likely because that player\'s hand is empty and an effect says they can\'t draw cards, the conniving creature does not receive a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to connive begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the conniving creature after you discard a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Use Raffine\'s Silencer\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. If you discard a nonland card this way, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives” will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If no card is discarded, most likely because that player\'s hand is empty and an effect says they can\'t draw cards, the conniving creature does not receive a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to connive begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the conniving creature after you discard a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If another player gains control of the equipped creature but doesn\'t gain control of the Equipment, they will not be able to activate the ability the Equipment grants because they can\'t pay a cost that includes sacrificing a permanent they don\'t control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If multiple creatures enter the battlefield simultaneously, you must still choose different modes for each instance of the triggered ability that\'s put onto the stack. If more than three creatures enter the battlefield simultaneously, that choice is made only for the first three."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If the creature targeted by Sleep with the Fishes isn\'t a legal target at the time it would resolve, Sleep with the Fishes is put into its owner\'s graveyard from the stack. It\'s not put onto the battlefield and then put into their graveyard. Notably, this means that its controller will not create a Fish token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If the target creature is a token, the ability still triggers when it dies. Its controller won\'t return the token to the battlefield, but they will creature a Treasure token."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The Treasure token is created by the creature\'s controller, who may be different from Fake Your Own Death\'s controller and may be different from the creature\'s owner."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If the target is no longer legal as An Offer You Can\'t Refuse resolves, no Treasure tokens are created."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If the target is still legal as it resolves but the spell can\'t be countered for some reason, its controller will still create two Treasure tokens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you activated the crew ability of unlicensed Hearse before exiling any cards with its first ability, its power and toughness will be 0/0. Unless there is another effect increasing its toughness, it will be put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you cast an Adventure spell from your graveyard this way, it\'s exiled as it resolves with the replacement effect created by the Adventure rules and you may cast the creature card from exile later."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, your starting life total is the life total your team started at, and your current life total is your team\'s current life total."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Maestros Diabolist\'s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if\'” clause. This means that it checks to see if you control a Devil token both when the ability triggers and when it resolves. Notably, this means that attacking with two Maestros Diabolists will normally cause you to create only one Devil token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Majestic Metamorphosis overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Majestic Metamorphosis resolves will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The target artifact or creature retains its original abilities and colors, if any.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Metropolis Angel\'s last ability triggers whenever you attack with at least one creature that has at least one counter on it. You draw exactly one card as it resolves, no matter how many attacking creatures had counters on them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Players must pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played this way. For example, players may play a land card this way only during a main phase of their own turn when the stack is empty, and only if they haven\'t yet played a land this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Quick-Draw Dagger doesn\'t enter the battlefield attached to a creature. Instead, the Equipment enters the battlefield and then a triggered ability attaches it to a creature. You may cast Quick-Draw Dagger even if you don\'t control any creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Sanguine Spy\'s triggered ability checks the number of mana values among cards you control both when the ability triggers and when it resolves. If you no longer have five or more mana values among those cards when the ability resolves, you may not pay 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a land card is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'X is 0 when determining the mana value of a card in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard” means there are at least five different mana values among those cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "That permanent\'s controller chooses whether to put it on the top or bottom of the library. If the target permanent is made up of multiple cards (due to mutate or meld, for example), that permanent\'s controller puts all of them on the top or all of them on the bottom. They do not need to reveal the order those cards were put into the library this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The ability Hold for Ransom grants to the enchanted creature can be activated only by that creature\'s controller, who is usually not the same player who controls Hold for Ransom."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The last part of Lagrella\'s ability is a delayed triggered ability that is set up as its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. It will trigger when Lagrella leaves the battlefield even if it\'s somehow lost its abilities or become a copy of something else."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“This way” refers to cards entering the battlefield as a result of Lagrella leaving the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The tokens\' characteristics are entirely replaced by either 2/2 green Cat creature token with haste or 3/1 green Dog creature token with vigilance. They don\'t have any other abilities the tokens would have been created with. Anything else specified in the effect creating the tokens (such as tapped, attacking, “That token gains haste,” or “Exile that token at end of combat”) still applies."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "To double a creature\'s power means that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "To double a creature\'s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is that creature\'s power as Mr. Orfeo\'s triggered ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Use the creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage Ziatora deals."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You make the choice of first strike or lifelink only once, as Ballroom Brawlers\'s triggered ability resolves. Both creatures gain the chosen ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may activate Vivien on the Hunt\'s first ability without sacrificing a creature. If you do, the ability does nothing."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You must pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for a card played this way. For example, you may play a land card this way only during a main phase of your own turn when the stack is empty, and only if you haven\'t yet played a land this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "“Each Angel you already control” means each Angel you control other than the Angel entering the battlefield, including Giada. It doesn\'t matter if some or all of the Angels on the battlefield entered the battlefield after Giada did."}]', "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'A copy of a permanent spell enters the battlefield as a token. This is not the same as an effect that creates a token, and any effect that refers to creating a token does not apply to copies of permanent spells.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'Multiple instances of double strike do not increase the number of strikes. That creature still only gets to deal combat damage twice.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'A creature with a shield counter on it may still be destroyed by state-based actions if it has damage marked on it equal to its toughness or has been dealt unpreventable damage by a source with deathtouch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Combat damage is assigned to creatures and players and then dealt simultaneously. Notably, this means blocking a Rhox Pummeler with a shield counter on it won\'t normally prevent Rhox Pummeler from dealing damage to the defending player due to its trample ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent that would be dealt damage has more than one shield counter on it, that damage is prevented and only one shield counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent with a shield counter is dealt unpreventable damage, that damage will be dealt and a shield counter will still be removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If an attacking Rhox Pummeler with one shield counter on it is blocked by a creature with first strike, the shield counter will be removed in the first combat damage step. In that case, Rhox Pummeler won\'t have trample when it deals combat damage in the second combat damage step."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Removing a shield counter in this way isn\'t the same as regenerating a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Shield counters don\'t prevent players from sacrificing creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Shield” is not an ability that creatures have and shield counters are not keyword counters. If a creature with a shield counter loses its abilities, the shield counter will still protect it as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'A creature with a shield counter on it may still be destroyed by state-based actions if it has damage marked on it equal to its toughness or has been dealt unpreventable damage by a source with deathtouch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "For Elspeth\'s first ability, its controller chooses flying, first strike, lifelink, or vigilance, then that counter and the +1/+1 counter are placed on the target creature at the same time."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent that would be dealt damage has more than one shield counter on it, that damage is prevented and only one shield counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent with a shield counter is dealt unpreventable damage, that damage will be dealt and a shield counter will still be removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Removing a shield counter in this way isn\'t the same as regenerating a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Shield counters don\'t prevent players from sacrificing creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Shield” is not an ability that creatures have and shield counters are not keyword counters. If a creature with a shield counter loses its abilities, the shield counter will still protect it as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'A creature with a shield counter on it may still be destroyed by state-based actions if it has damage marked on it equal to its toughness or has been dealt unpreventable damage by a source with deathtouch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent that would be dealt damage has more than one shield counter on it, that damage is prevented and only one shield counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent with a shield counter is dealt unpreventable damage, that damage will be dealt and a shield counter will still be removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with casualty this way, you can pay the costs in any order, which means that you may remove a counter from a creature then sacrifice it to pay the casualty cost. Bear in mind that removing a +1/+1 counter this way will reduce a creature\'s power, which might prevent you from paying the casualty cost with that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Removing a counter from a creature is an additional cost of casting the spell and may be combined with other additional costs or alternative costs that spell may have, such as casualty.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Removing a shield counter in this way isn\'t the same as regenerating a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Shield counters don\'t prevent players from sacrificing creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Shield” is not an ability that creatures have and shield counters are not keyword counters. If a creature with a shield counter loses its abilities, the shield counter will still protect it as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'A creature with a shield counter on it may still be destroyed by state-based actions if it has damage marked on it equal to its toughness or has been dealt unpreventable damage by a source with deathtouch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent that would be dealt damage has more than one shield counter on it, that damage is prevented and only one shield counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent with a shield counter is dealt unpreventable damage, that damage will be dealt and a shield counter will still be removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Only the first and second modes of Titan of Industry\'s triggered ability have a target. If one of those modes is chosen with either the third or fourth mode and the only target is an illegal target when the ability would resolve, the ability does not resolve and the other chosen mode has no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Removing a shield counter in this way isn\'t the same as regenerating a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Shield counters don\'t prevent players from sacrificing creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Shield” is not an ability that creatures have and shield counters are not keyword counters. If a creature with a shield counter loses its abilities, the shield counter will still protect it as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'A creature with a shield counter on it may still be destroyed by state-based actions if it has damage marked on it equal to its toughness or has been dealt unpreventable damage by a source with deathtouch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent that would be dealt damage has more than one shield counter on it, that damage is prevented and only one shield counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent with a shield counter is dealt unpreventable damage, that damage will be dealt and a shield counter will still be removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Removing a shield counter in this way isn\'t the same as regenerating a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Sanctuary Warden\'s triggered ability allows you to remove any kind of counter, not just a shield counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Shield counters don\'t prevent players from sacrificing creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Shield” is not an ability that creatures have and shield counters are not keyword counters. If a creature with a shield counter loses its abilities, the shield counter will still protect it as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'A creature with a shield counter on it may still be destroyed by state-based actions if it has damage marked on it equal to its toughness or has been dealt unpreventable damage by a source with deathtouch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent that would be dealt damage has more than one shield counter on it, that damage is prevented and only one shield counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent with a shield counter is dealt unpreventable damage, that damage will be dealt and a shield counter will still be removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Removing a shield counter in this way isn\'t the same as regenerating a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Shield counters don\'t prevent players from sacrificing creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Shield” is not an ability that creatures have and shield counters are not keyword counters. If a creature with a shield counter loses its abilities, the shield counter will still protect it as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'A creature with a shield counter on it may still be destroyed by state-based actions if it has damage marked on it equal to its toughness or has been dealt unpreventable damage by a source with deathtouch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent that would be dealt damage has more than one shield counter on it, that damage is prevented and only one shield counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a permanent with a shield counter is dealt unpreventable damage, that damage will be dealt and a shield counter will still be removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If the target is illegal as Boon of Safety attempts to resolve, it will be removed from the stack and its controller will not scry.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Removing a shield counter in this way isn\'t the same as regenerating a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Shield counters don\'t prevent players from sacrificing creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Shield” is not an ability that creatures have and shield counters are not keyword counters. If a creature with a shield counter loses its abilities, the shield counter will still protect it as normal.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'A permanent cannot be dealt 0 excess damage.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'Excess damage has been dealt to a creature if the damage dealt to it is greater than lethal damage. Usually, this means damage greater than its toughness, although damage already marked on the creature is taken into account.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'Excess damage has been dealt to a planeswalker if the amount of damage dealt to it is greater than the number of loyalty counters that it had remaining when the damage was dealt.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'An attacking or blocking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Any continuous effects with a “for as long as” duration, such as that of Extraction Specialist, ignore phased-out objects. If ignoring those objects causes the effect\'s conditions to no longer be met, the duration will expire."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "As a creature is phased out, Auras and Equipment attached to it also phase out at the same time. Those Auras and Equipment will phase in at the same time that creature does, and they\'ll phase in still attached to that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Permanents phase back in during their controller\'s untap step, immediately before that player untaps their permanents. Creatures that phase in this way are able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn. If a permanent had counters on it when it phased out, it will have those counters when it phases back in."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Phased-out permanents are treated as though they don\'t exist. They can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, their static abilities have no effect on the game, their triggered abilities can\'t trigger, they can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Phasing out doesn\'t cause any “leaves the battlefield” abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\'t cause any “enters the battlefield” abilities to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature card will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If Jaxis, the Troublemaker\'s ability creates multiple tokens due to a replacement effect (such as the one Doubling Season creates), you\'ll sacrifice each of them at the beginning of the next end step."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a copied creature is a token that isn\'t a copy of something else, the copy copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a copied creature is copying something else, the token you create will use the copiable values of the target creature. In most cases, it will just be a copy of whatever that creature is copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield as a copy of or becomes a copy of a creature whose blitz cost was paid, the copy won\'t have haste, won\'t be sacrificed, and its controller won\'t draw a card when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If another creature becomes a copy of, or enters the battlefield as a copy of, the token, that creature will copy the creature card the token is copying. However, it won\'t have either haste or “When this creature dies, draw a card,” and you won\'t sacrifice the new copy at the beginning of the next end step."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you choose to pay the blitz cost rather than the mana cost, you\'re still casting the spell. It goes on the stack and can be responded to and countered. You can cast a creature spell for its blitz cost only if you could cast that creature spell. Most of the time, this means during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you pay the blitz cost to cast a creature spell, that permanent will be sacrificed only if it\'s still on the battlefield when that triggered ability resolves. If it dies or goes to another zone before then, it will stay where it is."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless it\'s copying a creature that\'s a token or that\'s copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether the creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on. Most notably, if the target creature isn\'t normally a creature, the copy won\'t be a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that lets its controller draw a card triggers when it dies for any reason, not just when you sacrifice it during the end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to attack with the creature with blitz unless another ability says you do."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads “[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped,” and they now have hideaway 4.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may use the Treasure token created by the first part of Widespread Thieving\'s last ability to pay part of the {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} cost in the second part of that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "“Hideaway N” means “When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains ‘The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\'”"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads “[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped,” and they now have hideaway 4.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "“Hideaway N” means “When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains ‘The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\'”"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'As you cast a spell with casualty X, you choose whether to pay its casualty cost and what the value of X will be.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Casualty N means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater.” and “When you cast this spell, if a casualty cost was paid for it, copy it. If the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for the copy.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you pay the casualty cost of a spell, the copy will resolve before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copied spell from Ob Nixilis, the Adversary\'s triggered ability copies exactly what is printed on Ob Nixilis, except its starting loyalty is equal to the chosen value of X and it isn\'t legendary. The copy becomes a token as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copy of the spell is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'You can control exactly one legendary Ob Nixilis, the Adversary and any number of nonlegendary copies of Ob Nixilis, the Adversary.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one creature to pay a spell\'s casualty cost, and you copy the spell only once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Casualty N means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater.” and “When you cast this spell, if a casualty cost was paid for it, copy it. If the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for the copy.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If there\'s only one card in your library as A Little Chat resolves, you\'ll put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you pay the casualty cost of a spell, the copy will resolve before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copy of the spell is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one creature to pay a spell\'s casualty cost, and you copy the spell only once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Casualty N means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater.” and “When you cast this spell, if a casualty cost was paid for it, copy it. If the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for the copy.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you cast Grisly Sigil targeting a creature or planeswalker that hasn\'t been dealt noncombat damage this turn, choose to pay its casualty cost, and choose not to change the target, the copy will deal 1 damage and you will gain 1 life. Then, the original spell will resolve. It will deal 3 damage, and you will gain 3 life."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you pay the casualty cost of a spell, the copy will resolve before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copy of the spell is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one creature to pay a spell\'s casualty cost, and you copy the spell only once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Casualty N means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater.” and “When you cast this spell, if a casualty cost was paid for it, copy it. If the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for the copy.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you cast Cut Your Losses and copy it targeting the same player, that player will mill half their library, then mill half of what remains after that. They do not mill their entire library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you pay the casualty cost of a spell, the copy will resolve before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copy of the spell is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one creature to pay a spell\'s casualty cost, and you copy the spell only once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Casualty N means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater.” and “When you cast this spell, if a casualty cost was paid for it, copy it. If the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for the copy.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you pay the casualty cost of a spell, the copy will resolve before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copy of the spell is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one creature to pay a spell\'s casualty cost, and you copy the spell only once."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You must pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played this way. For example, you may play lands this way only during your main phase while no spells or abilities are on the stack and only if you haven\'t played a land yet this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Casualty N means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater.” and “When you cast this spell, if a casualty cost was paid for it, copy it. If the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for the copy.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you pay the casualty cost of a spell, the copy will resolve before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copy of the spell is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one creature to pay a spell\'s casualty cost, and you copy the spell only once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Casualty N means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater.” and “When you cast this spell, if a casualty cost was paid for it, copy it. If the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for the copy.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you pay the casualty cost of a spell, the copy will resolve before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copy of the spell is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'X will be the same for both the original spell and the copy you create with the casualty ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one creature to pay a spell\'s casualty cost, and you copy the spell only once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Casualty N means “As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater.” and “When you cast this spell, if a casualty cost was paid for it, copy it. If the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for the copy.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you pay the casualty cost of a spell, the copy will resolve before the original spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The copy of the spell is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'You may return any creature card from your graveyard to your hand, not just those you milled while resolving Dig Up the Body.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may sacrifice only one creature to pay a spell\'s casualty cost, and you copy the spell only once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Connive X is a variant of connive. If a creature connives X, its controller will draw X cards, discard X cards, then then put a number of +1/+1 counters on the conniving permanent equal to the number of nonland cards discarded this way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. If you discard a nonland card this way, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives” will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If no card is discarded, most likely because that player\'s hand is empty and an effect says they can\'t draw cards, the conniving creature does not receive a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to connive begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the conniving creature after you discard a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Even when it is on a creature, Treasure is an artifact type and not a creature type. Similarly, Dog is always a creature type and not an artifact type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Treasure, it means any Treasure artifact, not just a Treasure artifact token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Since Goldhound is a creature, its {T} ability can\'t be activated the turn that it enters the battlefield or the turn a player gains control of it unless it has haste."}]', "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'Exiling Maestros Initiate from your graveyard is part of paying the cost of its ability. This means that no player can respond to the ability by removing it from your graveyard before you can pay the cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If Call In a Professional deals damage to a creature with a shield counter on it, that damage will not be prevented, but a shield counter will still be removed. If that damage is enough to be lethal damage, the creature will be destroyed, even if it still has more shield counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If Glamorous Outlaw is removed from exile without being cast, the land will continue to have this ability..'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'You may use the mana ability Glamorous Outlaw grants to the land while casting Glamorous Outlaw from exile.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If Masked Bandits is removed from exile without being cast, the land will continue to have this ability.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'You may use the mana ability Masked Bandits grants to the land while casting Masked Bandits from exile.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If Rakish Revelers is removed from exile without being cast, the land will continue to have this ability.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'You may use the mana ability Rakish Revelers grants to the land while casting Rakish Revelers from exile.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If Shattered Seraph is removed from exile without being cast, the land will continue to have this ability.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'You may use the mana ability Shattered Seraph grants to the land while casting Shattered Seraph from exile.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If a player copies Fatal Grudge, the characteristics of the permanent that was sacrificed to pay for the original spell are used to determine which permanents each opponent may choose.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If an effect allows a player to cast Fatal Grudge without paying its mana cost, that player must still pay the additional cost of sacrificing a nonland permanent.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives, such as that of Psychic Pickpocket, will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. If you discard a nonland card this way, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives” will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If no card is discarded, most likely because that player\'s hand is empty and an effect says they can\'t draw cards, the conniving creature does not receive a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to connive begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the conniving creature after you discard a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The target permanent to return is chosen after Psychic Pickpocket connives.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives,” such as that of Obscura Interceptor, will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell or ability instructs a specific creature to connive but that creature has left the battlefield, the creature still connives. If you discard a nonland card this way, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on anything. Abilities that trigger “when [that creature] connives” will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If no card is discarded, most likely because that player\'s hand is empty and an effect says they can\'t draw cards, the conniving creature does not receive a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Once an ability that causes a creature to connive begins to resolve, no player may take any other actions until it\'s done. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove the conniving creature after you discard a nonland card but before it receives a counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If an effect allows you to cast Graveyard Shift from your graveyard, you may cast it any time you could cast an instant if you have five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard immediately before you begin to cast it, even if moving it to the stack would reduce that number to four.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The game checks whether it is legal to cast a spell before costs are determined or mana abilities are activated while casting it. If cards are removed from your graveyard after that point, such as by exiling Jack-o\'-Lantern from your graveyard to pay for its mana ability, this won\'t affect whether you can legally cast Graveyard Shift, even if that reduces the number of mana values in your graveyard to below five."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a land card is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'X is 0 when determining the mana value of a card in your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard” means there are at least five mana values among those cards.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast Rocco without paying its mana cost, X is 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If an effect instructs a player to choose a card name, that player may not name “Legitimate Businessperson,” even if a creature currently has that name.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature had any subtypes other than creature types, such as Equipment, Vehicle, or Shrine, it loses those as well.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If multiple instances of the ability are on the stack, you will be able to return a creature to the battlefield for only one of those instances. Once you do that, other instances will do nothing as they resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Once you have chosen to return a creature to the battlefield, further instances of sacrificing creatures the same turn will not cause the ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'“Do this only once each turn” refers only to the ability it is attached to, not other instances of the same ability. In other words, if you control multiple copies of Riveteers Ascendancy, you will be able to do this once for each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "“Do this only once each turn” refers to returning a creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield using the triggered ability. As long as you haven\'t yet chosen to do that this turn, all instances of sacrificing a creature will cause Riveteers Ascendancy\'s ability to trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If the target is not legal as the spell would resolve, its controller does not get to scry.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If there are no soul counters on Obscura Ascendancy, its ability triggers if you cast a spell with mana value 1. If there is one counter, its ability triggers if you cast a spell with mana value 2, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Obscura Ascendancy\'s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if\'” clause. This means that it checks the number of counters both when the ability triggers and when it resolves. Notably, this means that casting two instants in a row with mana value 1 will never cause a player to create two tokens or put two counters on Obscura Ascendancy."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you choose the first mode and your creature is not a legal target as Brokers Charm resolves, no damage will be dealt.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you choose the first mode and your opponent\'s creature or planeswalker is not a legal target as Brokers Charm resolves, your creature will still get +1/+0"}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose the first mode for Brokers Charm unless your opponent has a creature or planeswalker to target."}]', "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If you have five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard and then some of them are removed such that you have fewer than five mana values among those cards, Aven Heartstabber loses its bonus to power and toughness. Notably, this may cause it to die if it now has damage marked on it greater than its toughness.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a land card is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'X is 0 when determining the mana value of a card in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': '“Five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard” means there are at least five different mana values among those cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If you have five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard and then some of them are removed such that you have fewer than five mana values among those cards, Snooping Newsie loses its bonus to power and toughness immediately. Notably, this may cause it to die if it now has damage marked on it greater than its toughness.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a land card is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'X is 0 when determining the mana value of a card in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': '“Five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard” means there are at least five different mana values among those cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If you have five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard and then some of them are removed such that you have fewer than five mana values among those cards, Syndicate Infiltrator loses its bonus to power and toughness. Notably, this may cause it to die if it now has damage marked on it greater than its toughness.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a land card is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'X is 0 when determining the mana value of a card in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': '“Five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard” means there are at least five different mana values among those cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'Once Extraction Specialist leaves the battlefield, the creature that is returned can attack and block as normal. If Extraction Specialist leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, the creature that is returned will be able to attack and block as normal right away.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Once you have begun to cast Corpse Explosion, there is no point at which players can respond by removing cards from your graveyard to prevent you from being able to pay for it with a specific creature card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Use the card\'s power as it last existed in the graveyard to determine how much damage is dealt."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'The mana created by Meeting of the Five can be spent on any portion of the cost for a spell with exactly three colors, including any generic cost component or additional costs it has.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You may cast any spells that have exactly three colors from among the cards exiled this way, even if they aren\'t the same three colors. For example, you could cast a spell that is white, blue, and black, then cast a spell that is black, red, and green."}]', "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a land card is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'X is 0 when determining the mana value of a card in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': '“Five or more mana values among cards in your graveyard” means there are at least five different mana values among those cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a land card is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'X is 0 when determining the mana value of a card in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'Unless another effect is making that planeswalker a creature with a power and toughness, the equipped planeswalker has base power and toughness 0/0.'}, {'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': '“Equip planeswalker” is a variant of the equip ability. “Equip planeswalker [cost]” means “[Cost]: Attach this permanent to target planeswalker you control as though that planeswalker were a creature. Activate only as a sorcery.”'}]", "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'You must choose a card for the target player to exile if at least one card revealed this way is an artifact, instant, or sorcery card.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Personnel d\'accueil du gala", \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'192e737a-57c9-4142-9613-cb19bbbbf2af\', \'multiverseId\': 558110}, \'multiverseid\': 558110}]', "[{'name': 'Abhören', 'text': 'Refugium 5 (Wenn diese Verzauberung ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nImmer wenn du deine erste Karte innerhalb jedes deiner Ziehsegmente ziehst, ziehe eine Karte. Falls du dann neun oder mehr Karten auf der Hand hast, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555527&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '364d0dcf-e480-472b-bcee-2e3f942926f1', 'multiverseId': 555527}, 'multiverseid': 555527}, {'name': 'Pinchazo telefónico', 'text': 'Esconder 5. (Cuando este encantamiento entre al campo de batalla, mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo en un orden aleatorio.)\\nSiempre que robes tu primera carta durante cada uno de tus pasos de robar, roba una carta. Luego, si tienes nueve o más cartas en la mano, puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555788&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e902d972-b6c3-4b94-88e4-665c71af1480', 'multiverseId': 555788}, 'multiverseid': 555788}, {'name': 'Mise sur écoute', 'text': 'Cachette 5 (Quand cet enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre première carte pendant chacune de vos étapes de pioche, piochez une carte. Puis, si vous avez au moins neuf cartes en main, vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556049&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '628ba8f9-2f87-4730-8cde-6833fcefb5ca', 'multiverseId': 556049}, 'multiverseid': 556049}, {'name': 'Intercettare le Comunicazioni', 'text': 'Nascondiglio 5 (Quando questo incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo in ordine casuale.)\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua prima carta durante ciascuna delle tue sottofasi di acquisizione, pesca una carta. Poi, se hai nove o più carte in mano, puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556310&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16402342-b07d-4235-a748-621ac11baadd', 'multiverseId': 556310}, 'multiverseid': 556310}, {'name': '盗聴', 'text': '秘匿５（このエンチャントが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後残りを一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\nあなたがあなたの各ドロー・ステップ中のあなたの１枚目のカードを引くたび、カード１枚を引く。その後、あなたの手札に９枚以上のカードがあるなら、あなたはその追放されているカード１枚をマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556571&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b519a7ed-8d67-490b-8b68-967fa02b5248', 'multiverseId': 556571}, 'multiverseid': 556571}, {'name': '도청', 'text': '은닉 5 (이 부여마법이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 보고, 한 장을 뒷면 상태로 추방한 후, 나머지를 서고 맨 밑에 무작위 순서로 놓는다.)\\n당신이 당신의 각 뽑기단 동안 첫 카드를 뽑을 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다. 그 후 당신의 손에 카드가 아홉 장 이상 있다면, 당신은 추방된 카드의 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556832&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9cfc44c-fc9c-4761-b318-2cc0dd8d6295', 'multiverseId': 556832}, 'multiverseid': 556832}, {'name': 'Grampo', 'text': 'Refúgio 5 (Quando este encantamento entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo em ordem aleatória.)\\nToda vez que você comprar seu primeiro card durante cada uma de suas etapas de compra, compre um card. Depois, se tiver nove ou mais cards na mão, você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557093&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3baed9a-3781-4d93-99c4-522b71b16ce9', 'multiverseId': 557093}, 'multiverseid': 557093}, {'name': 'Прослушка', 'text': 'Укрытие 5 (Когда эти чары выходят на поле битвы, посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ библиотеки в случайном порядке.)\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете вашу первую карту во время каждого вашего шага взятия карты, возьмите карту. Затем, если у вас не менее девяти карт в руке, вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557354&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14c96183-3762-4fdc-a8d5-6922e05db231', 'multiverseId': 557354}, 'multiverseid': 557354}, {'name': '搭线窃听', 'text': '掩蔽5（当此结界进战场时，检视你牌库顶的五张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于牌库底。）\\n每当你抓你每个抓牌步骤中你的第一张牌时，抓一张牌。然后如果你有九张或更多手牌，则你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557615&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2aeb75e1-20f8-4b3d-85aa-1f31303bac72', 'multiverseId': 557615}, 'multiverseid': 557615}, {'name': '搭線竊聽', 'text': '掩蔽5（當此結界進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌，將其中一張牌面朝下地放逐，然後將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於牌庫底。）\\n每當你抽你每個抽牌步驟中你的第一張牌時，抽一張牌。然後如果你有九張或更多手牌，則你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557876&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4aa5fcc3-1bd0-4a51-b2a4-b64973fcad8a', 'multiverseId': 557876}, 'multiverseid': 557876}]", "[{'name': 'Abhören', 'text': 'Refugium 5\\nImmer wenn du deine erste Karte innerhalb jedes deiner Ziehsegmente ziehst, ziehe eine Karte. Falls du dann neun oder mehr Karten auf der Hand hast, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558288&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb02ed02-d626-4c7f-93b4-e2defe9ef9e5', 'multiverseId': 558288}, 'multiverseid': 558288}, {'name': 'Mise sur écoute', 'text': 'Cachette 5\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre première carte pendant chacune de vos étapes de pioche, piochez une carte. Puis, si vous avez au moins neuf cartes en main, vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558323&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ece30f9-5014-4daa-8b2b-6cd3791de9ed', 'multiverseId': 558323}, 'multiverseid': 558323}, {'name': '盗聴', 'text': '秘匿５\\nあなたがあなたの各ドロー・ステップ中のあなたの１枚目のカードを引くたび、カード１枚を引く。その後、あなたの手札に９枚以上のカードがあるなら、あなたはその追放されているカード１枚をマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558358&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '241c524a-c3c3-4a3b-9dbe-ebe9ca16bf70', 'multiverseId': 558358}, 'multiverseid': 558358}, {'name': '搭线窃听', 'text': '掩蔽5\\n每当你抓你每个抓牌步骤中你的第一张牌时，抓一张牌。然后如果你有九张或更多手牌，则你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558393&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7deccbca-8527-4171-9b12-877e3750d05c', 'multiverseId': 558393}, 'multiverseid': 558393}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abrisskolonne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite, verursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Sie haben dieses Viertel gebaut. Sie kennen seine Schwachstellen. Sie kennen alle Verstecke. Wenn sie hinter dir her sind, finden sie dich und lassen das Dach über dir einstürzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7c1366d-8eeb-4b97-a935-82989f8049a7\', \'multiverseId\': 555594}, \'multiverseid\': 555594}, {\'name\': \'Brigada de demolición\', \'text\': \'Alcance, arrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Construyeron el barrio. Conocen sus puntos débiles y sus escondites. Cuando vayan a por ti, te encontrarán y te demolerán.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71599a01-99bd-4339-8ba0-61e5e3291af7\', \'multiverseId\': 555855}, \'multiverseid\': 555855}, {\'name\': \'Groupe de démolition\', \'text\': \'Portée, piétinement\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Ils ont construit le quartier. Ils en connaissent les points faibles. Ils en connaissent toutes les cachettes. S\'ils vous cherchent, ils vous trouveront et feront s\'abattre le toit sur votre tête.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556116&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc3d9bcd-a890-4f2a-bb97-dccf495ab940\', \'multiverseId\': 556116}, \'multiverseid\': 556116}, {\'name\': \'Banda di Demolizione\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere, travolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Hanno costruito il quartiere. Conoscono i suoi punti deboli. Conoscono tutti i nascondigli. Quando verranno a prenderti, ti troveranno e ti faranno crollare il tetto sulla testa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28aeaf5-31a1-4262-a17c-46fd1f526283\', \'multiverseId\': 556377}, \'multiverseid\': 556377}, {\'name\': \'解体作業員\', \'text\': \'到達、トランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'連中はこの区域を建てた。連中はその弱点も知っている。連中は隠れ家をすべて把握している。連中があなたを追って来るときは、あなたを見つけ次第、頭上に屋根を落とすだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b08274-a610-4712-a7e7-4a6934be0c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 556638}, \'multiverseid\': 556638}, {\'name\': \'철거단원\', \'text\': \'대공, 돌진\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'그들이 이 동네를 만들었다. 그들은 약점을 알고 있다. 그들은 모든 은신처를 알고 있다. 그들이 당신의 뒤를 쫓고 있다면, 그들은 당신을 찾아내 머리 위로 지붕을 떨어뜨릴 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a7c4dbc-44fc-4eea-a591-e342af13e2c1\', \'multiverseId\': 556899}, \'multiverseid\': 556899}, {\'name\': \'Equipe de Demolição\', \'text\': \'Alcance, atropelar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Eles construíram o bairro. Eles conhecem os pontos fracos. Eles conhecem os esconderijos. Quando te procurarem, vão te encontrar e a casa vai cair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40caf5fa-1cde-4d3d-a567-d6d2d79d2b64\', \'multiverseId\': 557160}, \'multiverseid\': 557160}, {\'name\': \'Крушащая Команда\', \'text\': \'Захват, Пробивной удар\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Они построили этот район. Они знают его слабые места. Они знают, где можно спрятаться. Когда они придут за тобой, они найдут тебя и обрушат весь дом на твою голову.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ef3374b-5ca6-4acb-8d6b-9485953f0b2e\', \'multiverseId\': 557421}, \'multiverseid\': 557421}, {\'name\': \'拆屋工组\', \'text\': \'延势，践踏\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'这街区是他们造的。他们清楚哪里脆弱，哪里能躲要是惹上他们，就等着给破门而入，断瓦临头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ba3dc4-4e32-4186-b7d8-57072224eabc\', \'multiverseId\': 557682}, \'multiverseid\': 557682}, {\'name\': \'拆屋工組\', \'text\': \'延勢，踐踏\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'這街區是他們造的。他們清楚哪裡脆弱，哪裡能躲。要是惹上他們，就等著給破門而入，斷瓦臨頭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a950cad9-5c8f-4e45-b4c9-92488cf197e7\', \'multiverseId\': 557943}, \'multiverseid\': 557943}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adrette Schildmaid\', \'text\': \'Die Adrette Schildmaid kommt mit einer Schildmarke ins Spiel. (Falls ihr Schaden zugefügt oder sie zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen eine Schildmarke von ihr.)\\nSolange es dein Zug ist, erhält die Adrette Schildmaid +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Die Brokers stammen von den Paladinen von Alt-Capenna ab und sind Meister der defensiven Kampfkunst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555471&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3672bc81-a27f-46ff-b1fc-208689796ba6\', \'multiverseId\': 555471}, \'multiverseid\': 555471}, {\'name\': \'Escudante sofisticada\', \'text\': \'La Escudante sofisticada entra al campo de batalla con un contador de escudo sobre ella. (Si fuera a recibir daño o a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve un contador de escudo de ella.)\\nMientras sea tu turno, la Escudante sofisticada obtiene +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los Mediadores descienden de los paladines de la antigua Capenna y dominan a la perfección el combate defensivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a6f45bd-4a1c-4e08-b85c-a9111a586354\', \'multiverseId\': 555732}, \'multiverseid\': 555732}, {\'name\': \'Compagnonne bouclier élégante\', \'text\': "La Compagnonne bouclier élégante arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « bouclier » sur elle. (Si elle devait subir des blessures ou être détruite, retirez-lui un marqueur « bouclier » à la place.)\\nTant que c\'est votre tour, la Compagnonne bouclier élégante gagne +2/+0.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Descendant des paladins de la Vieille Capenna, les Courtiers sont des maîtres du combat défensif.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555993&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e310ea57-88b1-404e-9d31-0b8480bc6aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 555993}, \'multiverseid\': 555993}, {\'name\': \'Scutifera Elegante\', \'text\': \'La Scutifera Elegante entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino scudo. (Se sta per subire danno o sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece un segnalino scudo da essa.)\\nFintanto che è il tuo turno, la Scutifera Elegante prende +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Discendenti dai paladini di Vecchia Capenna, gli Intermediari sono maestri nel combattimento difensivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c43167a8-34a4-4451-9952-1c255b104714\', \'multiverseId\': 556254}, \'multiverseid\': 556254}, {\'name\': \'粋な盾仲間\', \'text\': \'粋な盾仲間は盾カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。（これがダメージを受けるか破壊されるなら、代わりにこれの上から盾カウンター１個を取り除く。）\\nあなたのターンであるかぎり、粋な盾仲間は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'旧カペナの聖騎士の末裔ゆえに、斡旋屋一家は防衛戦闘術の達人ぞろいである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b178dde0-2b18-4746-8553-f089fc26bb36\', \'multiverseId\': 556515}, \'multiverseid\': 556515}, {\'name\': \'말쑥한 방패병\', \'text\': \'말쑥한 방패병은 방패 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다. (이 생물이 피해를 입거나 파괴되려 한다면, 대신 이 생물에서 방패 카운터 한 개를 제거한다.)\\n당신의 턴인 한, 말쑥한 방패병은 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'올드 카펜나의 성기사들의 후예인 브로커즈는 수비적인 전투의 대가들이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2584f1fa-0eb2-40bd-9309-8ad462319b6c\', \'multiverseId\': 556776}, \'multiverseid\': 556776}, {\'name\': \'Escudeira Elegante\', \'text\': \'Escudeira Elegante entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de escudo. (Se ela sofreria dano ou seria destruída, em vez disso, remova um marcador de escudo dela.)\\nEnquanto for o seu turno, Escudeira Elegante receberá +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Descendentes dos paladinos da Velha Capenna, os Mediadores são mestres do combate defensivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1ed8fd-9b35-4b0d-b870-8b998dae87d8\', \'multiverseId\': 557037}, \'multiverseid\': 557037}, {\'name\': \'Щеголеватая Щитоносица\', \'text\': \'Щеголеватая Щитоносица выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном щита на ней. (Если она должна получить повреждения или быть уничтожена, вместо этого удалите с нее один жетон щита.)\\nПока длится ваш ход, Щеголеватая Щитоносица получает +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Брокеры, потомки паладинов Старой Капенны, — мастера оборонительного боя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff2de89c-5b22-4ce6-97af-8c9a32b41140\', \'multiverseId\': 557298}, \'multiverseid\': 557298}, {\'name\': \'正装驭盾手\', \'text\': \'正装驭盾手进战场时上面有一个后盾指示物。（如果它将受到伤害或将被消灭，则改为从其上移去一个后盾指示物。）\\n只要是在你的回合中，正装驭盾手便得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'扶济社渊流自旧卡佩纳的神圣武士，精通防御战术。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d9f292c-7486-4f54-b7a3-06fd00319c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 557559}, \'multiverseid\': 557559}, {\'name\': \'正裝馭盾手\', \'text\': \'正裝馭盾手進戰場時上面有一個後盾指示物。（如果它將受到傷害或將被消滅，則改為從其上移去一個後盾指示物。）\\n只要是在你的回合中，正裝馭盾手便得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'扶濟社淵流自舊卡佩納的神聖武士，精通防禦戰術。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63de8634-3467-46f3-a59c-ebf24b1baebf\', \'multiverseId\': 557820}, \'multiverseid\': 557820}]', "[{'name': 'Aktenkoffer des Kuriers', 'text': 'Wenn der Aktenkoffer des Kuriers ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen und weißen Bürger-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{T}, opfere den Aktenkoffer des Kuriers: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, opfere den Aktenkoffer des Kuriers: Ziehe drei Karten.', 'type': 'Artefakt — Schatz', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555604&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1216d0a7-a56d-4d2d-9906-a0f6d449d87a', 'multiverseId': 555604}, 'multiverseid': 555604}, {'name': 'Maletín del mensajero', 'text': 'Cuando el Maletín del mensajero entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Ciudadano verde y blanca 1/1.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Maletín del mensajero: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, sacrificar el Maletín del mensajero: Roba tres cartas.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Tesoro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555865&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87e9a3d6-7c83-4a09-a6d9-7403111cdbd6', 'multiverseId': 555865}, 'multiverseid': 555865}, {'name': 'Mallette du messager', 'text': 'Quand la Mallette du messager arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte et blanche Citoyen.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Mallette du messager : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez la Mallette du messager : Piochez trois cartes.', 'type': 'Artefact : trésor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556126&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17ac6013-db03-49ba-9898-769400b19583', 'multiverseId': 556126}, 'multiverseid': 556126}, {'name': 'Valigetta del Corriere', 'text': 'Quando la Valigetta del Corriere entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Cittadino 1/1 verde e bianca.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Valigetta del Corriere: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica la Valigetta del Corriere: Pesca tre carte.', 'type': 'Artefatto — Tesoro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556387&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb6d3943-f812-483e-a5ae-67af41c85073', 'multiverseId': 556387}, 'multiverseid': 556387}, {'name': '急使の手提げ鞄', 'text': '急使の手提げ鞄が戦場に出たとき、緑白の１/１の市民・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{T}, 急使の手提げ鞄を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, 急使の手提げ鞄を生け贄に捧げる：カード３枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 宝物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556648&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59a81afa-2157-4df2-b43e-ccfcf32a9d66', 'multiverseId': 556648}, 'multiverseid': 556648}, {'name': '전령의 서류 가방', 'text': '전령의 서류 가방이 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 녹색 및 백색 시민 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{T}, 전령의 서류 가방을 희생한다: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, 전령의 서류 가방을 희생한다: 카드 세 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '마법물체 — 보물', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556909&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89809371-d4ca-4288-bec1-4c4b26d1424f', 'multiverseId': 556909}, 'multiverseid': 556909}, {'name': 'Pasta do Mensageiro', 'text': 'Quando Pasta do Mensageiro entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Cidadão verde e branca 1/1.\\n{T}, sacrifique Pasta do Mensageiro: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, sacrifique Pasta do Mensageiro: Compre três cards.', 'type': 'Artefato — Tesouro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557170&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87480ee0-022b-4fd6-8131-61e610d67feb', 'multiverseId': 557170}, 'multiverseid': 557170}, {'name': 'Портфель Курьера', 'text': 'Когда Портфель Курьера выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый и белый Гражданин.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте Портфель Курьера: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте Портфель Курьера: возьмите три карты.', 'type': 'Артефакт — Клад', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557431&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26ce90b6-1333-409a-a652-2e4e8776b45f', 'multiverseId': 557431}, 'multiverseid': 557431}, {'name': '讯使提箱', 'text': '当讯使提箱进战场时，派出一个1/1，绿白双色的市民衍生生物。\\n{T}，牺牲讯使提箱：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，{T}，牺牲讯使提箱：抓三张牌。', 'type': '神器 ～珍宝', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557692&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbf30dc3-c172-41b1-b2ff-0b151310239d', 'multiverseId': 557692}, 'multiverseid': 557692}, {'name': '訊使提箱', 'text': '當訊使提箱進戰場時，派出一個1/1，綠白雙色的市民衍生生物。\\n{T}，犧牲訊使提箱：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，{T}，犧牲訊使提箱：抽三張牌。', 'type': '神器 ～珍寶', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557953&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42b94c39-8381-48cb-8827-95bb7656e09b', 'multiverseId': 557953}, 'multiverseid': 557953}]", "[{'name': 'Aktenkoffer des Kuriers', 'text': 'Wenn der Aktenkoffer des Kuriers ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen und weißen Bürger-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{T}, opfere den Aktenkoffer des Kuriers: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, opfere den Aktenkoffer des Kuriers: Ziehe drei Karten.', 'type': 'Artefakt — Schatz', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558648&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b74808e8-eb7b-4043-93a9-8a7949cbed6f', 'multiverseId': 558648}, 'multiverseid': 558648}, {'name': 'Maletín del mensajero', 'text': 'Cuando el Maletín del mensajero entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Ciudadano verde y blanca 1/1.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Maletín del mensajero: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, sacrificar el Maletín del mensajero: Roba tres cartas.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Tesoro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558653&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f39efe5b-f58b-489b-aa15-8f8d95ae3b40', 'multiverseId': 558653}, 'multiverseid': 558653}, {'name': 'Mallette du messager', 'text': 'Quand la Mallette du messager arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte et blanche Citoyen.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Mallette du messager : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez la Mallette du messager : Piochez trois cartes.', 'type': 'Artefact : trésor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558658&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a9326da-0c14-4f66-bb0f-024f77558b56', 'multiverseId': 558658}, 'multiverseid': 558658}, {'name': 'Valigetta del Corriere', 'text': 'Quando la Valigetta del Corriere entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Cittadino 1/1 verde e bianca.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Valigetta del Corriere: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica la Valigetta del Corriere: Pesca tre carte.', 'type': 'Artefatto — Tesoro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558663&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94069713-5950-4a41-91e8-6d3b83b99800', 'multiverseId': 558663}, 'multiverseid': 558663}, {'name': '急使の手提げ鞄', 'text': '急使の手提げ鞄が戦場に出たとき、緑白の１/１の市民・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{T}, 急使の手提げ鞄を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, 急使の手提げ鞄を生け贄に捧げる：カード３枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 宝物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558668&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc35df95-e661-4bcd-befa-857c70991cd4', 'multiverseId': 558668}, 'multiverseid': 558668}, {'name': '전령의 서류 가방', 'text': '전령의 서류 가방이 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 녹색 및 백색 시민 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{T}, 전령의 서류 가방을 희생한다: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, 전령의 서류 가방을 희생한다: 카드 세 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '마법물체 — 보물', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558673&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c995dbd7-6199-4226-b58c-0748316fff18', 'multiverseId': 558673}, 'multiverseid': 558673}, {'name': 'Pasta do Mensageiro', 'text': 'Quando Pasta do Mensageiro entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Cidadão verde e branca 1/1.\\n{T}, sacrifique Pasta do Mensageiro: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, sacrifique Pasta do Mensageiro: Compre três cards.', 'type': 'Artefato — Tesouro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558678&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c8de6d3-ef81-4d17-8971-71a3a92cdf1c', 'multiverseId': 558678}, 'multiverseid': 558678}, {'name': 'Портфель Курьера', 'text': 'Когда Портфель Курьера выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый и белый Гражданин.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте Портфель Курьера: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте Портфель Курьера: возьмите три карты.', 'type': 'Артефакт — Клад', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558683&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5bbf627-46a2-482c-afc8-8d8533060b23', 'multiverseId': 558683}, 'multiverseid': 558683}, {'name': '讯使提箱', 'text': '当讯使提箱进战场时，派出一个1/1，绿白双色的市民衍生生物。\\n{T}，牺牲讯使提箱：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，{T}，牺牲讯使提箱：抓三张牌。', 'type': '神器 ～珍宝', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558688&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7642deb2-71d8-4806-bfbd-70c2cb68d9c6', 'multiverseId': 558688}, 'multiverseid': 558688}, {'name': '訊使提箱', 'text': '當訊使提箱進戰場時，派出一個1/1，綠白雙色的市民衍生生物。\\n{T}，犧牲訊使提箱：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}，{T}，犧牲訊使提箱：抽三張牌。', 'type': '神器 ～珍寶', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558693&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10d71a36-f6be-4333-92f4-d413692bc7c7', 'multiverseId': 558693}, 'multiverseid': 558693}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aktenvernichter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler seinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkt, intrigiert der Aktenvernichter. (Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab. Falls du eine Nichtland-Karte abgeworfen hast, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'Keine Beweise, kein Verbrechen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'620d7870-8b74-470d-bdf7-f8d4b50537fd\', \'multiverseId\': 555508}, \'multiverseid\': 555508}, {\'name\': \'Triturador de libros mayores\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un jugador lance su segundo hechizo cada turno, el Triturador de libros mayores confabula. (Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta. Si descartaste una carta que no sea tierra, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero ave\', \'flavor\': \'Sin pruebas no hay crimen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39bee83a-5dea-42bb-8da8-1309b025bf24\', \'multiverseId\': 555769}, \'multiverseid\': 555769}, {\'name\': \'Déchiqueteur de registres\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance son deuxième sort à chaque tour, le Déchiqueteur de registres connive. (Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte. Si vous vous êtes défaussé d\'une carte non-terrain, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'Pas de preuve, pas de crime.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556030&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a8ebfd6-10d1-41d5-a906-d6b507919a2e\', \'multiverseId\': 556030}, \'multiverseid\': 556030}, {\'name\': \'Trituratore di Libri Mastri\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore lancia la sua seconda magia in ogni turno, il Trituratore di Libri Mastri complotta. (Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta. Se hai scartato una carta non terra, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Nessuna prova, nessun crimine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26677220-9d42-40db-ae7d-bf6f0448b384\', \'multiverseId\': 556291}, \'multiverseid\': 556291}, {\'name\': \'帳簿裂き\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nプレイヤー１人が各ターンの自分の２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、帳簿裂きは謀議する。（カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。あなたが土地でないカードを捨てたなら、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'証拠がなければ、犯罪もない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e75eae-a93f-4751-9230-f8a8ae08a031\', \'multiverseId\': 556552}, \'multiverseid\': 556552}, {\'name\': \'거래원장 파쇄자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n플레이어가 매 턴 자신의 두 번째 주문을 발동할 때마다, 거래원장 파쇄자는 묵인한다. (카드 한 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다. 당신이 대지가 아닌 카드를 버린다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 참모\', \'flavor\': \'증거가 없으면, 범죄도 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6020af-759e-45c6-9ea8-1c94bbbf5f16\', \'multiverseId\': 556813}, \'multiverseid\': 556813}, {\'name\': \'Picotador de Livros-caixa\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que um jogador conjura a própria segunda mágica a cada turno, Picotador de Livros-caixa acoberta. (Compre um card e depois descarte um card. Se você descartou um card não de terreno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'Sem prova, sem crime.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5acd04c3-49fc-499e-9a73-ef1a3f44a445\', \'multiverseId\': 557074}, \'multiverseid\': 557074}, {\'name\': \'Уничтожитель Записей\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает свое второе заклинание в каждом ходу, Уничтожитель Записей сговаривается. (Возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту. Если вы сбросили не являющуюся землей карту, положите один жетон +1/+1 на это существо.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Советник\', \'flavor\': \'Нет улик — нет преступления.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9da3d908-2ead-4c04-83a7-d9d5d9b803a0\', \'multiverseId\': 557335}, \'multiverseid\': 557335}, {\'name\': \'碎帐艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当任一牌手施放每回合中他的第二个咒语时，令碎帐艾文筹谋。（抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。如果你弃的牌不是地，则在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'没有证据，就不算犯罪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8306bc57-cf1b-47bf-b0cd-aa8d4b98a185\', \'multiverseId\': 557596}, \'multiverseid\': 557596}, {\'name\': \'碎帳艾文\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當任一玩家施放每回合中他的第二個咒語時，令碎帳艾文籌謀。（抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。如果你棄的牌不是地，則在此生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥／參謀\', \'flavor\': \'沒有證據，就不算犯罪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5739746-cb79-453e-8ebb-679c435b8518\', \'multiverseId\': 557857}, \'multiverseid\': 557857}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aktenvernichter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler seinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkt, intrigiert der Aktenvernichter.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558285&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98f5882f-b9a9-45dc-bc4e-8c13bfdd0720\', \'multiverseId\': 558285}, \'multiverseid\': 558285}, {\'name\': \'Déchiqueteur de registres\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance son deuxième sort à chaque tour, le Déchiqueteur de registres connive.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558320&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec743df2-7263-4ea8-991a-75657135e283\', \'multiverseId\': 558320}, \'multiverseid\': 558320}, {\'name\': \'帳簿裂き\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nプレイヤー１人が各ターンの自分の２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、帳簿裂きは謀議する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'329b9d74-0d5c-4d2c-a0a2-4464782ff0cf\', \'multiverseId\': 558355}, \'multiverseid\': 558355}, {\'name\': \'碎帐艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当任一牌手施放每回合中他的第二个咒语时，令碎帐艾文筹谋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56575407-cc1e-4973-aed7-fa8d9b35da3e\', \'multiverseId\': 558390}, \'multiverseid\': 558390}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allsehender Schlichter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Allsehende Schlichter ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte abwirfst, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, bis zu deinem nächsten Zug -X/-0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Manabeträgen unter den Karten in deinem Friedhof ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b639f7-0cca-4f65-9134-29c3a62a0ced\', \'multiverseId\': 555496}, \'multiverseid\': 555496}, {\'name\': \'Árbitro omnividente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Árbitro omnividente entre al campo de batalla o ataque, roba dos cartas y luego descarta una carta.\\nSiempre que descartes una carta, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -X/-0 hasta tu próximo turno, donde X es la cantidad de valores de maná distintos entre las cartas de tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13507ce0-48d8-4638-a273-1d5b99261cb2\', \'multiverseId\': 555757}, \'multiverseid\': 555757}, {\'name\': \'Arbitre omniscient\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Arbitre omniscient arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous vous défaussez d\'une carte, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -X/-0 jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, X étant le nombre de cartes avec des valeurs de mana différentes parmi les cartes de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556018&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'041d25ea-fb79-4d67-ab54-43a5cf30e9b7\', \'multiverseId\': 556018}, \'multiverseid\': 556018}, {\'name\': \'Giudice Onniveggente\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Giudice Onniveggente entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, pesca due carte, poi scarta una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta scarti una carta, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -X/-0 fino al tuo prossimo turno, dove X è il numero di valori di mana diversi tra le carte nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'482fb74f-ef7b-49ed-b9e2-7c41f5398baa\', \'multiverseId\': 556279}, \'multiverseid\': 556279}, {\'name\': \'全知の調停者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n全知の調停者が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード２枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\nあなたがカード１枚を捨てるたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。次のあなたのターンまで、それは－Ｘ/－０の修整を受ける。Ｘは、あなたの墓地にあるすべてのカードの中のマナ総量の種類数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b9ba2d8-ec5f-4269-9653-929281a2141a\', \'multiverseId\': 556540}, \'multiverseid\': 556540}, {\'name\': \'모든 것을 보는 재판관\', \'text\': \'비행\\n모든 것을 보는 재판관이 전장에 들어오거나 공격할 때마다, 카드 두 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n당신이 카드를 버릴 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 당신의 다음 턴까지 -X/-0을 받는다. X는 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드들의 서로 다른 마나 값의 수이다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 화신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c7df4c1-addf-4462-9daf-c4e04838db50\', \'multiverseId\': 556801}, \'multiverseid\': 556801}, {\'name\': \'Árbitro Onisciente\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Árbitro Onisciente entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, compre dois cards e depois descarte um card.\\nToda vez que você descarta um card, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -X/-0 até seu próximo turno, sendo X o número de valores de mana diferentes entre os dos cards em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7343edf2-848f-4113-8659-8e8ec1b4edd9\', \'multiverseId\': 557062}, \'multiverseid\': 557062}, {\'name\': \'Всевидящий Арбитр\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Всевидящий Арбитр выходит на поле битвы или атакует, возьмите две карты, затем сбросьте карту.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы сбрасываете карту, целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -X/-0 до вашего следующего хода, где X — количество разных значений мановой ценности среди карт на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Аватара\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1dd2156-a1e2-4af9-b10b-6eead639d81e\', \'multiverseId\': 557323}, \'multiverseid\': 557323}, {\'name\': \'全视仲裁者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当全视仲裁者进战场或攻击时，抓两张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n每当你弃一张牌时，目标由对手操控的生物得-X/-0直到你的下一个回合，X为你坟墓场中牌的不同法术力值种数。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c0b9752-65e7-47ec-b680-be8185342e84\', \'multiverseId\': 557584}, \'multiverseid\': 557584}, {\'name\': \'全視仲裁者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當全視仲裁者進戰場或攻擊時，抽兩張牌，然後棄一張牌。\\n每當你棄一張牌時，目標由對手操控的生物得-X/-0直到你的下一個回合，X為你墳墓場中牌的不同魔法力值種數。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～聖者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce2eef67-0936-4184-98f1-05f6c88f76ad\', \'multiverseId\': 557845}, \'multiverseid\': 557845}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allsehender Schlichter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Allsehende Schlichter ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte abwirfst, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, bis zu deinem nächsten Zug -X/-0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Manabeträgen unter den Karten in deinem Friedhof ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558431&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf65024a-f2fe-4e26-98bc-c329b3f4c50c\', \'multiverseId\': 558431}, \'multiverseid\': 558431}, {\'name\': \'Árbitro omnividente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Árbitro omnividente entre al campo de batalla o ataque, roba dos cartas y luego descarta una carta.\\nSiempre que descartes una carta, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -X/-0 hasta tu próximo turno, donde X es la cantidad de valores de maná distintos entre las cartas de tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832069d4-0f69-4cac-aa6b-7e9c3cacdf84\', \'multiverseId\': 558442}, \'multiverseid\': 558442}, {\'name\': \'Arbitre omniscient\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Arbitre omniscient arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous vous défaussez d\'une carte, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -X/-0 jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, X étant le nombre de cartes avec des valeurs de mana différentes parmi les cartes de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c20fb5d3-5b76-4859-8a7c-edc3b8be02c5\', \'multiverseId\': 558453}, \'multiverseid\': 558453}, {\'name\': \'Giudice Onniveggente\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Giudice Onniveggente entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, pesca due carte, poi scarta una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta scarti una carta, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -X/-0 fino al tuo prossimo turno, dove X è il numero di valori di mana diversi tra le carte nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d5c417-160f-4f6f-b684-9a5e377bbba6\', \'multiverseId\': 558464}, \'multiverseid\': 558464}, {\'name\': \'全知の調停者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n全知の調停者が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、カード２枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\nあなたがカード１枚を捨てるたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。次のあなたのターンまで、それは－Ｘ/－０の修整を受ける。Ｘは、あなたの墓地にあるすべてのカードの中のマナ総量の種類数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0ad91ef-8f7e-4bfc-aa85-b6681999d0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 558475}, \'multiverseid\': 558475}, {\'name\': \'모든 것을 보는 재판관\', \'text\': \'비행\\n모든 것을 보는 재판관이 전장에 들어오거나 공격할 때마다, 카드 두 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n당신이 카드를 버릴 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 당신의 다음 턴까지 -X/-0을 받는다. X는 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드들의 서로 다른 마나 값의 수이다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 화신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'389f8348-4198-4a38-9cb0-4f3fb9fe4bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 558486}, \'multiverseid\': 558486}, {\'name\': \'Árbitro Onisciente\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Árbitro Onisciente entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, compre dois cards e depois descarte um card.\\nToda vez que você descarta um card, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -X/-0 até seu próximo turno, sendo, X o número de valores de mana diferentes entre os dos cards em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ddad05-d331-46dc-a365-ca3fb702b23f\', \'multiverseId\': 558497}, \'multiverseid\': 558497}, {\'name\': \'Всевидящий Арбитр\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Всевидящий Арбитр выходит на поле битвы или атакует, возьмите две карты, затем сбросьте карту.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы сбрасываете карту, целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -X/-0 до вашего следующего хода, где X — количество разных значений мановой ценности среди карт на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Аватара\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab7cc855-d470-4ea4-a73e-9adbd2689a04\', \'multiverseId\': 558508}, \'multiverseid\': 558508}, {\'name\': \'全视仲裁者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当全视仲裁者进战场或攻击时，抓两张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n每当你弃一张牌时，目标由对手操控的生物得-X/-0直到你的下一个回合，X为你坟墓场中牌的不同法术力值种数。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a87e2d5-6267-45e0-bdc5-655d526e6d52\', \'multiverseId\': 558519}, \'multiverseid\': 558519}, {\'name\': \'全視仲裁者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當全視仲裁者進戰場或攻擊時，抽兩張牌，然後棄一張牌。\\n每當你棄一張牌時，目標由對手操控的生物得-X/-0直到你的下一個回合，X為你墳墓場中牌的不同魔法力值種數。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～聖者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0664e75-b03f-46b8-9c15-5a4e1b2fa9c9\', \'multiverseId\': 558530}, \'multiverseid\': 558530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriff auf die Bausubstanz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Artefakte. Dann fügt der Angriff auf die Bausubstanz jeder Kreatur Schaden in Höhe der Anzahl an Artefakten zu, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel auf Friedhöfe gelegt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Nach dem Angriff auf die Vantoleone war das zerbrechliche Gleichgewicht der Kräfte endgültig erschüttert und die Stadt versank im Chaos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a365617-a934-4928-8c20-e9e6f60876fc\', \'multiverseId\': 555588}, \'multiverseid\': 555588}, {\'name\': \'Asalto estructural\', \'text\': \'Destruye todos los artefactos, luego el Asalto estructural hace una cantidad de daño a cada criatura igual a la cantidad de artefactos que fueron a cementerios desde el campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Tras el ataque al Vantoleone, el frágil equilibrio de poder se derrumbó del todo y la ciudad se sumió en el caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'774cc0c7-df55-45bc-a74b-3f3ee7d44887\', \'multiverseId\': 555849}, \'multiverseid\': 555849}, {\'name\': \'Assaut structurel\', \'text\': "Détruisez tous les artefacts, puis l\'Assaut structurel inflige à chaque créature un nombre de blessures égal au nombre d\'artefacts qui ont été mis dans des cimetières depuis le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Après l\'attaque du Vantoleone, l\'équilibre fragile du pouvoir fut brisé, et la ville sombra dans le chaos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f76e2c7-c8bb-4adb-a3a7-5652f31ad73e\', \'multiverseId\': 556110}, \'multiverseid\': 556110}, {\'name\': \'Assalto Strutturale\', \'text\': "Distruggi tutti gli artefatti, poi l\'Assalto Strutturale infligge a ogni creatura danno pari al numero di artefatti che sono stati messi nei cimiteri dal campo di battaglia in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Dopo l\'assalto al Vantoleone, il fragile equilibrio di potere si infranse completamente e la città precipitò nel caos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca38a2c6-5605-4841-97fc-cb8cd4c0a116\', \'multiverseId\': 556371}, \'multiverseid\': 556371}, {\'name\': \'構造的突撃\', \'text\': \'すべてのアーティファクトを破壊し、その後構造的突撃は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、このターンに戦場から墓地に置かれたアーティファクトの数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ヴァントリオーネへの攻撃の後、脆かった力の均衡は跡形もなく砕かれ、都市は混乱に陥った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78020a28-54b1-4c8e-88ce-089286b2749d\', \'multiverseId\': 556632}, \'multiverseid\': 556632}, {\'name\': \'구조적 공습\', \'text\': \'모든 마법물체를 파괴한 후, 구조적 공습은 각 생물에게 이 턴에 전장에서 무덤에 놓인 마법물체의 수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'반톨레오네가 공격받은 후, 취약한 힘의 균형이 완전히 깨지면서 도시는 혼란에 빠졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6db785a8-725e-409a-9054-cd2c5f9ac920\', \'multiverseId\': 556893}, \'multiverseid\': 556893}, {\'name\': \'Assalto Estrutural\', \'text\': \'Destrua todos os artefatos. Depois, Assalto Estrutural causa a cada criatura dano igual ao número de artefatos colocados em cemitérios vindos do campo de batalha neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Depois do ataque ao Vantoleone, o frágil equilíbrio do poder foi completamente despedaçado e a cidade mergulhou no caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3e5f4f0-e300-4b76-a33e-25e691dd06d7\', \'multiverseId\': 557154}, \'multiverseid\': 557154}, {\'name\': \'Структурное Нападение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все артефакты, затем Структурное Нападение наносит каждому существу повреждения, равные количеству артефактов, которые были положены на кладбища с поля битвы в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'После нападения на Вантолеоне хрупкий баланс сил обрушился окончательно, и город погрузился в хаос.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eccc7be-1ff9-4614-8769-3a789950ffa1\', \'multiverseId\': 557415}, \'multiverseid\': 557415}, {\'name\': \'摧朽突袭\', \'text\': \'消灭所有神器，然后摧朽突袭对每个生物各造成伤害，其数量等同于本回合中从战场进入坟墓场的神器数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'万通汇遭袭后，各势力间本就脆弱的平衡被彻底打破，城市陷入混乱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b558554e-f941-467c-9792-ea5bfc549184\', \'multiverseId\': 557676}, \'multiverseid\': 557676}, {\'name\': \'摧朽突襲\', \'text\': \'消滅所有神器，然後摧朽突襲對每個生物各造成傷害，其數量等同於本回合中從戰場進入墳墓場的神器數量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'萬通匯遭襲後，各勢力間本就脆弱的平衡被徹底打破，城市陷入混亂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d65d0e-8b75-4a6a-8606-79fc118d66aa\', \'multiverseId\': 557937}, \'multiverseid\': 557937}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriff auf die Bausubstanz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Artefakte. Dann fügt der Angriff auf die Bausubstanz jeder Kreatur Schaden in Höhe der Anzahl an Artefakten zu, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel auf Friedhöfe gelegt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558300&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad854d4-c780-4b15-b2b4-69bd60dc8a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 558300}, \'multiverseid\': 558300}, {\'name\': \'Assaut structurel\', \'text\': "Détruisez tous les artefacts, puis l\'Assaut structurel inflige à chaque créature un nombre de blessures égal au nombre d\'artefacts qui ont été mis dans des cimetières depuis le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558335&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e10110b-8bac-4467-b0a1-69aa757f0469\', \'multiverseId\': 558335}, \'multiverseid\': 558335}, {\'name\': \'構造的突撃\', \'text\': \'すべてのアーティファクトを破壊し、その後構造的突撃は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、このターンに戦場から墓地に置かれたアーティファクトの数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15e8a9ac-9d6b-481c-aa33-3206df6aa160\', \'multiverseId\': 558370}, \'multiverseid\': 558370}, {\'name\': \'摧朽突袭\', \'text\': \'消灭所有神器，然后摧朽突袭对每个生物各造成伤害，其数量等同于本回合中从战场进入坟墓场的神器数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6ed7165-0e60-4f94-bd93-7f664c059333\', \'multiverseId\': 558405}, \'multiverseid\': 558405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Antagonisieren\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +4/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zumindest hatte der kleine Kerl Mumm in den Knochen. Den kannst du jetzt zwischen den Pflastersteinen zusammensuchen."\\n—Glunk, freiberuflicher Schläger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6b16be-fe99-4338-b067-5a1fc250879a\', \'multiverseId\': 555562}, \'multiverseid\': 555562}, {\'name\': \'Contrariar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +4/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Al menos el pequeñín demostró de qué pasta estaba hecho. Mira, es esa que hay entre los adoquines".\\n—Glunk, aplastador autónomo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e45c05-7bd8-4b21-90d0-8177cf4d5b5b\', \'multiverseId\': 555823}, \'multiverseid\': 555823}, {\'name\': \'Asticoter\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +4/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Au moins, le petit gars avait des tripes. On peut les voir juste ici entre les pavés. »\\n—Glunk, écrabouilleur indépendant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53f54f26-5b24-483f-bbf0-a4b9d60c4fce\', \'multiverseId\': 556084}, \'multiverseid\': 556084}, {\'name\': \'Contrapporsi\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +4/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il piccoletto almeno aveva fegato. Lo si può ancora vedere lì, sul selciato."\\n—Glunk, frantumatore prezzolato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25b6e7b-b9ac-4002-ab00-ea73c6ae1028\', \'multiverseId\': 556345}, \'multiverseid\': 556345}, {\'name\': \'反感煽り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋４/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あのチビ、肝だけは据わっていたようだな。石畳の間に残っているのが見えるだろう。」\\n――無所属の破壊屋、グランク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8f461f9-0243-4f59-a435-cfb77a7702a1\', \'multiverseId\': 556606}, \'multiverseid\': 556606}, {\'name\': \'화내게 만들기\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +4/+3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그 작은 놈은 최소한 배짱이라도 있었지. 저기 자갈들 사이에 콕 박혀 있는 걸 보면 알 거야."\\n—프리랜서 난동꾼, 글렁크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e0b2cae-e626-4a08-9f47-d9dc415faec2\', \'multiverseId\': 556867}, \'multiverseid\': 556867}, {\'name\': \'Antagonizar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +4/+3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Pelo menos o baixinho tinha estofo. Tem um pouco dele ainda ali entre os paralelepípedos."\\n— Glunk, esmagador de aluguel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac082b2a-0cd8-421a-a51c-417bfe4eb99b\', \'multiverseId\': 557128}, \'multiverseid\': 557128}, {\'name\': \'Неприятие\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +4/+3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Ну, по крайней мере, кишка у малыша оказалась не тонка. Вон она, валяется на брусчатке».\\n— Гланк, наемный крушила\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85befc86-216d-4b55-9984-019d63da697d\', \'multiverseId\': 557389}, \'multiverseid\': 557389}, {\'name\': \'挑衅\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+4/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「那矮子胆子还挺大。你可以去瞧瞧，就散在那些鹅卵石之间。」\\n～猛击包工葛朗克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9c3a72-5b09-43e2-b4e4-5ec68dec1c74\', \'multiverseId\': 557650}, \'multiverseid\': 557650}, {\'name\': \'挑釁\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+4/+3直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「那矮子膽子還挺大。你可以去瞧瞧，就散在那些鵝卵石之間。」\\n～猛擊包工葛朗克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2977430a-de27-4446-840e-d72f7a1d96bc\', \'multiverseId\': 557911}, \'multiverseid\': 557911}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archivraub\', \'text\': \'Todesopfer 1 (Sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 1 oder mehr opfern. Wenn du dies tust, kopiere diesen Zauberspruch.)\\nSchicke die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Tja, Tarnung kommt wohl nicht infrage."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555584&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed45fd9a-96f5-44a1-ac2c-2e5e56d61bac\', \'multiverseId\': 555584}, \'multiverseid\': 555584}, {\'name\': \'Robar los archivos\', \'text\': \'Victimizar 1. (Al lanzar este hechizo, puedes sacrificar una criatura con fuerza de 1 o más. Cuando lo hagas, copia este hechizo.)\\nExilia las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esas cartas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Bueno, veo que ser sigiloso no es una opción".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a139e67e-39fa-4192-8843-6987e48376c5\', \'multiverseId\': 555845}, \'multiverseid\': 555845}, {\'name\': \'Piller les archives\', \'text\': \'Victime 1 (Au moment où vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez sacrifier une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 1. Quand vous faites ainsi, copiez ce sort.)\\nExilez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer ces cartes ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Eh bien, au diable la discrétion, je suppose. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556106&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c27d4a4-0993-406f-803b-e1c0c40770ad\', \'multiverseId\': 556106}, \'multiverseid\': 556106}, {\'name\': \'Depredare gli Archivi\', \'text\': \'Danno collaterale 1 (Mentre lanci questa magia, puoi sacrificare una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 1. Quando lo fai, copia questa magia.)\\nEsilia le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quelle carte in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Beh, immagino che la furtività sia fuori questione."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c38c0f-5661-461b-9292-975049c7b3b7\', \'multiverseId\': 556367}, \'multiverseid\': 556367}, {\'name\': \'書庫荒らし\', \'text\': \'犠牲１（あなたがこの呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはパワーが１以上であるクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、この呪文をコピーする。）\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「隠密行動はもう無理だろうな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f602b3df-f7a8-4dd7-9a9b-c1a021115864\', \'multiverseId\': 556628}, \'multiverseid\': 556628}, {\'name\': \'기록보관소 털기\', \'text\': \'사상자 1 (이 주문을 발동하면서, 당신은 공격력이 1 이상인 생물 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 이 주문을 복사한다.)\\n당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드들을 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"음, 아무래도 은밀 행동은 불가능한 것 같네."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25173d7b-6711-4faf-8e99-2578ff61ccda\', \'multiverseId\': 556889}, \'multiverseid\': 556889}, {\'name\': \'Roubar os Arquivos\', \'text\': \'Baixa 1 (Conforme você conjura esta mágica, você pode sacrificar uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 1. Quando fizer isso, copie esta mágica.)\\nExile os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aqueles cards neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Bom, acho que a furtividade está fora de cogitação."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43d164ee-1310-420b-8c2c-948fdc3eb11f\', \'multiverseId\': 557150}, \'multiverseid\': 557150}, {\'name\': \'Ограбить Архивы\', \'text\': \'Потери 1 (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете пожертвовать существо с силой 1 или больше. Когда вы это делаете, скопируйте это заклинание.)\\nИзгоните две верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть те карты в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Что ж, похоже, про скрытность не может быть и речи».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b105a4ea-b1a4-445e-87a2-1a4bcb46a001\', \'multiverseId\': 557411}, \'multiverseid\': 557411}, {\'name\': \'袭劫档案\', \'text\': \'催命1（于你施放此咒语时，你可以牺牲一个力量等于或大于1的生物。当你如此作时，复制此咒语。）\\n放逐你牌库顶的两张牌。本回合中，你可以使用这些牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「看来，再想隐蔽是不可能了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddd23c85-56c9-4a16-9833-8a907be9cbb2\', \'multiverseId\': 557672}, \'multiverseid\': 557672}, {\'name\': \'襲劫檔案\', \'text\': \'催命1（於你施放此咒語時，你可以犧牲一個力量等於或大於1的生物。當你如此作時，複製此咒語。）\\n放逐你牌庫頂的兩張牌。本回合中，你可以使用這些牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「看來，再想隱蔽是不可能了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fec1e53c-3447-4766-9f56-d6d7242e789a\', \'multiverseId\': 557933}, \'multiverseid\': 557933}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Beschuss\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deinen ersten Spontanzauber oder deine erste Hexerei in jedem Zug wirkst, schicke eine per Zufall bestimmte Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere dann jede Karte, die vom Arkanen Beschuss ins Exil geschickt wurde. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl der Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e183fa52-180a-4468-8f0c-259ba8a368a7\', \'multiverseId\': 555563}, \'multiverseid\': 555563}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeo arcano\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances tu primer hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro cada turno, exilia una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro al azar de tu cementerio. Luego, copia cada carta exiliada con el Bombardeo arcano. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de esas copias sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5630f31-a25d-45d8-bba8-1a2244523a64\', \'multiverseId\': 555824}, \'multiverseid\': 555824}, {\'name\': \'Bombardement ésotérique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel à chaque tour, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel au hasard depuis votre cimetière. Puis copiez chaque carte exilée par le Bombardement ésotérique. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de copies sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556085&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83e61ed1-12f3-410b-b042-22994e3b04c2\', \'multiverseId\': 556085}, \'multiverseid\': 556085}, {\'name\': \'Bombardamento Arcano\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci la tua prima magia istantaneo o stregoneria in ogni turno, esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria a caso dal tuo cimitero. Poi copia ogni carta esiliata con il Bombardamento Arcano. Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di copie senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b2ed152-a730-4531-809a-0680c14634dd\', \'multiverseId\': 556346}, \'multiverseid\': 556346}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の砲撃\', \'text\': \'あなたが、各ターン内のあなたの１つ目のインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を無作為に選び、追放する。その後、秘儀の砲撃によって追放されている各カードをそれぞれコピーする。あなたはそれらの各コピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'433a3dd2-5bd9-4ecd-88dd-73fc8137f459\', \'multiverseId\': 556607}, \'multiverseid\': 556607}, {\'name\': \'신비한 폭격\', \'text\': \'당신이 매 턴 당신의 첫 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신의 무덤에서 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드 한 장을 무작위로 추방한다. 그 후 신비한 폭격으로 추방된 각 카드를 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본들을 원하는 수만큼 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c47dd7b0-767b-4e80-a06c-36076714b3b7\', \'multiverseId\': 556868}, \'multiverseid\': 556868}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeio Arcano\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar sua primeira mágica instantânea ou feitiço a cada turno, exile aleatoriamente um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço de seu cemitério. Depois, copie cada card exilado com Bombardeio Arcano. Você pode conjurar qualquer número dessas cópias sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b161e6b-4827-4aee-89d8-87696b76bb17\', \'multiverseId\': 557129}, \'multiverseid\': 557129}, {\'name\': \'Волшебный Залп\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете ваше первое мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства в каждом ходу, изгоните выбранную случайным образом карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища. Затем скопируйте каждую карту, изгнанную Волшебным Залпом. Вы можете разыграть любое количество тех копий без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32758197-f558-4b9e-99e0-e1c58560fef5\', \'multiverseId\': 557390}, \'multiverseid\': 557390}, {\'name\': \'秘法轰炸\', \'text\': \'每当你施放每回合中你的第一个瞬间或法术咒语时，随机从你的坟墓场放逐一张瞬间或法术牌。然后复制每张以秘法轰炸放逐的牌。你可以施放任意数量的复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8335e768-093c-4152-8422-d1c1b13d65a9\', \'multiverseId\': 557651}, \'multiverseid\': 557651}, {\'name\': \'秘法轟炸\', \'text\': \'每當你施放每回合中你的第一個瞬間或巫術咒語時，隨機從你的墳墓場放逐一張瞬間或巫術牌。然後複製每張以秘法轟炸放逐的牌。你可以施放任意數量的複製品，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'579e54f1-ed82-4cbc-bccc-4e90a36a12db\', \'multiverseId\': 557912}, \'multiverseid\': 557912}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Beschuss\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deinen ersten Spontanzauber oder deine erste Hexerei in jedem Zug wirkst, schicke eine per Zufall bestimmte Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere dann jede Karte, die vom Arkanen Beschuss ins Exil geschickt wurde. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl der Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558295&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f79fd38f-cf51-4989-9a2d-65f15256db50\', \'multiverseId\': 558295}, \'multiverseid\': 558295}, {\'name\': \'Bombardement ésotérique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel à chaque tour, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel au hasard depuis votre cimetière. Puis copiez chaque carte exilée par le Bombardement ésotérique. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de copies sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558330&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf45bba9-bb59-43fa-bd98-6e71dd077348\', \'multiverseId\': 558330}, \'multiverseid\': 558330}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の砲撃\', \'text\': \'あなたが、各ターン内のあなたの１つ目のインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を無作為に選び、追放する。その後、秘儀の砲撃によって追放されている各カードをそれぞれコピーする。あなたはそれらの各コピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2264dced-b2d4-415b-a337-c60d2992cbf3\', \'multiverseId\': 558365}, \'multiverseid\': 558365}, {\'name\': \'秘法轰炸\', \'text\': \'每当你施放每回合中你的第一个瞬间或法术咒语时，随机从你的坟墓场放逐一张瞬间或法术牌。然后复制每张以秘法轰炸放逐的牌。你可以施放任意数量的复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a97fbe1-9464-4b03-9ffd-3fa1fae1f72d\', \'multiverseId\': 558400}, \'multiverseid\': 558400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Assistentin des Magiers\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Assistentin des Magiers ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Zauberer-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{1}, opfere diese Kreatur: Neutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {1}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Das Verbrechen macht manchmal aus unerwarteten Allianzen lebenslange Freundschaften.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8aacc40-e1ea-48f2-87b0-ada0bdd64d66\', \'multiverseId\': 555483}, \'multiverseid\': 555483}, {\'name\': \'Asistente de la maga\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Asistente de la maga entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Hechicero azul 1/1 con "{1}, sacrificar esta criatura: Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura a menos que su controlador pague {1}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón felino\', \'flavor\': \'A veces, el crimen convierte a los aliados más inesperados en amigos de por vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb03b08-a726-478e-844c-3218a929799f\', \'multiverseId\': 555744}, \'multiverseid\': 555744}, {\'name\': \'Suivante du mage\', \'text\': \'Quand la Suivante du mage arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Sorcier avec « {1}, sacrifiez cette créature : Contrecarrez un sort non-créature ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {1}. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Dans le crime, les alliés improbables deviennent parfois des amis pour la vie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556005&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab825d70-67fe-4b68-b944-bc9c058eb00b\', \'multiverseId\': 556005}, \'multiverseid\': 556005}, {\'name\': \'Attendente della Maga\', \'text\': \'Quando l\\\'Attendente della Maga entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Mago 1/1 blu con "{1}, Sacrifica questa creatura: Neutralizza una magia non creatura bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {1}".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Il crimine a volte trasforma degli alleati improbabili in amici di una vita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'079b6422-013d-4587-86c0-d480086ec27b\', \'multiverseId\': 556266}, \'multiverseid\': 556266}, {\'name\': \'魔道士の従者\', \'text\': \'魔道士の従者が戦場に出たとき、「{1}, このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。」を持つ青の１/１のウィザード・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'犯罪によって、思いがけない仲間が生涯の友になることもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'222692ec-7c60-452e-bc75-446900b5c03a\', \'multiverseId\': 556527}, \'multiverseid\': 556527}, {\'name\': \'마도사의 수행원\', \'text\': \'마도사의 수행원이 전장에 들어올 때, "{1}, 이 생물을 희생한다: 생물이 아닌 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {1}을 지불하지 않는 한 그 주문을 무효화한다."를 가진 1/1 청색 마법사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 도적\', \'flavor\': \'범죄는 때때로 불가능해 보이는 동맹을 평생의 친구로 만들어 준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4813c732-5d3a-4149-92fa-8c362833d3ec\', \'multiverseId\': 556788}, \'multiverseid\': 556788}, {\'name\': \'Assistente de Mago\', \'text\': \'Quando Assistente de Mago entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Mago azul 1/1 com "{1}, sacrifique esta criatura: Anule a mágica não de criatura alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {1}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'O crime às vezes transforma aliados improváveis em amigos pelo resto da vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12899af9-8277-4a64-9cf8-047a0f131938\', \'multiverseId\': 557049}, \'multiverseid\': 557049}, {\'name\': \'Помощница Мага\', \'text\': \'Когда Помощница Мага выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 синий Чародей со способностью «{1}, пожертвуйте это существо: отмените целевое не являющееся существом заклинание, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {1}».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Преступление иногда превращает случайных союзников в друзей на всю жизнь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a8779c1-6b56-4f47-b62d-141525ad52fb\', \'multiverseId\': 557310}, \'multiverseid\': 557310}, {\'name\': \'法师随员\', \'text\': \'当法师随员进战场时，派出一个1/1蓝色法术师衍生生物，且具有「{1}，牺牲此生物：除非目标非生物咒语的操控者支付{1}，否则反击之。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'脱法之举有时能将机缘凑合的同伙化为终生相随的朋友。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5bcc8c-ad2b-4acf-989d-a2c134fa828a\', \'multiverseId\': 557571}, \'multiverseid\': 557571}, {\'name\': \'法師隨員\', \'text\': \'當法師隨員進戰場時，派出一個1/1藍色魔法師衍生生物，且具有「{1}，犧牲此生物：除非目標非生物咒語的操控者支付{1}，否則反擊之。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'脫法之舉有時能將機緣湊合的同夥化為終生相隨的朋友。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5e5470-4eb6-4e0c-8608-34d7d4c8b49c\', \'multiverseId\': 557832}, \'multiverseid\': 557832}]', "[{'name': 'Atrium der Cabaretti', 'text': 'Wenn das Atrium der Cabaretti ins Spiel kommt, opfere es. Wenn du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Gebirge-, Wald- oder Ebene-Standardlandkarte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach. Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Solange das Halo weiter fließt, werden die Feierlichkeiten weitergehen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555711&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be556d69-cf2c-4689-805d-f3fda98f857d', 'multiverseId': 555711}, 'multiverseid': 555711}, {'name': 'Patio de los Cabaretti', 'text': 'Cuando el Patio de los Cabaretti entre al campo de batalla, sacrifícalo. Cuando lo hagas, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Montaña, Bosque o Llanura básica y ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Luego baraja y ganas 1 vida.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Mientras siga fluyendo halo, las fiestas no pararán.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555972&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d4aee4f-7a94-446e-8e3a-48fef50d0f20', 'multiverseId': 555972}, 'multiverseid': 555972}, {'name': 'Cour des Cabaretti', 'text': 'Quand la Cour des Cabaretti arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez-la. Quand vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de montagne, de forêt ou de plaine de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Tant que le halo continue de couler, les festivités ne cessent jamais.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556233&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed7cae26-779b-4016-9506-58743c9df402', 'multiverseId': 556233}, 'multiverseid': 556233}, {'name': 'Cortile dei Cabaretti', 'text': 'Quando il Cortile dei Cabaretti entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrificalo. Quando lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Montagna, Foresta o Pianura base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola e guadagni 1 punto vita.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Finché il Nimbo continua a scorrere, i festeggiamenti non hanno mai fine.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556494&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40662cd1-6dff-4a5a-accc-c687ea5eec9a', 'multiverseId': 556494}, 'multiverseid': 556494}, {'name': '舞台座一家の中庭', 'text': '舞台座一家の中庭が戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーから基本であり山や森や平地であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直し、あなたは１点のライフを得る。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '光素が流れ続けるかぎり、お祭り騒ぎは終わらない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556755&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02402bea-72aa-4b09-9521-c3580489f7ce', 'multiverseId': 556755}, 'multiverseid': 556755}, {'name': '카바레티 안뜰', 'text': '카바레티 안뜰이 전장에 들어올 때, 카바레티 안뜰을 희생한다. 그렇게 할 때, 당신의 서고에서 기본 산, 숲 또는 들 카드 한 장을 찾아, 그 카드를 탭된 채로 전장에 놓은 후, 서고를 섞고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '헤일로가 계속해서 흐르는 한, 축제는 끝나지 않는다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557016&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c88385af-01c8-40ca-92d0-8ee84ee1b409', 'multiverseId': 557016}, 'multiverseid': 557016}, {'name': 'Pátio dos Cabaretti', 'text': 'Quando Pátio dos Cabaretti entrar no campo de batalha, sacrifique-o. Quando fizer isso, procure em seu grimório um card de Montanha, Floresta ou Planície básico, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado, depois embaralhe e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Enquanto o halo continua fluindo, as festividades nunca acabam.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557277&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef4a2b2f-c5eb-44de-a656-0a8833e4052f', 'multiverseId': 557277}, 'multiverseid': 557277}, {'name': 'Двор Кабаретти', 'text': 'Когда Двор Кабаретти выходит на поле битвы, пожертвуйте его. Когда вы это делаете, найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой Горы, Леса или Равнины, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте библиотеку, и вы получаете 1 жизнь.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Пока гало продолжает течь, праздник не закончится.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557538&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9af1ccb6-3632-4207-8940-d8e96a164b21', 'multiverseId': 557538}, 'multiverseid': 557538}, {'name': '乐舞会庭院', 'text': '当乐舞会庭院进战场时，将它牺牲。当你如此作时，从你牌库中搜寻一张基本的山脉，树林或平原牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌且你获得1点生命。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '只要金圆持续流转，节庆就永不结束。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557799&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7e2abc4-ae86-457b-a1f2-c312622497b3', 'multiverseId': 557799}, 'multiverseid': 557799}, {'name': '樂舞會庭院', 'text': '當樂舞會庭院進戰場時，將它犧牲。當你如此作時，從你牌庫中搜尋一張基本的山脈，樹林或平原牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌且你獲得1點生命。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '只要金圓持續流轉，節慶就永不結束。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558060&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82f5e983-6b10-4f44-8827-e9dfb723fa81', 'multiverseId': 558060}, 'multiverseid': 558060}]", "[{'name': 'Aufhetzerei', 'text': 'Refugium 5 (Wenn diese Verzauberung ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nImmer wenn du mit einer oder mehreren Kreaturen angreifst, erzeuge entsprechend viele 1/1 grüne und weiße Bürger-Kreaturenspielsteine. Falls du danach zehn oder mehr Kreaturen kontrollierst, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555486&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56de7c98-2db6-41bc-9d1e-4d700053e572', 'multiverseId': 555486}, 'multiverseid': 555486}, {'name': 'Agitar a la muchedumbre', 'text': 'Esconder 5. (Cuando este encantamiento entre al campo de batalla, mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo en un orden aleatorio.)\\nSiempre que ataques con una o más criaturas, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Ciudadano verdes y blancas 1/1. Luego, si controlas diez o más criaturas, puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555747&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07efe40c-ad90-4c85-b448-6e9249556ed1', 'multiverseId': 555747}, 'multiverseid': 555747}, {'name': 'Agitation de la populace', 'text': 'Cachette 5 (Quand cet enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins une créature, créez autant de jetons de créature 1/1 verte et blanche Citoyen. Puis, si vous contrôlez au moins dix créatures, vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556008&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'efe896b8-0ffa-4bf6-bdab-4a8d89e14718', 'multiverseId': 556008}, 'multiverseid': 556008}, {'name': 'Sobillazione', 'text': 'Nascondiglio 5 (Quando questo incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo in ordine casuale.)\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi con una o più creature, crea altrettante pedine creatura Cittadino 1/1 verdi e bianche. Poi, se controlli dieci o più creature, puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556269&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '376ff201-58fb-480b-a272-76448fb78f58', 'multiverseId': 556269}, 'multiverseid': 556269}, {'name': '大衆蜂起', 'text': '秘匿５（このエンチャントが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後残りを一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\nあなたが１体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、その数に等しい数の緑白の１/１の市民・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。その後、あなたが10体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、あなたはその追放されているカード１枚を、マナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556530&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed4f1cc1-38e4-41e6-b984-843943d783ef', 'multiverseId': 556530}, 'multiverseid': 556530}, {'name': '민중 선동', 'text': '은닉 5 (이 부여마법이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 보고, 한 장을 뒷면 상태로 추방한 후, 나머지를 서고 맨 밑에 무작위 순서로 놓는다.)\\n당신이 한 개 이상의 생물로 공격할 때마다, 1/1 녹색 및 백색 시민 생물 토큰을 그 수만큼 만든다. 그 후 당신이 생물을 열 개 이상 조종한다면, 당신은 추방된 카드의 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556791&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bf8c90c-b062-43a2-8984-4322e8291b61', 'multiverseId': 556791}, 'multiverseid': 556791}, {'name': 'Instigar a Multidão', 'text': 'Refúgio 5 (Quando este encantamento entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo em ordem aleatória.)\\nToda vez que você atacar com uma ou mais criaturas, crie aquela quantidade de fichas de criatura Cidadão verde e branca 1/1. Em seguida, se controlar dez ou mais criaturas, você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557052&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c272d0f9-2d0c-4001-8dd4-70b790fcfc45', 'multiverseId': 557052}, 'multiverseid': 557052}, {'name': 'Недовольство Низов', 'text': 'Укрытие 5 (Когда эти чары выходят на поле битвы, посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ библиотеки в случайном порядке.)\\nКаждый раз, когда вы атакуете одним или несколькими существами, создайте такое же количество фишек существа 1/1 зеленый и белый Гражданин. Затем, если вы контролируете десять или больше существ, вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557313&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ed9d79c-efd5-49e2-adec-0c22763d71cb', 'multiverseId': 557313}, 'multiverseid': 557313}, {'name': '民怨漫天', 'text': '掩蔽5（当此结界进战场时，检视你牌库顶的五张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于牌库底。）\\n每当你以一个或数个生物攻击时，派出等量的1/1，绿白双色的市民衍生生物。然后如果你操控十个或更多生物，则你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557574&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de157f59-3019-4cd6-8463-f790b477e28f', 'multiverseId': 557574}, 'multiverseid': 557574}, {'name': '民怨漫天', 'text': '掩蔽5（當此結界進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌，將其中一張牌面朝下地放逐，然後將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於牌庫底。）\\n每當你以一個或數個生物攻擊時，派出等量的1/1，綠白雙色的市民衍生生物。然後如果你操控十個或更多生物，則你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557835&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '775c0e99-5853-4298-8bc4-c939187cf413', 'multiverseId': 557835}, 'multiverseid': 557835}]", "[{'name': 'Aufhetzerei', 'text': 'Refugium 5\\nImmer wenn du mit einer oder mehreren Kreaturen angreifst, erzeuge entsprechend viele 1/1 grüne und weiße Bürger-Kreaturenspielsteine. Falls du danach zehn oder mehr Kreaturen kontrollierst, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558282&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55936859-f31b-4668-877f-8e618bf41279', 'multiverseId': 558282}, 'multiverseid': 558282}, {'name': 'Agitation de la populace', 'text': 'Cachette 5\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins une créature, créez autant de jetons de créature 1/1 verte et blanche Citoyen. Puis, si vous contrôlez au moins dix créatures, vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558317&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5eeee501-fe66-4903-8b07-741970e186d6', 'multiverseId': 558317}, 'multiverseid': 558317}, {'name': '大衆蜂起', 'text': '秘匿５\\nあなたが１体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、その数に等しい数の緑白の１/１の市民・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。その後、あなたが10体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、あなたはその追放されているカード１枚を、マナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558352&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3698a4f3-039c-40e7-8d64-b50e22d4c309', 'multiverseId': 558352}, 'multiverseid': 558352}, {'name': '民怨漫天', 'text': '掩蔽5\\n每当你以一个或数个生物攻击时，派出等量的1/1，绿白双色的市民衍生生物。然后如果你操控十个或更多生物，则你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558387&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04e1fd38-a996-4339-9295-a218acd658c8', 'multiverseId': 558387}, 'multiverseid': 558387}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufräumtrupp\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Aufräumtrupp ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\\n• Du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bürger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a08d1371-7b6b-4f86-a941-64c3e2aa42e9\', \'multiverseId\': 555603}, \'multiverseid\': 555603}, {\'name\': \'Equipo de limpieza\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Equipo de limpieza entre al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\\n• Ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03e0b2a4-451d-416d-b35f-24de3fc11741\', \'multiverseId\': 555864}, \'multiverseid\': 555864}, {\'name\': \'Équipe de nettoyage\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Équipe de nettoyage arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.\\n• Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\\n• Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière.\\n• Vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et citoyen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a885ec9c-c6dc-413b-a630-ea40df9e5c5b\', \'multiverseId\': 556125}, \'multiverseid\': 556125}, {\'name\': \'Squadra di Pulizia\', \'text\': \'Quando la Squadra di Pulizia entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.\\n• Guadagni 4 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0d5053d-0bbe-4f4f-855e-39c08c07b04b\', \'multiverseId\': 556386}, \'multiverseid\': 556386}, {\'name\': \'掃除係\', \'text\': \'掃除係が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• 墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n• あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a55512cb-0281-4d0e-8813-e35f7fd38394\', \'multiverseId\': 556647}, \'multiverseid\': 556647}, {\'name\': \'뒤처리 단원\', \'text\': \'뒤처리 단원이 전장에 들어올 때, 하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 파괴한다.\\n• 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법을 파괴한다.\\n• 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다.\\n• 당신은 생명 4점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 시민\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a746f2ef-b180-4b72-bd2f-e51945021a81\', \'multiverseId\': 556908}, \'multiverseid\': 556908}, {\'name\': \'Equipe de Limpeza\', \'text\': \'Quando Equipe de Limpeza entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• Destrua o encantamento alvo.\\n• Exile o card alvo de um cemitério.\\n• Você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cidadão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e143a16-20db-4283-b759-f48973f4eb91\', \'multiverseId\': 557169}, \'multiverseid\': 557169}, {\'name\': \'Бригада Чистильщиков\', \'text\': \'Когда Бригада Чистильщиков выходит на поле битвы, выберите одно —\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\\n• Уничтожьте целевые чары.\\n• Изгоните целевую карту из кладбища.\\n• Вы получаете 4 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Гражданин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a9d3cb-0051-459e-9f3f-872c8d7739bd\', \'multiverseId\': 557430}, \'multiverseid\': 557430}, {\'name\': \'清理工组\', \'text\': \'当清理工组进战场时，选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•消灭目标结界。\\n•将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。\\n•你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a1ac4e-6424-4094-b942-7bb207364dde\', \'multiverseId\': 557691}, \'multiverseid\': 557691}, {\'name\': \'清理工組\', \'text\': \'當清理工組進戰場時，選擇一項～\\n•消滅目標神器。\\n•消滅目標結界。\\n•將目標牌從墳墓場放逐。\\n•你獲得4點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／市民\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b29d7d65-4014-4072-85dd-4d223d2e31f8\', \'multiverseId\': 557952}, \'multiverseid\': 557952}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Brokers\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments legst du auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke und auf jeden Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, eine Loyalitätsmarke.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Dies ist der Beginn einer wunderbaren Freundschaft. Und vor allem einer profitablen. Jetzt unterschreib hier."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555632&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d81d11-2576-47c7-bbf3-20eaf51cc567\', \'multiverseId\': 555632}, \'multiverseid\': 555632}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de los Mediadores\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas y un contador de lealtad sobre cada planeswalker que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Este es el comienzo de una hermosa amistad. Una bien lucrativa, que es lo que importa. Firma aquí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2486ef-f93f-4e4f-b569-9ba14b78ab6c\', \'multiverseId\': 555893}, \'multiverseid\': 555893}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Courtiers\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez et un marqueur « loyauté » sur chaque planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est le début d\'une belle amitié. Mais surtout d\'une amitié lucrative. Maintenant, signez ici. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cda6443-ac88-4e3a-aa00-97a5b68971f4\', \'multiverseId\': 556154}, \'multiverseid\': 556154}, {\'name\': \'Influenza degli Intermediari\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli e un segnalino fedeltà su ogni planeswalker che controlli.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo è l\\\'inizio di una splendida amicizia. E soprattutto, di un\\\'amicizia proficua. Ora firma qui."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f74c530-50df-4783-b6f7-0b4b86e3b775\', \'multiverseId\': 556415}, \'multiverseid\': 556415}, {\'name\': \'斡旋屋一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、あなたがコントロールしている各プレインズウォーカーの上にそれぞれ忠誠カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「これは美しい友情のはじまりです。そして何より、これには利益が生じます。それではここにサインを。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58296c40-01b0-466c-89e3-430cad13de58\', \'multiverseId\': 556676}, \'multiverseid\': 556676}, {\'name\': \'브로커즈의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 당신이 조종하는 각 플레인즈워커에 충성 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이건 아름다운 우정의 시작을 알리는 것이지. 그보다 더 중요하게, 이익이 되는 우정이기도 하고. 자, 여기에 사인해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d27cc96-5da9-494d-a4a1-775316b9eefb\', \'multiverseId\': 556937}, \'multiverseid\': 556937}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Mediadores\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla e um marcador de lealdade em cada planeswalker que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Esse é o início de uma bela amizade. E o mais importante, uma amizade lucrativa. Agora assine aqui."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a7f3569-5dcb-410e-a152-79e56a310018\', \'multiverseId\': 557198}, \'multiverseid\': 557198}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Брокеров\', \'text\': "В начале вашего заключительного шага положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем и один жетон верности на каждого planeswalker\'а под вашим контролем.", \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Это начало прекрасной дружбы. И, что еще важнее, очень прибыльной. А теперь распишись вот здесь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd7ef46-fa97-4c02-9f3c-3acdb17387f5\', \'multiverseId\': 557459}, \'multiverseid\': 557459}, {\'name\': \'扶济社霸权\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物，并在每个由你操控的鹏洛客上各放置一个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「这是一段美好友谊的开始。更重要的是，一段有利可图的友谊。在这里签名吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e14d52e-e7c8-497b-aa99-fc7de1ab2346\', \'multiverseId\': 557720}, \'multiverseid\': 557720}, {\'name\': \'扶濟社霸權\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物，並在每個由你操控的鵬洛客上各放置一個忠誠指示物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「這是一段美好友誼的開始。更重要的是，一段有利可圖的友誼。在這裡簽名吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48bf080a-cff4-4076-a3a2-85843c42d06b\', \'multiverseId\': 557981}, \'multiverseid\': 557981}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Brokers\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments legst du auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke und auf jeden Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, eine Loyalitätsmarke.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558740&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68c3685f-10a6-4378-b16a-1cdd7834b247\', \'multiverseId\': 558740}, \'multiverseid\': 558740}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de los Mediadores\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas y un contador de lealtad sobre cada planeswalker que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6796a2ef-46b4-4ece-aecf-97ed345fa69c\', \'multiverseId\': 558785}, \'multiverseid\': 558785}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Courtiers\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez et un marqueur « loyauté » sur chaque planeswalker que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a0437fa-f80d-4abe-b43a-abb94bc04c57\', \'multiverseId\': 558830}, \'multiverseid\': 558830}, {\'name\': \'Influenza degli Intermediari\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli e un segnalino fedeltà su ogni planeswalker che controlli.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3ce0fd-c9c3-4761-a442-796ee9b510cb\', \'multiverseId\': 558875}, \'multiverseid\': 558875}, {\'name\': \'斡旋屋一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、あなたがコントロールしている各プレインズウォーカーの上にそれぞれ忠誠カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbbbb702-d7c3-407d-a107-1ba49da25735\', \'multiverseId\': 558920}, \'multiverseid\': 558920}, {\'name\': \'브로커즈의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 당신이 조종하는 각 플레인즈워커에 충성 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57e8e268-133b-45fb-88a1-faeae1501dab\', \'multiverseId\': 558965}, \'multiverseid\': 558965}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Mediadores\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla e um marcador de lealdade em cada planeswalker que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baa49a8b-d3ea-499b-a816-cd99eb26333e\', \'multiverseId\': 559010}, \'multiverseid\': 559010}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Брокеров\', \'text\': "В начале вашего заключительного шага положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем и один жетон верности на каждого planeswalker\'а под вашим контролем.", \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'084fe56c-b570-4c83-be21-6cda2506817b\', \'multiverseId\': 559055}, \'multiverseid\': 559055}, {\'name\': \'扶济社霸权\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物，并在每个由你操控的鹏洛客上各放置一个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd57d53d-ce3b-47bf-9c33-df22b6e08630\', \'multiverseId\': 559100}, \'multiverseid\': 559100}, {\'name\': \'扶濟社霸權\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物，並在每個由你操控的鵬洛客上各放置一個忠誠指示物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f464df4e-60be-4b1d-85fa-2ffe464582b6\', \'multiverseId\': 559145}, \'multiverseid\': 559145}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments schaust du dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerkarte ist, kannst du sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du die Karte nicht auf deine Hand nimmst, kannst du sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Was auch immer du suchst — Speise, Familie, Halo —, wir haben das Beste der Stadt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555634&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f14a7e43-1a92-4e89-af4e-f4e89f0e29aa\', \'multiverseId\': 555634}, \'multiverseid\': 555634}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de los Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura o de planeswalker, puedes mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si no la pones en tu mano, puedes ponerla en el fondo de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Da igual lo que busques: manjares, familia, halo... Tenemos lo mejor de la ciudad".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0870be-92bb-4400-8bed-144f05867926\', \'multiverseId\': 555895}, \'multiverseid\': 555895}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Cabaretti\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature ou de planeswalker, vous pouvez la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous ne mettez pas la carte dans votre main, vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Nourriture, famille, halo... quoi que vous cherchiez, on a ce qui se fait de meilleur en ville. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6206621b-cf86-4cb6-94bf-f9b7809c012c\', \'multiverseId\': 556156}, \'multiverseid\': 556156}, {\'name\': \'Influenza dei Cabaretti\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura o planeswalker, puoi rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se non la aggiungi alla tua mano, puoi metterla in fondo al tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Qualunque cosa tu stia cercando, cibo, famiglia, Nimbo... noi abbiamo il meglio che puoi trovare in città."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce7d8fe-9167-4b84-8a28-5ec438ab4873\', \'multiverseId\': 556417}, \'multiverseid\': 556417}, {\'name\': \'舞台座一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それがクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーであるカードなら、あなたはそれを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。そのカードをあなたの手札に加えないなら、それをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「食事、家族、光素のいずれにしろ、あなたが探しているものはどれも私たち一家がこの町一番よ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e8c79ab-94af-4813-93f1-b0fd9f15e021\', \'multiverseId\': 556678}, \'multiverseid\': 556678}, {\'name\': \'카바레티의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 본다. 그 카드가 생물 또는 플레인즈워커 카드라면, 당신은 그 카드를 공개하고 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 그 카드를 손에 넣지 않는다면, 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 넣을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"찾는 게 무엇이든 간에—음식이든, 패밀리든, 헤일로든—우리가 제공하는 것들이 최고지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e82bad4-935d-4e16-9bf7-58575142aa8b\', \'multiverseId\': 556939}, \'multiverseid\': 556939}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura ou planeswalker, você poderá revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se não colocar o card em sua mão, você poderá colocá-lo no fundo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Seja o que for que você busque, comida, dinheiro, halo, nós temos o melhor da cidade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f8a48e0-42ad-44cd-ae69-3a663b0c4346\', \'multiverseId\': 557200}, \'multiverseid\': 557200}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Кабаретти\', \'text\': "В начале вашего шага поддержки посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта существа или planeswalker\'а, вы можете показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы не кладете ту карту в вашу руку, вы можете положить ее в низ вашей библиотеки.", \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Что бы ты ни искал — еду, семью, гало, — у нас все самое лучшее в городе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c46b2d5-5bc5-4764-a74a-35b65605ba19\', \'multiverseId\': 557461}, \'multiverseid\': 557461}, {\'name\': \'乐舞会霸权\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，检视你的牌库顶牌。若它是生物或鹏洛客牌，则你可以展示该牌并置于你手上。如果你未将该牌置于你手上，则你可以将它置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「无论你想要什么～食物，家庭还是金圆～我们都有全城最好的选择。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703b67d4-2c26-44b2-883c-f9a9c74f4ad2\', \'multiverseId\': 557722}, \'multiverseid\': 557722}, {\'name\': \'樂舞會霸權\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，檢視你的牌庫頂牌。若它是生物或鵬洛客牌，則你可以展示該牌並置於你手上。如果你未將該牌置於你手上，則你可以將它置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「無論你想要什麼～食物，家庭還是金圓～我們都有全城最好的選擇。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0754c42a-b92f-40ac-bd4c-75e1db2462e8\', \'multiverseId\': 557983}, \'multiverseid\': 557983}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments schaust du dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerkarte ist, kannst du sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du die Karte nicht auf deine Hand nimmst, kannst du sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558742&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b8aa103-f79e-4199-ba28-e1f7e39427e1\', \'multiverseId\': 558742}, \'multiverseid\': 558742}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de los Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura o de planeswalker, puedes mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si no la pones en tu mano, puedes ponerla en el fondo de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc77a70-193b-4a06-b152-6e67a1280699\', \'multiverseId\': 558787}, \'multiverseid\': 558787}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Cabaretti\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature ou de planeswalker, vous pouvez la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous ne mettez pas la carte dans votre main, vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c1441a4-c019-46a1-81e3-5273b160a2cd\', \'multiverseId\': 558832}, \'multiverseid\': 558832}, {\'name\': \'Influenza dei Cabaretti\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura o planeswalker, puoi rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se non la aggiungi alla tua mano, puoi metterla in fondo al tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef7ac2b2-5c32-4c0f-8dd8-10f58fb27d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 558877}, \'multiverseid\': 558877}, {\'name\': \'舞台座一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それがクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーであるカードなら、あなたはそれを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。そのカードをあなたの手札に加えないなら、それをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab487e8e-4bb6-4845-b1d7-236ba5e31891\', \'multiverseId\': 558922}, \'multiverseid\': 558922}, {\'name\': \'카바레티의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 본다. 그 카드가 생물 또는 플레인즈워커 카드라면, 당신은 그 카드를 공개하고 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 그 카드를 손에 넣지 않는다면, 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 넣을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c87d67a-0747-44af-9237-e14599c2693e\', \'multiverseId\': 558967}, \'multiverseid\': 558967}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de criatura ou planeswalker, você poderá revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se não colocar o card em sua mão, você poderá colocá-lo no fundo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fae3caaa-3958-445a-bada-913b3b72f41c\', \'multiverseId\': 559012}, \'multiverseid\': 559012}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Кабаретти\', \'text\': "В начале вашего шага поддержки посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта существа или planeswalker\'а, вы можете показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы не кладете ту карту в вашу руку, вы можете положить ее в низ вашей библиотеки.", \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e24cd9ed-331a-4df4-a2e0-716cab43169c\', \'multiverseId\': 559057}, \'multiverseid\': 559057}, {\'name\': \'乐舞会霸权\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，检视你的牌库顶牌。若它是生物或鹏洛客牌，则你可以展示该牌并置于你手上。如果你未将该牌置于你手上，则你可以将它置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa5f9ce-9c0b-49a7-b67e-a45a2896518d\', \'multiverseId\': 559102}, \'multiverseid\': 559102}, {\'name\': \'樂舞會霸權\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，檢視你的牌庫頂牌。若它是生物或鵬洛客牌，則你可以展示該牌並置於你手上。如果你未將該牌置於你手上，則你可以將它置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f8ceba-ce14-4380-aba3-030ad83a2c15\', \'multiverseId\': 559147}, \'multiverseid\': 559147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Maestros\', \'text\': \'Einmal während jedes deiner Züge kannst du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu seinen bzw. ihren anderen Kosten eine Kreatur opferst. Falls ein Zauberspruch, der auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde, auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555660&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'119cba44-fec1-4075-bb35-3d47a4df1499\', \'multiverseId\': 555660}, \'multiverseid\': 555660}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de los Maestros\', \'text\': \'Una vez durante cada uno de tus turnos, puedes lanzar un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro desde tu cementerio sacrificando una criatura además de pagar sus otros costes. Si un hechizo lanzado de esta manera fuera a ir a tu cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26424e62-6ebd-4129-9c16-cfe2ce0384fe\', \'multiverseId\': 555921}, \'multiverseid\': 555921}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Maestros\', \'text\': "Une fois pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel depuis votre cimetière en sacrifiant une créature en plus de payer ses autres coûts. Si un sort lancé de cette manière devait être mis dans votre cimetière, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d32ef84a-25c3-43d5-a179-97750d62e2fc\', \'multiverseId\': 556182}, \'multiverseid\': 556182}, {\'name\': \'Influenza dei Maestro\', \'text\': \'Una volta durante ogni tuo turno, puoi lanciare una magia istantaneo o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero sacrificando una creatura oltre a pagare i suoi altri costi. Se una magia lanciata in questo modo sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69084c39-d3e5-4d6c-9f5c-888ece7965ec\', \'multiverseId\': 556443}, \'multiverseid\': 556443}, {\'name\': \'貴顕廊一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターン中に１回、他のコストの支払いに加えてクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げることで、あなたはあなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えてもよい。これにより唱えられた呪文があなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef181d1a-3e88-4dff-bc68-6ab52939ad47\', \'multiverseId\': 556704}, \'multiverseid\': 556704}, {\'name\': \'마에스트로스의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신의 매 턴마다 한 번, 당신은 주문의 다른 비용을 지불하는 것에 더해 생물 한 개를 희생하는 것으로 당신의 무덤에서 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 수 있다. 이런 식으로 발동한 주문이 무덤에 들어가려고 하면, 대신 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e805d657-83d6-48c1-8b03-0c1c9065a4d7\', \'multiverseId\': 556965}, \'multiverseid\': 556965}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Maestros\', \'text\': \'Uma vez durante cada um de seus turnos, você pode conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço de seu cemitério sacrificando uma criatura além de pagar seus outros custos. Se uma mágica conjurada desta forma seria colocada em seu cemitério, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67c1ab5-b447-4ad4-a198-ae8dcb991068\', \'multiverseId\': 557226}, \'multiverseid\': 557226}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Маэстро\', \'text\': \'Один раз во время каждого из ваших ходов вы можете разыграть мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства из вашего кладбища, пожертвовав существо в дополнение к оплате остальных его стоимостей. Если разыгранное таким образом заклинание должно быть положено на ваше кладбище, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a087f4d2-7d48-465a-a000-0d6b5065c123\', \'multiverseId\': 557487}, \'multiverseid\': 557487}, {\'name\': \'绝艺盟霸权\', \'text\': \'仅于你的每个回合中且限一次，你可以从你的坟墓场中施放一个瞬间或法术咒语，但在其他费用以外，还须牺牲一个生物。如果以此法施放的咒语将进入你的坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be488c41-2d98-4970-acd1-c1219ca90714\', \'multiverseId\': 557748}, \'multiverseid\': 557748}, {\'name\': \'絕藝盟霸權\', \'text\': \'僅於你的每個回合中且限一次，你可以從你的墳墓場中施放一個瞬間或巫術咒語，但在其他費用以外，還須犧牲一個生物。如果以此法施放的咒語將進入你的墳墓場，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a4d72e-063c-46f1-8c49-7f989335fe67\', \'multiverseId\': 558009}, \'multiverseid\': 558009}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Maestros\', \'text\': \'Einmal während jedes deiner Züge kannst du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu seinen bzw. ihren anderen Kosten eine Kreatur opferst. Falls ein Zauberspruch, der auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde, auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558759&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3196f600-9241-4f1f-9549-77d2d548ddb1\', \'multiverseId\': 558759}, \'multiverseid\': 558759}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de los Maestros\', \'text\': \'Una vez durante cada uno de tus turnos, puedes lanzar un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro desde tu cementerio sacrificando una criatura además de pagar sus otros costes. Si un hechizo lanzado de esta manera fuera a ir a tu cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a5de8b3-7785-4b71-b103-5d55c3bf893b\', \'multiverseId\': 558804}, \'multiverseid\': 558804}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Maestros\', \'text\': "Une fois pendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel depuis votre cimetière en sacrifiant une créature en plus de payer ses autres coûts. Si un sort lancé de cette manière devait être mis dans votre cimetière, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672392b7-85c8-43d0-9405-3f43d3d1703d\', \'multiverseId\': 558849}, \'multiverseid\': 558849}, {\'name\': \'Influenza dei Maestro\', \'text\': \'Una volta durante ogni tuo turno, puoi lanciare una magia istantaneo o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero sacrificando una creatura oltre a pagare i suoi altri costi. Se una magia lanciata in questo modo sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'236ee2da-c03d-4758-9642-e8ef943b077b\', \'multiverseId\': 558894}, \'multiverseid\': 558894}, {\'name\': \'貴顕廊一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターン中に１回、他のコストの支払いに加えてクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げることで、あなたはあなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えてもよい。これにより唱えられた呪文があなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29127f02-bbcf-484e-8fa9-6035370222de\', \'multiverseId\': 558939}, \'multiverseid\': 558939}, {\'name\': \'마에스트로스의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신의 매 턴마다 한 번, 당신은 주문의 다른 비용을 지불하는 것에 더해 생물 한 개를 희생하는 것으로 당신의 무덤에서 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 수 있다. 이런 식으로 발동한 주문이 무덤에 들어가려고 하면, 대신 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1073e7c4-a9bf-4dce-953c-d5fbb56ffc26\', \'multiverseId\': 558984}, \'multiverseid\': 558984}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Maestros\', \'text\': \'Uma vez durante cada um de seus turnos, você pode conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço de seu cemitério sacrificando uma criatura além de pagar seus outros custos. Se uma mágica conjurada desta forma seria colocada em seu cemitério, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c671e1d2-f2de-4664-8c7e-18f71e97e443\', \'multiverseId\': 559029}, \'multiverseid\': 559029}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Маэстро\', \'text\': \'Один раз во время каждого из ваших ходов вы можете разыграть мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства из вашего кладбища, пожертвовав существо в дополнение к оплате остальных его стоимостей. Если разыгранное таким образом заклинание должно быть положено на ваше кладбище, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df9f0a69-6ec0-4d86-aa47-8f210cb59145\', \'multiverseId\': 559074}, \'multiverseid\': 559074}, {\'name\': \'绝艺盟霸权\', \'text\': \'仅于你的每个回合中且限一次，你可以从你的坟墓场中施放一个瞬间或法术咒语，但在其他费用以外，还须牺牲一个生物。如果以此法施放的咒语将进入你的坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b4a04c3-7b40-4a07-8ee4-2e167c3240b6\', \'multiverseId\': 559119}, \'multiverseid\': 559119}, {\'name\': \'絕藝盟霸權\', \'text\': \'僅於你的每個回合中且限一次，你可以從你的墳墓場中施放一個瞬間或巫術咒語，但在其他費用以外，還須犧牲一個生物。如果以此法施放的咒語將進入你的墳墓場，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'519c929c-2db3-47c6-b078-8884f181435d\', \'multiverseId\': 559164}, \'multiverseid\': 559164}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Obscura\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst und falls sein Manabetrag gleich 1 plus der Anzahl an Seelenmarken auf dem Aufstieg der Obscura ist, lege eine Seelenmarke auf den Aufstieg der Obscura und erzeuge dann einen 2/2 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nSolange fünf oder mehr Seelenmarken auf dem Aufstieg der Obscura liegen, erhalten Geister, die du kontrollierst, +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555669&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'853f6a81-033d-4a0b-87a9-cc42a78bdf1a\', \'multiverseId\': 555669}, \'multiverseid\': 555669}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de la Obscura\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo, si su valor de maná es igual a 1 más la cantidad de contadores de alma sobre la Supremacía de la Obscura, pon un contador de alma sobre la Supremacía de la Obscura y luego crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\\nMientras haya cinco o más contadores de alma sobre la Supremacía de la Obscura, los Espíritus que controlas obtienen +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a1162d9-a305-4311-9be2-6193ce2f34b4\', \'multiverseId\': 555930}, \'multiverseid\': 555930}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Obscura\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, si sa valeur de mana est égale à 1 plus le nombre de marqueurs « âme » sur l\'Ascendance des Obscura, mettez un marqueur « âme » sur l\'Ascendance des Obscura, puis créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\\nTant qu\'il y a au moins cinq marqueurs « âme » sur l\'Ascendance des Obscura, les esprits que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8542efb9-5542-473c-b71b-0bac8aeebe59\', \'multiverseId\': 556191}, \'multiverseid\': 556191}, {\'name\': \'Influenza degli Obscura\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, se il suo valore di mana è pari a 1 più il numero di segnalini anima sull\'Influenza degli Obscura, metti un segnalino anima sull\'Influenza degli Obscura, poi crea una pedina creatura Spirito 2/2 bianca con volare.\\nFintanto che ci sono cinque o più segnalini anima sull\'Influenza degli Obscura, gli Spiriti che controlli prendono +3/+3.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd3d9d96-9f13-4b47-ab54-89879e2aa8ab\', \'multiverseId\': 556452}, \'multiverseid\': 556452}, {\'name\': \'常夜会一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたが呪文を唱えるたび、それのマナ総量が常夜会一家の隆盛の上にある魂魄カウンターの個数に１を足した数に等しい場合、常夜会一家の隆盛の上に魂魄カウンター１個を置く。その後、飛行を持つ白の２/２のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n常夜会一家の隆盛の上に５個以上の魂魄カウンターがあるかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスピリットは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e001ce75-df04-42d1-9775-2c7281841c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 556713}, \'multiverseid\': 556713}, {\'name\': \'옵스큐라의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신이 주문을 발동할 때마다, 그 주문의 마나 값이 옵스큐라의 지배력에 놓여 있는 영혼 카운터의 수에 1을 더한 수와 같다면, 옵스큐라의 지배력에 영혼 카운터 한 개를 올려놓은 후, 비행을 가진 2/2 백색 신령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n옵스큐라의 지배력에 영혼 카운터가 다섯 개 이상 놓여 있는 한, 당신이 조종하는 신령들은 +3/+3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fed8066-5409-4e0e-96e4-242899e5bc6e\', \'multiverseId\': 556974}, \'multiverseid\': 556974}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Obscura\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica, se seu valor de mana for igual a 1 mais o número de marcadores de alma em Domínio dos Obscura, coloque um marcador de alma em Domínio dos Obscura e depois crie uma ficha de criatura Espírito branca 2/2 com voar.\\nEnquanto houver cinco ou mais marcadores de alma em Domínio dos Obscura, os Espíritos que você controla receberão +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3f12e0a-ade9-4ba1-bc86-7f6335cb1d56\', \'multiverseId\': 557235}, \'multiverseid\': 557235}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Обскуры\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, если его мановая ценность равна 1 плюс количество жетонов души на Возвышении Обскуры, то положите на Возвышение Обскуры один жетон души, затем создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 белый Дух с Полетом.\\nПока на Возвышении Обскуры есть пять или больше жетонов души, Духи под вашим контролем получают +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d0034ec-d6a0-45b7-ab04-12c59c371a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 557496}, \'multiverseid\': 557496}, {\'name\': \'秘闻帮霸权\', \'text\': \'每当你施放咒语时，若其法术力值等同于秘闻帮霸权上的灵魂指示物数量加1，则在秘闻帮霸权上放置一个灵魂指示物，然后派出一个2/2白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\\n只要秘闻帮霸权上有五个或更多灵魂指示物，由你操控的精怪便得+3/+3。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcf4bdbd-bce7-481d-a63f-59a62293666e\', \'multiverseId\': 557757}, \'multiverseid\': 557757}, {\'name\': \'秘聞幫霸權\', \'text\': \'每當你施放咒語時，若其魔法力值等同於秘聞幫霸權上的靈魂指示物數量加1，則在秘聞幫霸權上放置一個靈魂指示物，然後派出一個2/2白色，具飛行異能的精靈衍生生物。\\n只要秘聞幫霸權上有五個或更多靈魂指示物，由你操控的精靈便得+3/+3。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'759d4d90-8d1d-469e-a038-843fd4ae8e69\', \'multiverseId\': 558018}, \'multiverseid\': 558018}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Obscura\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst und falls sein Manabetrag gleich 1 plus der Anzahl an Seelenmarken auf dem Aufstieg der Obscura ist, lege eine Seelenmarke auf den Aufstieg der Obscura und erzeuge dann einen 2/2 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nSolange fünf oder mehr Seelenmarken auf dem Aufstieg der Obscura liegen, erhalten Geister, die du kontrollierst, +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558765&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89106282-6a96-4f99-bb52-1c236b1c406b\', \'multiverseId\': 558765}, \'multiverseid\': 558765}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de la Obscura\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo, si su valor de maná es igual a 1 más la cantidad de contadores de alma sobre la Supremacía de la Obscura, pon un contador de alma sobre la Supremacía de la Obscura y luego crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\\nMientras haya cinco o más contadores de alma sobre la Supremacía de la Obscura, los Espíritus que controlas obtienen +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'951fa207-078f-414a-9417-8d2080a0ff50\', \'multiverseId\': 558810}, \'multiverseid\': 558810}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Obscura\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, si sa valeur de mana est égale à 1 plus le nombre de marqueurs « âme » sur l\'Ascendance des Obscura, mettez un marqueur « âme » sur l\'Ascendance des Obscura, puis créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\\nTant qu\'il y a au moins cinq marqueurs « âme » sur l\'Ascendance des Obscura, les esprits que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7b45f94-9276-4533-9f59-f83571a2dd09\', \'multiverseId\': 558855}, \'multiverseid\': 558855}, {\'name\': \'Influenza degli Obscura\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, se il suo valore di mana è pari a 1 più il numero di segnalini anima sull\'Influenza degli Obscura, metti un segnalino anima sull\'Influenza degli Obscura, poi crea una pedina creatura Spirito 2/2 bianca con volare.\\nFintanto che ci sono cinque o più segnalini anima sull\'Influenza degli Obscura, gli Spiriti che controlli prendono +3/+3.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f2abdc-13c2-4b38-8e74-c8e3a0e14ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 558900}, \'multiverseid\': 558900}, {\'name\': \'常夜会一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたが呪文を唱えるたび、それのマナ総量が常夜会一家の隆盛の上にある魂魄カウンターの個数に１を足した数に等しい場合、常夜会一家の隆盛の上に魂魄カウンター１個を置く。その後、飛行を持つ白の２/２のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n常夜会一家の隆盛の上に５個以上の魂魄カウンターがあるかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのスピリットは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eed038e-cbb4-450a-ab50-2de46ec56830\', \'multiverseId\': 558945}, \'multiverseid\': 558945}, {\'name\': \'옵스큐라의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신이 주문을 발동할 때마다, 그 주문의 마나 값이 옵스큐라의 지배력에 놓여 있는 영혼 카운터의 수에 1을 더한 수와 같다면, 옵스큐라의 지배력에 영혼 카운터 한 개를 올려놓은 후, 비행을 가진 2/2 백색 신령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n옵스큐라의 지배력에 영혼 카운터가 다섯 개 이상 놓여 있는 한, 당신이 조종하는 신령들은 +3/+3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18e59bad-6dae-4728-bf8b-946dbf85e862\', \'multiverseId\': 558990}, \'multiverseid\': 558990}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Obscura\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica, se seu valor de mana for igual a 1 mais o número de marcadores de alma em Domínio dos Obscura, coloque um marcador de alma em Domínio dos Obscura e depois crie uma ficha de criatura Espírito branca 2/2 com voar.\\nEnquanto houver cinco ou mais marcadores de alma em Domínio dos Obscura, os Espíritos que você controla receberão +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e64323d-dc3c-4113-8ce7-67d3d1e3ce93\', \'multiverseId\': 559035}, \'multiverseid\': 559035}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Обскуры\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, если его мановая ценность равна 1 плюс количество жетонов души на Возвышении Обскуры, то положите на Возвышение Обскуры один жетон души, затем создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 белый Дух с Полетом.\\nПока на Возвышении Обскуры есть пять или больше жетонов души, Духи под вашим контролем получают +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4af9f7f-a938-48c9-899e-7e1482fa5df0\', \'multiverseId\': 559080}, \'multiverseid\': 559080}, {\'name\': \'秘闻帮霸权\', \'text\': \'每当你施放咒语时，若其法术力值等同于秘闻帮霸权上的灵魂指示物数量加1，则在秘闻帮霸权上放置一个灵魂指示物，然后派出一个2/2白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\\n只要秘闻帮霸权上有五个或更多灵魂指示物，由你操控的精怪便得+3/+3。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d56b6df9-8b0e-4e1c-a63c-434d685145e1\', \'multiverseId\': 559125}, \'multiverseid\': 559125}, {\'name\': \'秘聞幫霸權\', \'text\': \'每當你施放咒語時，若其魔法力值等同於秘聞幫霸權上的靈魂指示物數量加1，則在秘聞幫霸權上放置一個靈魂指示物，然後派出一個2/2白色，具飛行異能的靈怪衍生生物。\\n只要秘聞幫霸權上有五個或更多靈魂指示物，由你操控的精靈便得+3/+3。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72033f55-88ec-4563-ad63-21f796d1874b\', \'multiverseId\': 559170}, \'multiverseid\': 559170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Umnieter\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Kreatur opferst, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit niedrigerem Manabetrag aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurückbringen. Tue dies nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir *sind* diese Stadt, bis auf die Knochen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555678&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7e74e27-8ff0-46bc-8fcf-335b3839ac05\', \'multiverseId\': 555678}, \'multiverseid\': 555678}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de los Remachadores\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques una criatura, puedes regresar la carta de criatura objetivo con menor valor de maná de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girada. Haz esto solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"**Somos esta ciudad, desde sus cimientos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7059bcda-c805-4c91-986b-3c6981050684\', \'multiverseId\': 555939}, \'multiverseid\': 555939}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Riveteurs\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez une créature, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure depuis votre cimetière. Ne faites ceci qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous *sommes* cette ville, jusque dans son squelette. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556200&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a916c721-18e7-4bd0-a4b8-0906b4043284\', \'multiverseId\': 556200}, \'multiverseid\': 556200}, {\'name\': \'Influenza dei Rivettatori\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi una creatura, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia TAPpata una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana inferiore dal tuo cimitero. Fallo solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Noi *siamo* questa città, fin nelle ossa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b9f5f8e-b485-49c4-867c-9d78a87c708b\', \'multiverseId\': 556461}, \'multiverseid\': 556461}, {\'name\': \'土建組一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げるたび、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量がそれ未満であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをタップ状態で戦場に戻してもよい。これは毎ターン１回しか行えない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺たちは都市*そのもの*だ、骨の髄までな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23c0c54d-3eeb-43a1-8d99-03186e4df488\', \'multiverseId\': 556722}, \'multiverseid\': 556722}, {\'name\': \'리베티어즈의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신이 생물을 희생할 때마다, 당신의 무덤에 있으며 마나 값이 더 적은 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 탭된 상태로 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다. 한 턴에 한 번만 이렇게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"*우리가* 바로 이 도시다, 뼛속까지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'085cda4c-aabc-4357-b460-5af4fa9259eb\', \'multiverseId\': 556983}, \'multiverseid\': 556983}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Rebiteiros\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sacrifica uma criatura, você pode devolver de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado o card de criatura alvo com valor de mana inferior. Faça isso apenas uma vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós *somos* a própria cidade, das vigas aos ossos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb78b70d-edee-4769-b001-75df93f4b2c3\', \'multiverseId\': 557244}, \'multiverseid\': 557244}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Клепальщиков\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете существо, вы можете вернуть целевую карту существа с меньшей мановой ценностью из вашего кладбища на поле битвы повернутой. Делайте это только один раз в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы *и есть* этот город, мозг его костей».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e130f70-6a9d-4e45-907b-c836d435a126\', \'multiverseId\': 557505}, \'multiverseid\': 557505}, {\'name\': \'勤工联霸权\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲一个生物时，你可以将目标法术力值小于它的生物牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。每回合只能如此作一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「从门面到核心，我们就是**这座城市。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df84182f-a398-4f5e-83f5-d469430a0a40\', \'multiverseId\': 557766}, \'multiverseid\': 557766}, {\'name\': \'勤工聯霸權\', \'text\': \'每當你犧牲一個生物時，你可以將目標魔法力值小於它的生物牌從你的墳墓場橫置移回戰場。每回合只能如此作一次。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「從門面到核心，我們*就是*這座城市。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1ffb2fa-8b90-41a8-b2cb-1699a9c16294\', \'multiverseId\': 558027}, \'multiverseid\': 558027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Umnieter\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Kreatur opferst, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit niedrigerem Manabetrag aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurückbringen. Tue dies nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558773&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d180ed9-3a62-4e79-a9e9-30a102620781\', \'multiverseId\': 558773}, \'multiverseid\': 558773}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía de los Remachadores\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques una criatura, puedes regresar la carta de criatura objetivo con menor valor de maná de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girada. Haz esto solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86abe0c0-73fa-4b17-b389-1853e1999c9d\', \'multiverseId\': 558818}, \'multiverseid\': 558818}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance des Riveteurs\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez une créature, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure depuis votre cimetière. Ne faites ceci qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87e4ac91-3023-47d2-adb7-f339b9a958b6\', \'multiverseId\': 558863}, \'multiverseid\': 558863}, {\'name\': \'Influenza dei Rivettatori\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi una creatura, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia TAPpata una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana inferiore dal tuo cimitero. Fallo solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d224c2-419f-41f9-8aa6-10cc2ade0c38\', \'multiverseId\': 558908}, \'multiverseid\': 558908}, {\'name\': \'土建組一家の隆盛\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げるたび、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量がそれ未満であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをタップ状態で戦場に戻してもよい。これは毎ターン１回しか行えない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fed14ef-52de-4067-acde-cbd0d0903b85\', \'multiverseId\': 558953}, \'multiverseid\': 558953}, {\'name\': \'리베티어즈의 지배력\', \'text\': \'당신이 생물을 희생할 때마다, 당신의 무덤에 있으며 마나 값이 더 적은 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 탭된 상태로 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다. 한 턴에 한 번만 이렇게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046193d7-e68a-4f11-bb87-a03da77c5a96\', \'multiverseId\': 558998}, \'multiverseid\': 558998}, {\'name\': \'Domínio dos Rebiteiros\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sacrifica uma criatura, você pode devolver de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado o card de criatura alvo com valor de mana inferior. Faça isso apenas uma vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c8499bc-24eb-4050-9624-84571f963a46\', \'multiverseId\': 559043}, \'multiverseid\': 559043}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Клепальщиков\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете существо, вы можете вернуть целевую карту существа с меньшей мановой ценностью из вашего кладбища на поле битвы повернутой. Делайте это только один раз в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b39147df-a278-4300-893b-8617c5b40478\', \'multiverseId\': 559088}, \'multiverseid\': 559088}, {\'name\': \'勤工联霸权\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲一个生物时，你可以将目标法术力值小于它的生物牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。每回合只能如此作一次。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6c7e01-98a8-426c-b14f-2b8a88ffb677\', \'multiverseId\': 559133}, \'multiverseid\': 559133}, {\'name\': \'勤工聯霸權\', \'text\': \'每當你犧牲一個生物時，你可以將目標魔法力值小於它的生物牌從你的墳墓場橫置移回戰場。每回合只能如此作一次。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4c5417-a3da-4e16-a1ee-cf9a767caeea\', \'multiverseId\': 559178}, \'multiverseid\': 559178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Weg\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls er eine grüne bleibende Karte als Ziel hat.\\nBringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du langweilst mich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba19e93-9bda-429d-aebd-91de0ccb0a2f\', \'multiverseId\': 555514}, \'multiverseid\': 555514}, {\'name\': \'Largo de aquí\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo si hace objetivo a un permanente verde.\\nRegresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente a la mano de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Me aburres".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bd725b1-313b-4633-8b57-2e3a41da6856\', \'multiverseId\': 555775}, \'multiverseid\': 555775}, {\'name\': \'Hors de mon chemin\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer s\'il cible un permanent vert.\\nRenvoyez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Tu m\'ennuies. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556036&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c75ea613-9a7e-49a2-8202-27090f5feb0d\', \'multiverseId\': 556036}, \'multiverseid\': 556036}, {\'name\': \'Fuori dai Piedi\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se bersaglia un permanente verde.\\nFai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario in mano al suo proprietario.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua vista mi annoia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1de1fda2-b143-41e3-addc-b00f72bdbba0\', \'multiverseId\': 556297}, \'multiverseid\': 556297}, {\'name\': \'一蹴\', \'text\': \'この呪文が緑のパーマネントを対象としているなら、これを唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたって退屈ね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f048f55-daec-4ba9-9826-80219f6dd89d\', \'multiverseId\': 556558}, \'multiverseid\': 556558}, {\'name\': \'비켜\', \'text\': \'이 주문이 녹색 지속물을 목표로 한다면 이 주문은 발동하는 데 {2}가 덜 든다.\\n상대가 조종하는 대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"너 때문에 지루해지는군."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'815380d8-4c38-4bfb-84b1-5cf28c6105b8\', \'multiverseId\': 556819}, \'multiverseid\': 556819}, {\'name\': \'Fora do Caminho\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custará {2} a menos para ser conjurada se tiver uma permanente verde como alvo.\\nDevolva a permanente alvo não de terreno que um oponente controla para a mão de seu dono.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Você me entedia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e419e15-fc85-45f1-9c45-ed925f42c1d4\', \'multiverseId\': 557080}, \'multiverseid\': 557080}, {\'name\': \'Прочь с Дороги\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {2} меньше, если его целью является зеленый перманент.\\nВерните целевой не являющийся землей перманент под контролем оппонента в руку его владельца.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты мне надоел».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae1c7cae-1f52-4a96-baab-6c7f78c3578f\', \'multiverseId\': 557341}, \'multiverseid\': 557341}, {\'name\': \'清除障碍\', \'text\': \'如果此咒语以绿色永久物为目标，则它减少{2}来施放。\\n将目标由对手操控的非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我腻了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec0fc311-4cc3-455c-809b-a25ab4e2653b\', \'multiverseId\': 557602}, \'multiverseid\': 557602}, {\'name\': \'清除障礙\', \'text\': \'如果此咒語以綠色永久物為目標，則它減少{2}來施放。\\n將目標由對手操控的非地永久物移回其擁有者手上。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我膩了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'374f165f-d6e5-4bc0-831f-e31d29fa9575\', \'multiverseId\': 557863}, \'multiverseid\': 557863}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausspionieren\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten und schaue dir dann die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers an.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Stahltüren und Eisenstangen sind für einen Obscura-Agenten ein Kinderspiel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555499&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4f8c7b-25bc-44dc-b70e-5667f75d24ce\', \'multiverseId\': 555499}, \'multiverseid\': 555499}, {\'name\': \'Reconocer el terreno\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas y luego mira la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Las puertas de acero y los barrotes de hierro son un juego de niños para los agentes de la Obscura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'025048d2-6490-407c-88c7-5192af5fe7d1\', \'multiverseId\': 555760}, \'multiverseid\': 555760}, {\'name\': \'Repérage des lieux\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes, puis regardez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les portes en acier et les barres de fer sont un jeu d\'enfant pour un agent des Obscura.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556021&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'145c1817-1b64-4a35-8219-6db46f5e5898\', \'multiverseId\': 556021}, \'multiverseid\': 556021}, {\'name\': \'Ricognizione sul Posto\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte, poi guarda la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Porte in acciaio e inferriate sono un gioco da ragazzi per un agente degli Obscura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7441f0-2531-44fd-866d-ca35beca2796\', \'multiverseId\': 556282}, \'multiverseid\': 556282}, {\'name\': \'下見\', \'text\': \'カード２枚を引き、その後各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'鋼鉄の扉と鉄格子など、常夜会一家の調査員には造作もない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab9fa24-666a-49cf-9912-25e9e83c836a\', \'multiverseId\': 556543}, \'multiverseid\': 556543}, {\'name\': \'범행 지역 파악\', \'text\': \'카드 두 장을 뽑은 후, 각 플레이어의 서고 맨 위 카드를 본다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'옵스큐라의 첩보원에게 있어 강철 문과 쇠창살은 아이들의 놀이나 다름없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd4e8b6b-4227-41e1-a953-4c2acfb0e168\', \'multiverseId\': 556804}, \'multiverseid\': 556804}, {\'name\': \'Sondar o Terreno\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards e depois olhe o card do topo do grimório de cada jogador.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Portas de aço e barras de ferro são brincadeira de criança para um agente dos Obscura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722cb793-b32a-4ec7-9789-aeec16d86ea8\', \'multiverseId\': 557065}, \'multiverseid\': 557065}, {\'name\': \'Разведка Обстановки\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты, затем посмотрите верхнюю карту библиотеки каждого из игроков.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Стальные двери и железные решетки — детская забава для оперативника Обскуры.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'318ea4d1-ec28-4b22-ac26-17b41deed414\', \'multiverseId\': 557326}, \'multiverseid\': 557326}, {\'name\': \'踩点打探\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌，然后检视每位牌手的牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'钢门铁栏对秘闻帮特务只是小菜一碟。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d399b94-6739-4aaa-8602-b79cd4050b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 557587}, \'multiverseid\': 557587}, {\'name\': \'踩點打探\', \'text\': \'抽兩張牌，然後檢視每位玩家的牌庫頂牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'鋼門鐵欄對秘聞幫特務只是小菜一碟。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4ff786-a5ec-4c48-a66a-950b7274c486\', \'multiverseId\': 557848}, \'multiverseid\': 557848}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aven-Herzdurchstecherin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange sich in deinem Friedhof Karten mit fünf oder mehr unterschiedlichen Manabeträgen befinden, erhält die Aven-Herzdurchstecherin +2/+2 und hat Todesberührung.\\nWenn die Aven-Herzdurchstecherin stirbt, millst du zwei Karten und ziehst dann eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Assassine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555628&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eed33f9a-ebbf-42fa-b116-f95b69f99f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 555628}, \'multiverseid\': 555628}, {\'name\': \'Perforacorazones aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMientras haya cinco o más valores de maná entre las cartas de tu cementerio, la Perforacorazones aven obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de toque mortal.\\nCuando la Perforacorazones aven muera, muele dos cartas y luego roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab75fee8-41b1-4187-8dfa-9eca5b05ad0e\', \'multiverseId\': 555889}, \'multiverseid\': 555889}, {\'name\': \'Dardecœur avemain\', \'text\': "Vol\\nTant qu\'il y a au moins cinq valeurs de mana parmi les cartes de votre cimetière, le Dardecœur avemain gagne +2/+2 et a le contact mortel.\\nQuand le Dardecœur avemain meurt, meulez deux cartes, puis piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et assassin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556150&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a671147a-88c9-4875-ab48-5e9a343b1da1\', \'multiverseId\': 556150}, \'multiverseid\': 556150}, {\'name\': \'Infilzacuore Aviana\', \'text\': "Volare\\nFintanto che ci sono cinque o più valori di mana tra le carte nel tuo cimitero, l\'Infilzacuore Aviana prende +2/+2 e ha tocco letale.\\nQuando l\'Infilzacuore Aviana muore, macina due carte, poi pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a76aff-6770-4584-a302-57a5edb088b7\', \'multiverseId\': 556411}, \'multiverseid\': 556411}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの心臓刺し\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの墓地にあるすべてのカードの中に５種類以上のマナ総量があるかぎり、エイヴンの心臓刺しは＋２/＋２の修整を受け接死を持つ。\\nエイヴンの心臓刺しが死亡したとき、カード２枚を切削し、その後カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'616c6134-8eca-43f3-b9c8-a91e1177ff3e\', \'multiverseId\': 556672}, \'multiverseid\': 556672}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 심장공격꾼\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 무덤에 있는 카드들의 마나 값이 다섯 종류 이상인 한, 에이븐 심장공격꾼은 +2/+2을 받고 치명타를 가진다.\\n에이븐 심장공격꾼이 죽을 때, 카드 두 장을 민 후, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 암살자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d0bd3b8-43c9-4b47-a96b-b23ebfc4c77c\', \'multiverseId\': 556933}, \'multiverseid\': 556933}, {\'name\': \'Fura-coração Aviana\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEnquanto houver cinco ou mais valores de mana diferentes entre os cards em seu cemitério, Fura-coração Aviana receberá +2/+2 e terá toque mortífero.\\nQuando Fura-coração Aviana morrer, triture dois cards e depois compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Assassino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'156f4ea1-8263-4516-820e-43ad19b65eff\', \'multiverseId\': 557194}, \'multiverseid\': 557194}, {\'name\': \'Пронзающий Сердца Авен\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nПока среди карт на вашем кладбище есть не менее пяти разных значений мановой ценности, Пронзающий Сердца Авен получает +2/+2 и имеет Смертельное касание.\\nКогда Пронзающий Сердца Авен умирает, скрутите две карты, затем возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Убийца\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a30fb171-ffbe-4857-a4f3-c2a3343522b8\', \'multiverseId\': 557455}, \'multiverseid\': 557455}, {\'name\': \'刺心艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n只要你坟墓场中牌的法术力值有五种或更多，刺心艾文便得+2/+2且具有死触异能。\\n当刺心艾文死去时，磨两张牌，然后抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／杀手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36c7bb3e-94e9-4dbb-8594-0832a9ba339c\', \'multiverseId\': 557716}, \'multiverseid\': 557716}, {\'name\': \'刺心艾文\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n只要你墳墓場中牌的魔法力值有五種或更多，刺心艾文便得+2/+2且具有死觸異能。\\n當刺心艾文死去時，磨兩張牌，然後抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥／殺手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b733e7-553c-40ab-a2a1-66a8a32293e3\', \'multiverseId\': 557977}, \'multiverseid\': 557977}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aven-Herzdurchstecherin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange sich in deinem Friedhof Karten mit fünf oder mehr unterschiedlichen Manabeträgen befinden, erhält die Aven-Herzdurchstecherin +2/+2 und hat Todesberührung.\\nWenn die Aven-Herzdurchstecherin stirbt, millst du zwei Karten und ziehst dann eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Assassine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d73debd6-baf8-48b5-a979-08090e2688c9\', \'multiverseId\': 558306}, \'multiverseid\': 558306}, {\'name\': \'Dardecœur avemain\', \'text\': "Vol\\nTant qu\'il y a au moins cinq valeurs de mana parmi les cartes de votre cimetière, le Dardecœur avemain gagne +2/+2 et a le contact mortel.\\nQuand le Dardecœur avemain meurt, meulez deux cartes, puis piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et assassin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558341&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1843e54a-815b-41c3-90a3-8432d4c6b3c3\', \'multiverseId\': 558341}, \'multiverseid\': 558341}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの心臓刺し\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの墓地にあるすべてのカードの中に５種類以上のマナ総量があるかぎり、エイヴンの心臓刺しは＋２/＋２の修整を受け接死を持つ。\\nエイヴンの心臓刺しが死亡したとき、カード２枚を切削し、その後カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d397d6c0-1252-4429-8491-369049d5fd75\', \'multiverseId\': 558376}, \'multiverseid\': 558376}, {\'name\': \'刺心艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n只要你坟墓场中牌的法术力值有五种或更多，刺心艾文便得+2/+2且具有死触异能。\\n当刺心艾文死去时，磨两张牌，然后抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／杀手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c839dc6-f1b0-4884-8368-185bf3bc44db\', \'multiverseId\': 558411}, \'multiverseid\': 558411}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baustellen-Schläger\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Baustellen-Schläger sterben, erzeuge einen getappten 2/2 schwarzen Räuber-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nBlitz {3}{B} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Blitz-Kosten wirkst, erhält er Eile und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, ziehe eine Karte." Opfere diese Kreatur zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3772761a-b88e-4cbb-bfe0-06843ae804c0\', \'multiverseId\': 555542}, \'multiverseid\': 555542}, {\'name\': \'Matones de la viga\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Matones de la viga mueran, crea una ficha de criatura Bribón negra 2/2 girada.\\nIrrupción {3}{B}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de irrupción, gana la habilidad de prisa y "Cuando esta criatura muera, roba una carta". Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ogro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16c034b1-2bde-47f7-a953-dbd9a81212e8\', \'multiverseId\': 555803}, \'multiverseid\': 555803}, {\'name\': \'Sbires des poutres\', \'text\': \'Quand les Sbires des poutres meurent, créez, engagé, un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Gredin.\\nBlitz {3}{B} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de blitz, il acquiert la célérité et « Quand cette créature meurt, piochez une carte. » Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556064&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fff300c2-ad13-477e-9e3d-04aefa707611\', \'multiverseId\': 556064}, \'multiverseid\': 556064}, {\'name\': \'Scagnozzi della Longherina\', \'text\': \'Quando gli Scagnozzi della Longherina muoiono, crea una pedina creatura Farabutto 2/2 nera TAPpata.\\nBlitz {3}{B} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di blitz, ha rapidità e "Quando questa creatura muore, pesca una carta". Sacrificala all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Ogre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7076f2-c8b4-4a21-9e96-cadb3309f028\', \'multiverseId\': 556325}, \'multiverseid\': 556325}, {\'name\': \'橋桁のうすのろ\', \'text\': \'橋桁のうすのろが死亡したとき、黒の２/２のならず者・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態で生成する。\\n奇襲{3}{B}（あなたがこの呪文を奇襲コストで唱えたなら、これは速攻と「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、カード１枚を引く。」を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7af7bd42-6ce7-4963-8b05-dd5c53c16a3b\', \'multiverseId\': 556586}, \'multiverseid\': 556586}, {\'name\': \'대들보 깡패\', \'text\': \'대들보 깡패가 죽을 때, 탭된 상태인 2/2 흑색 도적 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n기습 {3}{B} (기습 비용을 지불해서 이 주문을 발동했다면, 이 생물은 신속 및 "이 생물이 죽을 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 얻는다. 다음 종료단 시작에 이 생물을 희생한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 오우거 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a15e5a3-db3d-4201-a1a6-bf7344cf25b2\', \'multiverseId\': 556847}, \'multiverseid\': 556847}, {\'name\': \'Capangas da Trave\', \'text\': \'Quando Capangas da Trave morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Ladino preta 2/2 virada.\\nBlitz {3}{B} (Se você conjura esta mágica por seu custo de blitz, ela ganha ímpeto e "Quando esta criatura morrer, compre um card". Sacrifique-a no início da próxima etapa final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ogro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8413c7a7-787e-4f34-bb33-276eeb4b6aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 557108}, \'multiverseid\': 557108}, {\'name\': \'Громилы с Балками\', \'text\': \'Когда Громилы с Балками умирают, создайте одну повернутую фишку существа 2/2 черный Бродяга.\\nБлиц {3}{B} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за его стоимость Блица, оно получает Ускорение и способность «Когда это существо умирает, возьмите карту». Пожертвуйте его в начале следующего заключительного шага.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Огр Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84d859fd-0a14-4f80-a8df-a3e3254401de\', \'multiverseId\': 557369}, \'multiverseid\': 557369}, {\'name\': \'扛梁蛮汉\', \'text\': \'当扛梁蛮汉死去时，派出一个已横置的2/2黑色浪客衍生生物。\\n急袭{3}{B}（如果你支付此咒语的急袭费用来施放之，则它获得敏捷与「当此生物死去时，抓一张牌。」在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43dd8692-865e-4503-adf2-93e8dc1e4e1c\', \'multiverseId\': 557630}, \'multiverseid\': 557630}, {\'name\': \'扛樑蠻漢\', \'text\': \'當扛樑蠻漢死去時，派出一個已橫置的2/2黑色浪客衍生生物。\\n急襲{3}{B}（如果你支付此咒語的急襲費用來施放之，則它獲得敏捷與「當此生物死去時，抽一張牌。」在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它犧牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e11f8666-cdf8-49a4-8751-ca5c6c62404e\', \'multiverseId\': 557891}, \'multiverseid\': 557891}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschuldigen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die derselbe Spieler kontrolliert. Der Spieler opfert eine davon.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ich du wäre, würde ich den Mantel dieses Elfen kontrollieren. Ich habe gesehen, wie er sich etwas in die Tasche gesteckt hat, bevor du gekommen bist."\\n—Krandal, freiberuflicher Anstifter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555546&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb9eeeef-90b7-4882-8063-11e628810406\', \'multiverseId\': 555546}, \'multiverseid\': 555546}, {\'name\': \'Incriminar\', \'text\': \'Elige dos criaturas objetivo controladas por el mismo jugador. Ese jugador sacrifica una de ellas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Te aconsejo que le eches un vistazo al abrigo de ese elfo. Vi cómo se metía algo en el bolsillo justo antes de que llegaras".\\n—Krandal, instigador autónomo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a6978bf-2694-47ff-8706-e2f28a9a1de0\', \'multiverseId\': 555807}, \'multiverseid\': 555807}, {\'name\': \'Incrimination\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux créatures ciblées contrôlées par le même joueur. Ce joueur sacrifie l\'une d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Si j\'étais vous, je fouillerais le manteau de cet elfe. Je l\'ai vu glisser quelque chose dans sa poche avant votre arrivée. »\\n—Krandal, instigateur indépendant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556068&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099f8c0f-d8f1-4213-b4ba-77f17e072d99\', \'multiverseId\': 556068}, \'multiverseid\': 556068}, {\'name\': \'Incriminare\', \'text\': \'Scegli due creature bersaglio controllate dallo stesso giocatore. Quel giocatore ne sacrifica una.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se fossi in te, controllerei il soprabito dell\\\'elfo. L\\\'ho visto infilarsi qualcosa in tasca poco prima del tuo arrivo."\\n—Krandal, istigatore prezzolato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'092d4403-2e61-482d-a48c-07817eb1ceef\', \'multiverseId\': 556329}, \'multiverseid\': 556329}, {\'name\': \'なすりつけ\', \'text\': \'同じプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー２体を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはそれらのうち１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「もし私があなたなら、そのエルフの外套を調べるでしょうな。あなたが到着する直前に、彼がポケットに何かを忍ばせたのを見ましたから。」\\n――無所属の教唆者、クランドル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac59550-8c69-48e1-bfe3-93e1129ac3e4\', \'multiverseId\': 556590}, \'multiverseid\': 556590}, {\'name\': \'뒤집어씌우기\', \'text\': \'같은 플레이어가 조종하는 생물 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 그중 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"나라면, 저 엘프의 코트를 확인해 보겠어. 네가 도착하기 직전에 주머니에 뭔가를 집어넣는 걸 봤거든."\\n—프리랜서 선동가, 크란달\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdeb87ab-237f-4088-bd73-f21ffd53f6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 556851}, \'multiverseid\': 556851}, {\'name\': \'Incriminar\', \'text\': \'Escolha duas criaturas alvo controladas pelo mesmo jogador. Aquele jogador sacrifica uma delas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Se eu fosse você, revistava o capote daquele elfo. Ele colocou um negócio no bolso antes de você chegar."\\n— Krandal, instigador autônomo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aac72d3-29fe-45b8-bbe2-53066a773dfd\', \'multiverseId\': 557112}, \'multiverseid\': 557112}, {\'name\': \'Возложить Вину\', \'text\': \'Выберите два целевых существа под контролем одного и того же игрока. Тот игрок жертвует одно из них.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«На твоем месте я бы проверил плащ того эльфа. Я видел, как он что-то сунул в карман прямо перед тем, как вы явились».\\n— Крэндал, наемный подстрекатель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16211783-6eb0-4a67-9c7d-9939b98e859e\', \'multiverseId\': 557373}, \'multiverseid\': 557373}, {\'name\': \'设计陷害\', \'text\': \'选择两个目标由同一牌手操控的生物。该牌手牺牲其中一个。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「换作是我，我会检查一下那个妖精的大衣。就在你来之前，我看到他把什么东西塞进了自己的口袋。」\\n～惹事包工寇兰多\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff74d4e4-5484-4f99-9a2c-3ae1d0fb742e\', \'multiverseId\': 557634}, \'multiverseid\': 557634}, {\'name\': \'設計陷害\', \'text\': \'選擇兩個目標由同一玩家操控的生物。該玩家犧牲其中一個。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「換作是我，我會檢查一下那個妖精的大衣。就在你來之前，我看到他把什麼東西塞進了自己的口袋。」\\n～惹事包工寇蘭多\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebd578f1-80a0-476e-a6b4-dff617cf0191\', \'multiverseId\': 557895}, \'multiverseid\': 557895}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschuldigen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die derselbe Spieler kontrolliert. Der Spieler opfert eine davon.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ich du wäre, würde ich den Mantel dieses Elfen kontrollieren. Ich habe gesehen, wie er sich etwas in die Tasche gesteckt hat, bevor du gekommen bist."\\n—Krandal, freiberuflicher Anstifter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6d47ff8-fe19-44fc-836f-59aa949afa28\', \'multiverseId\': 558646}, \'multiverseid\': 558646}, {\'name\': \'Incriminar\', \'text\': \'Elige dos criaturas objetivo controladas por el mismo jugador. Ese jugador sacrifica una de ellas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Te aconsejo que le eches un vistazo al abrigo de ese elfo. Vi cómo se metía algo en el bolsillo justo antes de que llegaras".\\n—Krandal, instigador autónomo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb421b0-5dbc-4c61-8210-c31d33548f85\', \'multiverseId\': 558651}, \'multiverseid\': 558651}, {\'name\': \'Incrimination\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux créatures ciblées contrôlées par le même joueur. Ce joueur sacrifie l\'une d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Si j\'étais vous, je fouillerais le manteau de cet elfe. Je l\'ai vu glisser quelque chose dans sa poche avant votre arrivée. »\\n—Krandal, instigateur indépendant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558656&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'317cec31-24aa-4283-ba91-1bdefc56e6e5\', \'multiverseId\': 558656}, \'multiverseid\': 558656}, {\'name\': \'Incriminare\', \'text\': \'Scegli due creature bersaglio controllate dallo stesso giocatore. Quel giocatore ne sacrifica una.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se fossi in te, controllerei il soprabito dell\\\'elfo. L\\\'ho visto infilarsi qualcosa in tasca poco prima del tuo arrivo."\\n—Krandal, istigatore prezzolato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d29af8ca-81d6-47d9-b56f-77bc9323aa25\', \'multiverseId\': 558661}, \'multiverseid\': 558661}, {\'name\': \'なすりつけ\', \'text\': \'同じプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー２体を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはそれらのうち１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「もし私があなたなら、そのエルフの外套を調べるでしょうな。あなたが到着する直前に、彼がポケットに何かを忍ばせたのを見ましたから。」\\n――無所属の教唆者、クランドル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6c62564-2beb-4777-acd1-ffa8a3ac1952\', \'multiverseId\': 558666}, \'multiverseid\': 558666}, {\'name\': \'뒤집어씌우기\', \'text\': \'같은 플레이어가 조종하는 생물 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 그중 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"나라면, 저 엘프의 코트를 확인해 보겠어. 네가 도착하기 직전에 주머니에 뭔가를 집어넣는 걸 봤거든."\\n—프리랜서 선동가, 크란달\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'172cb439-cd53-498f-821b-4e5456c39ab3\', \'multiverseId\': 558671}, \'multiverseid\': 558671}, {\'name\': \'Incriminar\', \'text\': \'Escolha duas criaturas alvo controladas pelo mesmo jogador. Aquele jogador sacrifica uma delas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Se eu fosse você, revistava o capote daquele elfo. Ele colocou um negócio no bolso antes de você chegar."\\n— Krandal, instigador autônomo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ced8d831-0be6-4f8b-9303-13f3ba534f28\', \'multiverseId\': 558676}, \'multiverseid\': 558676}, {\'name\': \'Возложить Вину\', \'text\': \'Выберите два целевых существа под контролем одного и того же игрока. Тот игрок жертвует одно из них.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«На твоем месте я бы проверил плащ того эльфа. Я видел, как он что-то сунул в карман прямо перед тем, как вы явились».\\n— Крэндал, наемный подстрекатель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f2db118-c5da-4d2e-b086-e9207c3572d3\', \'multiverseId\': 558681}, \'multiverseid\': 558681}, {\'name\': \'设计陷害\', \'text\': \'选择两个目标由同一牌手操控的生物。该牌手牺牲其中一个。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「换作是我，我会检查一下那个妖精的大衣。就在你来之前，我看到他把什么东西塞进了自己的口袋。」\\n～惹事包工寇兰多\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d27601-828e-4bb7-b10c-ef8c3615a048\', \'multiverseId\': 558686}, \'multiverseid\': 558686}, {\'name\': \'設計陷害\', \'text\': \'選擇兩個目標由同一玩家操控的生物。該玩家犧牲其中一個。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「換作是我，我會檢查一下那個妖精的大衣。就在你來之前，我看到他把什麼東西塞進了自己的口袋。」\\n～惹事包工寇蘭多\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bb188ec-f136-4a5c-acfb-a93e6e91fa03\', \'multiverseId\': 558691}, \'multiverseid\': 558691}]', "[{'name': 'Bosque', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559484&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5365305-2d06-4311-8867-ab14f12a6281', 'multiverseId': 559484}, 'multiverseid': 559484}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559494&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71cfabd0-8c54-419e-b220-501b21d6ae08', 'multiverseId': 559494}, 'multiverseid': 559494}, {'name': '숲', 'type': '기본 대지 — 숲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559524&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f2be44f-5f99-4e2b-90f7-b706dfac0e50', 'multiverseId': 559524}, 'multiverseid': 559524}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559534&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1fbb25a-fd12-408c-9195-29bfed3882e2', 'multiverseId': 559534}, 'multiverseid': 559534}, {'name': 'Лес', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Лес', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559544&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47130944-3e66-433d-8d03-e6075980d92b', 'multiverseId': 559544}, 'multiverseid': 559544}, {'name': '树林', 'type': '基本地 ～树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559554&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3da8d5b6-b75a-4587-acbe-9a91e10d846f', 'multiverseId': 559554}, 'multiverseid': 559554}]", '[{\'name\': \'Boss der Schmiede\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine oder mehrere andere Kreaturen opferst, fügt der Boss der Schmiede jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„So ein großer Schmelzofen kann alles in Asche verwandeln. Hast du etwas, das in Asche verwandelt werden muss?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ae8c31-e00a-48f6-8b97-d568fa7d7ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 555651}, \'multiverseid\': 555651}, {\'name\': \'Jefe de la forja\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques una o más otras criaturas, el Jefe de la forja hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Estos hornos grandes reducen cualquier cosa a cenizas. ¿Necesitas incinerar algo?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc67eb39-23ef-446c-a33a-bde985315321\', \'multiverseId\': 555912}, \'multiverseid\': 555912}, {\'name\': \'Patron de la forge\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez au moins une autre créature, le Patron de la forge inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Un grand fourneau comme ça peut tout réduire en cendres. Vous avez un truc à réduire en cendres ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dca00d6-0b56-44e8-97c5-8678522556a3\', \'multiverseId\': 556173}, \'multiverseid\': 556173}, {\'name\': \'Capo della Forgia\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi una o più altre creature, il Capo della Forgia infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una fornace di queste dimensioni può ridurre qualsiasi cosa in cenere. Hai bisogno di ridurre qualcosa in cenere?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'206c4c39-0749-4116-92ea-a4d03562a7e6\', \'multiverseId\': 556434}, \'multiverseid\': 556434}, {\'name\': \'鍛冶場の親方\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれでない１体以上のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げるたび、鍛冶場の親方は各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「こういうデカい焼炉はな、どんなものでも灰にできるんだ。お前、灰にしたいものはあるのか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a609bc-f28d-4294-959f-586e83bbd1be\', \'multiverseId\': 556695}, \'multiverseid\': 556695}, {\'name\': \'주조소 수장\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 생물을 한 개 이상 희생할 때마다, 주조소 수장은 각 상대에게 피해 2점을 입힌다. 이 능력은 한 턴에 한 번만 격발한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"이렇게 큰 용광로라면 뭐든지 재로 만들어버릴 수 있지. 재로 만들어버려야 하는 게 있어?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e576ded-b160-4a09-890f-5112f3af2461\', \'multiverseId\': 556956}, \'multiverseid\': 556956}, {\'name\': \'Chefe da Forja\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sacrifica uma ou mais outras criaturas, Chefe da Forja causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma fornalhona que nem essa faz qualquer coisa virar cinzas. E você? Tem alguma coisa que precise virar cinzas?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad7f86c1-0ad6-4c4b-9647-cf8575af2e70\', \'multiverseId\': 557217}, \'multiverseid\': 557217}, {\'name\': \'Босс Кузницы\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете одно или несколько других существ, Босс Кузницы наносит 2 повреждения каждому оппоненту. Эта способность срабатывает только один раз в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Большая печь — такая, как эта, — может превратить в пепел все что угодно. Тебе что-то нужно превратить в пепел?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8607775-7a8a-4097-beac-2a7e7c86986c\', \'multiverseId\': 557478}, \'multiverseid\': 557478}, {\'name\': \'熔炉主管\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲一个或数个其他生物时，熔炉主管向每位对手各造成2点伤害。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「任何东西进了这样的大型熔炉都会烧成灰。你有什么要烧成灰的东西吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fec01ba9-34fc-4f46-afb2-faf2c5b802ec\', \'multiverseId\': 557739}, \'multiverseid\': 557739}, {\'name\': \'熔爐主管\', \'text\': \'每當你犧牲一個或數個其他生物時，熔爐主管向每位對手各造成2點傷害。此異能每回合只會觸發一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「任何東西進了這樣的大型熔爐都會燒成灰。你有什麼要燒成灰的東西嗎？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a53e71-1de2-4237-9a2a-b903bdd16780\', \'multiverseId\': 558000}, \'multiverseid\': 558000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Botanischer Park\', \'text\': \'Der Botanische Park kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, opfere den Botanischen Park: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Öffentliche Parks sind ein beliebter Treffpunkt für diejenigen, die überlegen, die Seiten zu wechseln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555709&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0925ba34-5759-4271-a781-6d1a2193a72d\', \'multiverseId\': 555709}, \'multiverseid\': 555709}, {\'name\': \'Plaza botánica\', \'text\': \'La Plaza botánica entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, sacrificar la Plaza botánica: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los parques públicos son el punto de encuentro favorito de quienes tienen en mente cambiar de bando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fcec96d-511b-4f30-9d0b-56aa19258867\', \'multiverseId\': 555970}, \'multiverseid\': 555970}, {\'name\': \'Esplanade botanique\', \'text\': "L\'Esplanade botanique arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Esplanade botanique : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les parcs publics sont un lieu de rencontre privilégié pour ceux qui envisagent de changer d\'allégeance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09efc26f-dce6-4fc8-b4d7-439e8d515baf\', \'multiverseId\': 556231}, \'multiverseid\': 556231}, {\'name\': \'Piazzale Botanico\', \'text\': \'Il Piazzale Botanico entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, Sacrifica il Piazzale Botanico: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "I parchi pubblici sono uno dei luoghi d\'incontro preferiti da coloro che considerano un cambio di alleanze.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b716f756-eaa5-40dd-b157-197cf4e1166f\', \'multiverseId\': 556492}, \'multiverseid\': 556492}, {\'name\': \'植物広場\', \'text\': \'植物広場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, 植物広場を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'公立公園は忠誠の鞍替えを検討している者たちにとって好ましい出会いの場である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a555bd16-4ae0-4cab-8f04-9188248b4dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 556753}, \'multiverseid\': 556753}, {\'name\': \'식물원 광장\', \'text\': \'식물원 광장은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {G} 또는 {W}를 추가한다.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, 식물원 광장을 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'공원은 충성의 대상을 바꿀 지를 고려하는 사람들이 가장 선호하는 만남의 장소이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f8c216-1da7-496c-99b2-5263793d481d\', \'multiverseId\': 557014}, \'multiverseid\': 557014}, {\'name\': \'Praça Botânica\', \'text\': \'Praça Botânica entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, sacrifique Praça Botânica: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os parques da cidade são um lugar popular para reuniões entre os que estão considerando novas lealdades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a1a9fb-10c3-456b-9d71-e8bbc965eae5\', \'multiverseId\': 557275}, \'multiverseid\': 557275}, {\'name\': \'Ботаническая Площадь\', \'text\': \'Ботаническая Площадь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, пожертвуйте Ботаническую Площадь: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Городские парки — излюбленное место встречи для тех, кто подумывает о смене лояльности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a69851bb-23b9-4d8e-bbae-845e3f96f7b9\', \'multiverseId\': 557536}, \'multiverseid\': 557536}, {\'name\': \'植物广场\', \'text\': \'植物广场须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。\\n{2}{G}{W}，{T}，牺牲植物广场：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'人们若想改换东家，公园是很理想的会面场所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4031e396-13a6-4a91-addf-998710513b14\', \'multiverseId\': 557797}, \'multiverseid\': 557797}, {\'name\': \'植物廣場\', \'text\': \'植物廣場須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。\\n{2}{G}{W}，{T}，犧牲植物廣場：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'人們若想改換東家，公園是很理想的會面場所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9745ec4d-0bcd-4b4c-9bf8-0344882f8d85\', \'multiverseId\': 558058}, \'multiverseid\': 558058}]', '[{\'name\': \'Botanischer Park\', \'text\': \'Der Botanische Park kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, opfere den Botanischen Park: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559245&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c867ec4-0b26-432a-bcca-0e3528dac0f7\', \'multiverseId\': 559245}, \'multiverseid\': 559245}, {\'name\': \'Plaza botánica\', \'text\': \'La Plaza botánica entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, sacrificar la Plaza botánica: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a9bac1-e8b2-4c9a-91be-2d7942b42f86\', \'multiverseId\': 559255}, \'multiverseid\': 559255}, {\'name\': \'Esplanade botanique\', \'text\': "L\'Esplanade botanique arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Esplanade botanique : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559265&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ce48cc4-3bf4-4f28-90d0-a259ba5102fa\', \'multiverseId\': 559265}, \'multiverseid\': 559265}, {\'name\': \'Piazzale Botanico\', \'text\': \'Il Piazzale Botanico entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, Sacrifica il Piazzale Botanico: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77d9b4f-2b94-495f-befd-0b639614f478\', \'multiverseId\': 559275}, \'multiverseid\': 559275}, {\'name\': \'植物広場\', \'text\': \'植物広場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, 植物広場を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ececfd90-66c3-40fc-81d3-5d125ecb22af\', \'multiverseId\': 559285}, \'multiverseid\': 559285}, {\'name\': \'식물원 광장\', \'text\': \'식물원 광장은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {G} 또는 {W}를 추가한다.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, 식물원 광장을 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c84781-7d4b-4eb6-8d89-ab06fa384844\', \'multiverseId\': 559295}, \'multiverseid\': 559295}, {\'name\': \'Praça Botânica\', \'text\': \'Praça Botânica entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, sacrifique Praça Botânica: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e081ce7f-2f11-4e28-aeaa-0680838ce7c5\', \'multiverseId\': 559305}, \'multiverseid\': 559305}, {\'name\': \'Ботаническая Площадь\', \'text\': \'Ботаническая Площадь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, пожертвуйте Ботаническую Площадь: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e777ff02-6b7a-404a-8337-a64a548e09e0\', \'multiverseId\': 559315}, \'multiverseid\': 559315}, {\'name\': \'植物广场\', \'text\': \'植物广场须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。\\n{2}{G}{W}，{T}，牺牲植物广场：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9e9785-9992-4d0b-b41e-f6af5b041900\', \'multiverseId\': 559325}, \'multiverseid\': 559325}, {\'name\': \'植物廣場\', \'text\': \'植物廣場須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。\\n{2}{G}{W}，{T}，犧牲植物廣場：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b9c9afa-b4ff-48e7-8e91-59524ef8bd17\', \'multiverseId\': 559335}, \'multiverseid\': 559335}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brokers-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Sie fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den ein Gegner kontrolliert, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\\n• Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555633&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce16fe5f-a005-4a30-809d-9568b720b4d6\', \'multiverseId\': 555633}, \'multiverseid\': 555633}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de los Mediadores\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno. Hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla un oponente.\\n• Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83de8d5-7205-47a3-a230-db6335e82b34\', \'multiverseId\': 555894}, \'multiverseid\': 555894}, {\'name\': \'Charme des Courtiers\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\n• Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\\n• Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'570dcbc0-1658-4ccd-80aa-efd20315df0c\', \'multiverseId\': 556155}, \'multiverseid\': 556155}, {\'name\': \'Talismano degli Intermediari\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno. Infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da un avversario.\\n• Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86cf01ed-385d-4aa8-9836-a96efc682092\', \'multiverseId\': 556416}, \'multiverseid\': 556416}, {\'name\': \'斡旋屋一家の魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n• エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e01378c-b72c-4bb4-b10d-cb46d4a1e6e8\', \'multiverseId\': 556677}, \'multiverseid\': 556677}, {\'name\': \'브로커즈 부적\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다. 상대가 조종하는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표는 두 번째 목표에게 자신의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.\\n• 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법을 파괴한다.\\n• 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723e865b-b1b5-4954-954c-0899538dc426\', \'multiverseId\': 556938}, \'multiverseid\': 556938}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto dos Mediadores\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno. Ela causa dano igual ao próprio poder à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que um oponente controla.\\n• Destrua o encantamento alvo.\\n• Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4953c3ca-797e-47ea-810a-95c972f20f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 557199}, \'multiverseid\': 557199}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Брокеров\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+0 до конца хода. Оно наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, целевому существу или planeswalker\'у под контролем оппонента.\\n• Уничтожьте целевые чары.\\n• Возьмите две карты.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede99ff1-ab33-4384-a06a-54c79b703320\', \'multiverseId\': 557460}, \'multiverseid\': 557460}, {\'name\': \'扶济社护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。它向目标由对手操控的生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\\n•消灭目标结界。\\n•抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba0136c4-f386-40f8-b3e0-f8b026018a6e\', \'multiverseId\': 557721}, \'multiverseid\': 557721}, {\'name\': \'扶濟社護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合結束。它向目標由對手操控的生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。\\n•消滅目標結界。\\n•抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29bd5f8f-e1d9-4753-b4f9-1e44b2dbb7d1\', \'multiverseId\': 557982}, \'multiverseid\': 557982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brokers-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Sie fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den ein Gegner kontrolliert, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\\n• Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558741&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7598e51-8741-4d2b-be6e-902861c69388\', \'multiverseId\': 558741}, \'multiverseid\': 558741}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de los Mediadores\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno. Hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla un oponente.\\n• Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94d33653-d384-4a27-8a99-3be5ba5fbc9f\', \'multiverseId\': 558786}, \'multiverseid\': 558786}, {\'name\': \'Charme des Courtiers\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\n• Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\\n• Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd613666-2158-4d8f-9a24-ba7d8eafbce8\', \'multiverseId\': 558831}, \'multiverseid\': 558831}, {\'name\': \'Talismano degli Intermediari\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno. Infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da un avversario.\\n• Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c66254a3-9bbf-48a8-948c-003e0cc15d31\', \'multiverseId\': 558876}, \'multiverseid\': 558876}, {\'name\': \'斡旋屋一家の魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n• エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d45d6547-7da1-4837-b0f7-2b15f7e276eb\', \'multiverseId\': 558921}, \'multiverseid\': 558921}, {\'name\': \'브로커즈 부적\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다. 상대가 조종하는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표는 두 번째 목표에게 자신의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.\\n• 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법을 파괴한다.\\n• 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a703b2-df34-4ded-ba04-8632ecb634bb\', \'multiverseId\': 558966}, \'multiverseid\': 558966}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto dos Mediadores\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno. Ela causa dano igual ao próprio poder à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que um oponente controla.\\n• Destrua o encantamento alvo.\\n• Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471da832-3708-47dc-bc2a-c19c56da0c7d\', \'multiverseId\': 559011}, \'multiverseid\': 559011}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Брокеров\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+0 до конца хода. Оно наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, целевому существу или planeswalker\'у под контролем оппонента.\\n• Уничтожьте целевые чары.\\n• Возьмите две карты.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e00466-5f82-4eac-9735-9bfb16b92d3f\', \'multiverseId\': 559056}, \'multiverseid\': 559056}, {\'name\': \'扶济社护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。它向目标由对手操控的生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\\n•消灭目标结界。\\n•抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'115e9802-a260-4f25-bf5a-1fcd9cec835f\', \'multiverseId\': 559101}, \'multiverseid\': 559101}, {\'name\': \'扶濟社護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合結束。它向目標由對手操控的生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。\\n•消滅目標結界。\\n•抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5c9169b-b147-46c0-b83e-aa4044f43fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 559146}, \'multiverseid\': 559146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brokers-Eingeweihte\', \'text\': \'{4}{G/U}: Die Brokers-Eingeweihte hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 5/5 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bürger\', \'flavor\': \'Was ist mächtiger, Feder oder Schwert? Für die Brokers ist das keine Frage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555467&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aabeb808-3438-4204-9c9a-b0ed609bd772\', \'multiverseId\': 555467}, \'multiverseid\': 555467}, {\'name\': \'Novata de los Mediadores\', \'text\': \'{4}{G/U}: La Novata de los Mediadores tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 5/5 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano felino\', \'flavor\': \'Si se comparan el poder de la pluma y el de la espada, la postura oficial de los Mediadores es: "¿Por qué elegir?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d45c7cc-4c6f-4999-aabf-5b97da987173\', \'multiverseId\': 555728}, \'multiverseid\': 555728}, {\'name\': \'Adepte des Courtiers\', \'text\': "{4}{G/U} : L\'Adepte des Courtiers a une force et une endurance de base de 5/5 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et citoyen\', \'flavor\': "Concernant les forces relatives de la plume et de l\'épée, les Courtiers ont statué : « Pourquoi choisir ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555989&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d6cfe40-081a-4d8c-b627-c7acd4c9ccb3\', \'multiverseId\': 555989}, \'multiverseid\': 555989}, {\'name\': \'Iniziata degli Intermediari\', \'text\': "{4}{G/U}: L\'Iniziata degli Intermediari ha forza e costituzione base 5/5 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Felino\', \'flavor\': \'La posizione ufficiale degli Intermediari su quale sia più potente tra penna e spada è semplice: "Perché scegliere?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0115eaea-c8fd-4f18-84b6-062ad1d38e42\', \'multiverseId\': 556250}, \'multiverseid\': 556250}, {\'name\': \'斡旋屋一家の新入り\', \'text\': \'{4}{G/U}：ターン終了時まで、斡旋屋一家の新入りの基本のパワーとタフネスは５/５になる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・市民\', \'flavor\': \'ペンと剣の相対的な力を鑑みるに、斡旋屋一家の公式な立場は「なぜ選ぶ？」である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1227979-e81b-4e95-806d-140ccc5b55a5\', \'multiverseId\': 556511}, \'multiverseid\': 556511}, {\'name\': \'브로커즈 입회자\', \'text\': \'{4}{G/U}: 브로커즈 입회자는 턴종료까지 기본 공격력과 방어력이 5/5가 된다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 시민\', \'flavor\': \'펜과 칼의 상대적인 힘과 관련해, 브로커즈의 공식적인 입장은 "왜 선택해야 하지?"다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ec12b9-27c7-423e-8dcd-ffe9b2c1bac3\', \'multiverseId\': 556772}, \'multiverseid\': 556772}, {\'name\': \'Iniciada dos Mediadores\', \'text\': \'{4}{G/U}: Iniciada dos Mediadores tem poder e resistência básicos 5/5 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Cidadão\', \'flavor\': \'No que concerne à força da caneta ou da espada, a posição oficial dos Mediadores é: "Escolher por quê?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d48276b-8483-4960-a494-0236e1db67ab\', \'multiverseId\': 557033}, \'multiverseid\': 557033}, {\'name\': \'Новичок Брокеров\', \'text\': \'{4}{G/U}: Новичок Брокеров имеет базовую силу и выносливость 5/5 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Гражданин\', \'flavor\': \'В том, что касается сравнительной силы пера и меча, официальная позиция Брокеров такова: «Зачем выбирать?».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3454dab7-0851-4558-aeeb-761d3c17a797\', \'multiverseId\': 557294}, \'multiverseid\': 557294}, {\'name\': \'扶济社新手\', \'text\': \'{4}{G/U}：扶济社新手的基础力量与防御力为5/5直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／市民\', \'flavor\': \'关于笔与剑何者较强，扶济社的正式立场是「何不全拿？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3fb8c90-e329-4e03-bb83-7980b079cba7\', \'multiverseId\': 557555}, \'multiverseid\': 557555}, {\'name\': \'扶濟社新手\', \'text\': \'{4}{G/U}：扶濟社新手的基礎力量與防禦力為5/5直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓／市民\', \'flavor\': \'關於筆與劍何者較強，扶濟社的正式立場是「何不全拿？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'571ebabd-534d-4838-90c6-61d5bb603363\', \'multiverseId\': 557816}, \'multiverseid\': 557816}]', "[{'name': 'Brokers-Veteran', 'text': 'Wenn der Brokers-Veteran stirbt, lege eine Schildmarke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. (Falls ihr Schaden zugefügt oder sie zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen eine Schildmarke von ihr.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat', 'flavor': 'Ein letzter Auftrag, bevor er sich zur Ruhe setzt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555498&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77a6d951-0107-48d5-919c-7070a1d2b536', 'multiverseId': 555498}, 'multiverseid': 555498}, {'name': 'Veterano de los Mediadores', 'text': 'Cuando el Veterano de los Mediadores muera, pon un contador de escudo sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas. (Si fuera a recibir daño o a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve un contador de escudo de ella.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado humano', 'flavor': 'Su última misión antes de jubilarse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555759&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9db0a0d-6cd6-49d0-8dd4-7eda4b2ac411', 'multiverseId': 555759}, 'multiverseid': 555759}, {'name': 'Vétéran des Courtiers', 'text': 'Quand le Vétéran des Courtiers meurt, mettez un marqueur « bouclier » sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. (Si elle devait subir des blessures ou être détruite, retirez-lui un marqueur « bouclier » à la place.)', 'type': 'Créature : humain et soldat', 'flavor': 'Un dernier boulot avant de prendre sa retraite.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556020&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca7fbc4f-9da9-483b-a855-b05c753d32c9', 'multiverseId': 556020}, 'multiverseid': 556020}, {'name': 'Veterano degli Intermediari', 'text': 'Quando il Veterano degli Intermediari muore, metti un segnalino scudo su una creatura bersaglio che controlli. (Se sta per subire danno o sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece un segnalino scudo da essa.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato Umano', 'flavor': 'Un ultimo lavoro prima di concludere la carriera.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556281&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65224ecb-2963-49d9-9e04-2730cb3fc971', 'multiverseId': 556281}, 'multiverseid': 556281}, {'name': '斡旋屋一家の古参', 'text': '斡旋屋一家の古参が死亡したとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に盾カウンター１個を置く。（それがダメージを受けるか破壊されるなら、代わりにそれの上から盾カウンター１個を取り除く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '引退前にもうひと仕事。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556542&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6937ccbb-87a5-4923-936a-c9164877a8f9', 'multiverseId': 556542}, 'multiverseid': 556542}, {'name': '브로커즈 숙련병', 'text': '브로커즈 숙련병이 죽을 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 방패 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. (그 생물이 피해를 입거나 파괴되려 한다면, 대신 그 생물에서 방패 카운터 한 개를 제거한다.)', 'type': '생물 — 인간 병사', 'flavor': '은퇴하기 전 마지막 임무.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556803&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e13beeb1-4943-451e-85d0-a2c7d3757487', 'multiverseId': 556803}, 'multiverseid': 556803}, {'name': 'Veterano dos Mediadores', 'text': 'Quando Veterano dos Mediadores morrer, coloque um marcador de escudo na criatura alvo que você controla. (Se ele sofreria dano ou seria destruído, em vez disso, remova um marcador de escudo dele.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Soldado', 'flavor': 'Um último trabalho antes da aposentadoria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557064&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd94be283-93cc-4e62-8b00-29f852418e9b', 'multiverseId': 557064}, 'multiverseid': 557064}, {'name': 'Ветеран Брокеров', 'text': 'Когда Ветеран Брокеров умирает, положите один жетон щита на целевое существо под вашим контролем. (Если оно должно получить повреждения или быть уничтожено, вместо этого удалите с него один жетон щита.)', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Солдат', 'flavor': 'Последняя работа перед тем, как он отойдет от дел.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557325&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bd96b26-a1e3-4c47-803d-fdd4794dc58b', 'multiverseId': 557325}, 'multiverseid': 557325}, {'name': '扶济社老手', 'text': '当扶济社老手死去时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个后盾指示物。（如果它将受到伤害或将被消灭，则改为从其上移去一个后盾指示物。）', 'type': '生物 ～人类／士兵', 'flavor': '退休前最后一件工作。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557586&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1e06e0f-6f3f-41db-af54-ad35c8ee1e55', 'multiverseId': 557586}, 'multiverseid': 557586}, {'name': '扶濟社老手', 'text': '當扶濟社老手死去時，在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個後盾指示物。（如果它將受到傷害或將被消滅，則改為從其上移去一個後盾指示物。）', 'type': '生物 ～人類／士兵', 'flavor': '退休前最後一件工作。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557847&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbeba61d-e020-4351-ae13-ee2455c27503', 'multiverseId': 557847}, 'multiverseid': 557847}]", '[{\'name\': \'Buckeliger Wächter\', \'text\': \'Der Buckelige Wächter kommt getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hier gibt es nichts zu sehen. Ich trage einfach einen Teppich. Ja, der Teppich trägt Stiefel. Sei nicht so neugierig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30122ca4-116a-4f81-b4bc-43b40912107a\', \'multiverseId\': 555533}, \'multiverseid\': 555533}, {\'name\': \'Custodio deshonesto\', \'text\': \'El Custodio deshonesto entra al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ogro\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquí no hay nada que ver, solo es una alfombra. Sí, la alfombra lleva botas. Deja de hacer preguntas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eae3daba-35b6-4bf4-ae61-0e4fa59b6f29\', \'multiverseId\': 555794}, \'multiverseid\': 555794}, {\'name\': \'Gardien véreux\', \'text\': \'Le Gardien véreux arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a rien à voir. Je porte juste un tapis. Oui, le tapis porte des bottes. Arrêtez de poser des questions. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6480c0ff-74ac-40d1-8d0a-2035245d97a4\', \'multiverseId\': 556055}, \'multiverseid\': 556055}, {\'name\': \'Custode Disonesto\', \'text\': \'Il Custode Disonesto entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Ogre\', \'flavor\': \'"Non c\\\'è niente da vedere qui. È solo un tappeto. Sì, il tappeto indossa stivali, e allora? Smettila con le domande."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'974740bb-58f3-4f64-afeb-5918fbc43664\', \'multiverseId\': 556316}, \'multiverseid\': 556316}, {\'name\': \'歪んだ守衛\', \'text\': \'歪んだ守衛はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「見世物じゃないぞ。絨毯を運んでいるだけだ。そう、絨毯は長靴を履いているんだ。それ以上聞くな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df29dbf-3958-4db6-9934-1a5b677f8664\', \'multiverseId\': 556577}, \'multiverseid\': 556577}, {\'name\': \'부정직한 관리자\', \'text\': \'부정직한 관리자는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 오우거 도적\', \'flavor\': \'"구경거리는 없어요. 그냥 카페트를 옮기는 중입니다. 네, 카페트도 신발을 신죠. 질문 좀 그만 하세요."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'474d822a-31b9-47d3-a943-8034e7b915fd\', \'multiverseId\': 556838}, \'multiverseid\': 556838}, {\'name\': \'Guarda Desonesto\', \'text\': \'Guarda Desonesto entra no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ogro Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Não tem nada pra ver aqui. É só um tapete. Um tapete de botas. Chega de perguntar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2e9b705-fd8d-4d90-8e36-1dbc46c774a8\', \'multiverseId\': 557099}, \'multiverseid\': 557099}, {\'name\': \'Бесчестный Сторож\', \'text\': \'Бесчестный Сторож выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Огр Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Не на что тут смотреть. Я просто несу ковер. Да, ковер носит башмаки. Хватит задавать вопросы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61c4973d-9743-4a5f-a89a-a7bac078ca2d\', \'multiverseId\': 557360}, \'multiverseid\': 557360}, {\'name\': \'护管帮众\', \'text\': \'护管帮众须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「不要大惊小怪。我只是背着一卷地毯而已。没错，地毯也穿鞋。别问了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72556469-de7c-478b-ae02-37823677e6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 557621}, \'multiverseid\': 557621}, {\'name\': \'護管幫眾\', \'text\': \'護管幫眾須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「不要大驚小怪。我只是背著一捲地毯而已。沒錯，地毯也穿鞋。別問了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'612f520e-7376-49c1-bbcf-565f41327fb1\', \'multiverseId\': 557882}, \'multiverseid\': 557882}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bühne der Maestros\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Bühne der Maestros ins Spiel kommt, opfere sie. Wenn du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Insel-, Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Standardlandkarte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach. Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Nur außergewöhnliche Künstler werden auf die größte Bühne in Neu-Capenna eingeladen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e975a38-c19f-42d1-a005-716340e0091d\', \'multiverseId\': 555713}, \'multiverseid\': 555713}, {\'name\': \'Teatro de los Maestros\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Teatro de los Maestros entre al campo de batalla, sacrifícalo. Cuando lo hagas, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Isla, Pantano o Montaña básica y ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Luego baraja y ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Solo se invita a artistas extraordinarios a honrar el escenario más ostentoso de Nueva Capenna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fd4261b-f4b9-48e6-a2f6-b19bd4e23629\', \'multiverseId\': 555974}, \'multiverseid\': 555974}, {\'name\': \'Théâtre des Maestros\', \'text\': "Quand le Théâtre des Maestros arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez-le. Quand vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'île, de marais ou de montagne de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Seuls les artistes extraordinaires ont le privilège de fouler la plus grande scène de la Nouvelle-Capenna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd5bf2c9-25ec-4bea-8a6e-41b4ef565da0\', \'multiverseId\': 556235}, \'multiverseid\': 556235}, {\'name\': \'Teatro dei Maestro\', \'text\': \'Quando il Teatro dei Maestro entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrificalo. Quando lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Isola, Palude o Montagna base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola e guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Solo artisti straordinari ricevono l\'invito a onorare il più grandioso palcoscenico di Nuova Capenna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282fe06f-6a61-4a7b-a80c-ff407f7985f4\', \'multiverseId\': 556496}, \'multiverseid\': 556496}, {\'name\': \'貴顕廊一家の劇場\', \'text\': \'貴顕廊一家の劇場が戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーから基本であり島や沼や山であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直し、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'飛びぬけた役者のみが、ニューカペナ最大の舞台を美しく飾る栄誉に招待されるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49a47205-d82a-4ae7-a562-7c95856bcd3f\', \'multiverseId\': 556757}, \'multiverseid\': 556757}, {\'name\': \'마에스트로스 극장\', \'text\': \'마에스트로스 극장이 전장에 들어올 때, 마에스트로스 극장을 희생한다. 그렇게 할 때, 당신의 서고에서 기본 섬, 늪 또는 산 카드 한 장을 찾아, 그 카드를 탭된 채로 전장에 놓은 후, 서고를 섞고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'비범한 연기자들만이 뉴 카펜나에서 가장 웅장한 무대를 빛낼 수 있게 초대된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f41f09a8-7649-46a9-8062-b2f0671e85f7\', \'multiverseId\': 557018}, \'multiverseid\': 557018}, {\'name\': \'Teatro dos Maestros\', \'text\': \'Quando Teatro dos Maestros entrar no campo de batalha, sacrifique-o. Quando fizer isso, procure em seu grimório um card de Ilha, Pântano ou Montanha básico, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado, depois embaralhe e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Só os artistas mais extraordinários são convidados para o maior palco de Nova Capenna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a32133-ed06-412c-8f4e-8ecf9c3b2a61\', \'multiverseId\': 557279}, \'multiverseid\': 557279}, {\'name\': \'Театр Маэстро\', \'text\': \'Когда Театр Маэстро выходит на поле битвы, пожертвуйте его. Когда вы это делаете, найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базового Острова, Болота или Горы, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте библиотеку, и вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Почтить своим присутствием величайшую сцену Новой Капенны приглашают только самых выдающихся исполнителей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8826cdea-e1a7-4da3-a3ba-e147fe27d1c0\', \'multiverseId\': 557540}, \'multiverseid\': 557540}, {\'name\': \'绝艺盟剧场\', \'text\': \'当绝艺盟剧场进战场时，将它牺牲。当你如此作时，从你牌库中搜寻一张基本的海岛，沼泽或山脉牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'只有最优秀的演出者才会获邀登上新卡佩纳最豪华的舞台。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20f1a778-11cf-49e3-84ef-b5ec3468a4cd\', \'multiverseId\': 557801}, \'multiverseid\': 557801}, {\'name\': \'絕藝盟劇場\', \'text\': \'當絕藝盟劇場進戰場時，將它犧牲。當你如此作時，從你牌庫中搜尋一張基本的海島，沼澤或山脈牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'只有最優秀的演出者才會獲邀登上新卡佩納最豪華的舞台。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e7c2c39-9712-4baa-ae40-929a79dc5da7\', \'multiverseId\': 558062}, \'multiverseid\': 558062}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bürger-Brechstange\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Bürger-Brechstange ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen und weißen Bürger-Kreaturenspielstein und lege die Bürger-Brechstange dann an ihn an.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat „{W}, {T}, opfere die Bürger-Brechstange: Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl."\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555470&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1688595f-56e6-4199-8610-f11521e009af\', \'multiverseId\': 555470}, \'multiverseid\': 555470}, {\'name\': \'Barreta de ciudadano\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Barreta de ciudadano entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Ciudadano verde y blanca 1/1 y luego anéxale la Barreta de ciudadano.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene "{W}, {T}, sacrificar la Barreta de ciudadano: Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo".\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d9e8c8e-d7c4-4138-ac91-293c297d43c5\', \'multiverseId\': 555731}, \'multiverseid\': 555731}, {\'name\': \'Pied de biche de citoyen\', \'text\': "Quand le Pied de biche de citoyen arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte et blanche Citoyen, puis attachez-lui le Pied de biche de citoyen.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+1 et a « {W}, {T}, sacrifiez le Pied de biche de citoyen : Détruisez un artefact ciblé ou un enchantement ciblé. »\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555992&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a517d432-4f10-4f4b-8908-f32de39c55d2\', \'multiverseId\': 555992}, \'multiverseid\': 555992}, {\'name\': \'Piede di Porco del Cittadino\', \'text\': \'Quando il Piede di Porco del Cittadino entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Cittadino 1/1 verde e bianca, poi assegnale il Piede di Porco del Cittadino.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1 e ha "{W}, {T}, Sacrifica il Piede di Porco del Cittadino: Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio".\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0102d39-92f2-4594-b2f0-9fc0c84dbe5a\', \'multiverseId\': 556253}, \'multiverseid\': 556253}, {\'name\': \'市民の鉄梃\', \'text\': \'市民の鉄梃が戦場に出たとき、緑白の１/１の市民・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、市民の鉄梃をそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、「{W}, {T}, 市民の鉄梃を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。」を持つ。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb47dec3-3e02-4b4f-8122-73ec9369eb3d\', \'multiverseId\': 556514}, \'multiverseid\': 556514}, {\'name\': \'시민의 쇠지렛대\', \'text\': \'시민의 쇠지렛대가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 녹색 및 백색 시민 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든 후, 시민의 쇠지렛대를 그 생물에 부착한다.\\n장착된 생물은 +1/+1을 받고 "{W}, {T}, 시민의 쇠지렛대를 희생한다: 마법물체 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다."를 가진다.\\n장착 {2} ({2}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 집중마법 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32988e8f-3ba4-4f2d-840c-4123e2d6bb59\', \'multiverseId\': 556775}, \'multiverseid\': 556775}, {\'name\': \'Pé de Cabra do Cidadão\', \'text\': \'Quando Pé de Cabra do Cidadão entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura Cidadão verde e branca 1/1 e depois anexe Pé de Cabra do Cidadão a ela.\\nA criatura equipada recebe +1/+1 e tem "{W}, {T}, sacrifique Pé de Cabra do Cidadão: Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo".\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e5f8a01-90f4-40bf-9e39-869b3a7bb658\', \'multiverseId\': 557036}, \'multiverseid\': 557036}, {\'name\': \'Лом Гражданина\', \'text\': \'Когда Лом Гражданина выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый и белый Гражданин, затем прикрепите к ней Лом Гражданина.\\nСнаряженное существо получает +1/+1 и имеет способность «{W}, {T}, пожертвуйте Лом Гражданина: уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары».\\nСнарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e90637b1-20dc-4d8b-b52e-3cb95917a5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 557297}, \'multiverseid\': 557297}, {\'name\': \'市民撬棒\', \'text\': \'当市民撬棒进战场时，派出一个1/1，绿白双色的市民衍生生物，然后将市民撬棒贴附于其上。\\n佩带此武具的生物得+1/+1且具有「{W}，{T}，牺牲市民撬棒：消灭目标神器或结界。」\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'486660e6-0eb1-4095-8d9b-4d9cc052e969\', \'multiverseId\': 557558}, \'multiverseid\': 557558}, {\'name\': \'市民撬棒\', \'text\': \'當市民撬棒進戰場時，派出一個1/1，綠白雙色的市民衍生生物，然後將市民撬棒貼附於其上。\\n佩帶此武具的生物得+1/+1且具有「{W}，{T}，犧牲市民撬棒：消滅目標神器或結界。」\\n佩帶{2}（{2}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54193393-fcd2-45ba-a324-7a1705866b48\', \'multiverseId\': 557819}, \'multiverseid\': 557819}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cabaretti-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Cabaretti-Amulett fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Kreaturen kontrollierst.\\n• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Erzeuge zwei 1/1 grüne und weiße Bürger-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555635&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'635f3150-6460-4931-941e-6ce6f11d9bcb\', \'multiverseId\': 555635}, \'multiverseid\': 555635}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de los Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Amuleto de los Cabaretti hace una cantidad de daño igual a la cantidad de criaturas que controlas a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\n• Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\\n• Crea dos fichas de criatura Ciudadano verdes y blancas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'201e3f50-3161-4584-a710-313df6b24d58\', \'multiverseId\': 555896}, \'multiverseid\': 555896}, {\'name\': \'Charme des Cabaretti\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Charme des Cabaretti inflige un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\n• Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 verte et blanche Citoyen.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556157&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe357c98-d53c-47dc-9486-2d8fcc5d9773\', \'multiverseId\': 556157}, \'multiverseid\': 556157}, {\'name\': \'Talismano dei Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Il Talismano dei Cabaretti infligge a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio danno pari al numero di creature che controlli.\\n• Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Crea due pedine creatura Cittadino 1/1 verdi e bianche.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'998ea21d-33d7-4076-aae9-c01c4f72a89b\', \'multiverseId\': 556418}, \'multiverseid\': 556418}, {\'name\': \'舞台座一家の魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。舞台座一家の魔除けはそれに、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\\n• 緑白の１/１の市民・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146702fc-4edc-4432-97a2-10dcff3ca747\', \'multiverseId\': 556679}, \'multiverseid\': 556679}, {\'name\': \'카바레티 부적\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 카바레티 부적은 그 목표에게 당신이 조종하는 생물 수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\\n• 1/1 녹색 및 백색 시민 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34114a2b-6c53-476a-aa97-baf33a4386e6\', \'multiverseId\': 556940}, \'multiverseid\': 556940}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto dos Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Amuleto dos Cabaretti causa à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo dano igual ao número de criaturas que você controla.\\n• As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham atropelar até o final do turno.\\n• Crie duas fichas de criatura Cidadão verde e branca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef11545f-e870-4fca-a123-eaa09a97783b\', \'multiverseId\': 557201}, \'multiverseid\': 557201}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Кабаретти\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Талисман Кабаретти наносит целевому существу или planeswalker\'у повреждения, равные количеству существ под вашим контролем.\\n• Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\\n• Создайте две фишки существа 1/1 зеленый и белый Гражданин.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed65e2cd-4ef9-428e-a8d5-d4e2c40067d1\', \'multiverseId\': 557462}, \'multiverseid\': 557462}, {\'name\': \'乐舞会护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•乐舞会护符对目标生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的生物数量。\\n•直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得践踏异能。\\n•派出两个1/1，绿白双色的市民衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ef5d248-1f6b-46c0-ad4e-a0d317bfde54\', \'multiverseId\': 557723}, \'multiverseid\': 557723}, {\'name\': \'樂舞會護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•樂舞會護符對目標生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於由你操控的生物數量。\\n•直到回合結束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且獲得踐踏異能。\\n•派出兩個1/1，綠白雙色的市民衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9300b0e-5967-498f-b62e-b9a4690b6ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 557984}, \'multiverseid\': 557984}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cabaretti-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Cabaretti-Amulett fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Kreaturen kontrollierst.\\n• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Erzeuge zwei 1/1 grüne und weiße Bürger-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558743&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c87fee7-1179-4858-8e51-a3165b3aa29d\', \'multiverseId\': 558743}, \'multiverseid\': 558743}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de los Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Amuleto de los Cabaretti hace una cantidad de daño igual a la cantidad de criaturas que controlas a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\n• Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\\n• Crea dos fichas de criatura Ciudadano verdes y blancas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'013cfc63-6475-4a9d-a532-9e89691e47b2\', \'multiverseId\': 558788}, \'multiverseid\': 558788}, {\'name\': \'Charme des Cabaretti\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Charme des Cabaretti inflige un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\n• Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 verte et blanche Citoyen.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558833&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0242a2f-1ecb-4133-b307-5b5541437562\', \'multiverseId\': 558833}, \'multiverseid\': 558833}, {\'name\': \'Talismano dei Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Il Talismano dei Cabaretti infligge a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio danno pari al numero di creature che controlli.\\n• Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Crea due pedine creatura Cittadino 1/1 verdi e bianche.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6f822aa-3ec5-41b4-a7b0-61221b54e597\', \'multiverseId\': 558878}, \'multiverseid\': 558878}, {\'name\': \'舞台座一家の魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。舞台座一家の魔除けはそれに、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\\n• 緑白の１/１の市民・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff75276-70b9-4bf9-881d-26cb31437caf\', \'multiverseId\': 558923}, \'multiverseid\': 558923}, {\'name\': \'카바레티 부적\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 카바레티 부적은 그 목표에게 당신이 조종하는 생물 수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\\n• 1/1 녹색 및 백색 시민 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a812580d-e31c-46ce-a88e-720f2dce4e0c\', \'multiverseId\': 558968}, \'multiverseid\': 558968}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto dos Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Amuleto dos Cabaretti causa à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo dano igual ao número de criaturas que você controla.\\n• As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham atropelar até o final do turno.\\n• Crie duas fichas de criatura Cidadão verde e branca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f5f2c31-0e8d-4980-b20c-8fbd87aa346a\', \'multiverseId\': 559013}, \'multiverseid\': 559013}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Кабаретти\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Талисман Кабаретти наносит целевому существу или planeswalker\'у повреждения, равные количеству существ под вашим контролем.\\n• Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\\n• Создайте две фишки существа 1/1 зеленый и белый Гражданин.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fff1efc0-466b-4d7b-9c30-6b51d61bbb71\', \'multiverseId\': 559058}, \'multiverseid\': 559058}, {\'name\': \'乐舞会护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•乐舞会护符对目标生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的生物数量。\\n•直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得践踏异能。\\n•派出两个1/1，绿白双色的市民衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1eeacf1-ddad-4729-bdd8-2a0df72b8f2e\', \'multiverseId\': 559103}, \'multiverseid\': 559103}, {\'name\': \'樂舞會護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•樂舞會護符對目標生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於由你操控的生物數量。\\n•直到回合結束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且獲得踐踏異能。\\n•派出兩個1/1，綠白雙色的市民衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1056f76-18b6-4e6d-9f75-f55f6ad96478\', \'multiverseId\': 559148}, \'multiverseid\': 559148}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cabaretti-Eingeweihter\', \'text\': \'{2}{R/W}: Der Cabaretti-Eingeweihte erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Waschbär, Bürger\', \'flavor\': \'„Das ist ein Kerl, der weiß, wie man Spaß hat!"\\n—Jetmir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555599&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68449b81-befb-4e9c-a285-d8843b165f37\', \'multiverseId\': 555599}, \'multiverseid\': 555599}, {\'name\': \'Novato de los Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'{2}{R/W}: El Novato de los Cabaretti gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano mapache\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Ese sí sabe cómo pasarlo en grande!".\\n—Jétmir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ccfc7cf-ca5d-47d4-a725-d4da19fa72ac\', \'multiverseId\': 555860}, \'multiverseid\': 555860}, {\'name\': \'Adepte des Cabaretti\', \'text\': "{2}{R/W} : L\'Adepte des Cabaretti acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : raton-laveur et citoyen\', \'flavor\': "« Ça c\'est un gars qui sait s\'amuser ! »\\n—Jetmir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556121&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d64d0f-39bd-4a78-8fa2-840fe75144d1\', \'multiverseId\': 556121}, \'multiverseid\': 556121}, {\'name\': \'Iniziato dei Cabaretti\', \'text\': "{2}{R/W}: L\'Iniziato dei Cabaretti ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Procione\', \'flavor\': \'"Ecco, quel tipo sì che sa come divertirsi!"\\n—Jetmir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14ff7ce7-6ab3-4143-b3e7-c8353ad69560\', \'multiverseId\': 556382}, \'multiverseid\': 556382}, {\'name\': \'舞台座一家の新入り\', \'text\': \'{2}{R/W}：ターン終了時まで、舞台座一家の新入りは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アライグマ・市民\', \'flavor\': \'「楽しい時間の過ごし方を知る仲間がここに！」\\n――ジェトミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a9e3dd7-3504-465e-8413-e3caca37f3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 556643}, \'multiverseid\': 556643}, {\'name\': \'카바레티 입회자\', \'text\': \'{2}{R/W}: 카바레티 입회자는 턴종료까지 이단공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 너구리 시민\', \'flavor\': \'"이제야 재미있게 노는 게 뭔지를 아는 친구가 생겼군!"\\n—제트미어\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ce3f81-c960-40c1-8dc4-190263fb4006\', \'multiverseId\': 556904}, \'multiverseid\': 556904}, {\'name\': \'Iniciado dos Cabaretti\', \'text\': \'{2}{R/W}: Iniciado dos Cabaretti ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guaxinim Cidadão\', \'flavor\': \'"Esse aí sabe se divertir!"\\n— Jetmir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2e7460c-dae2-466f-986e-5d46b490cb2b\', \'multiverseId\': 557165}, \'multiverseid\': 557165}, {\'name\': \'Новичок Кабаретти\', \'text\': \'{2}{R/W}: Новичок Кабаретти получает Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Енот Гражданин\', \'flavor\': \'«Вот этот малый знает, что значит хорошо повеселиться!»\\n— Джетмир\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca5cad83-bdcc-47e1-8937-9faa1e489c3e\', \'multiverseId\': 557426}, \'multiverseid\': 557426}, {\'name\': \'乐舞会新手\', \'text\': \'{2}{R/W}：乐舞会新手获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～浣熊／市民\', \'flavor\': \'「终于有人知道该如何享受好时光了！」\\n～杰米尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd615df6-afe1-4b01-a66a-ac39406c382a\', \'multiverseId\': 557687}, \'multiverseid\': 557687}, {\'name\': \'樂舞會新手\', \'text\': \'{2}{R/W}：樂舞會新手獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～浣熊／市民\', \'flavor\': \'「終於有人知道該如何享受好時光了！」\\n～傑米爾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93c6b020-b0e8-40a4-98f5-fae1f5fca42a\', \'multiverseId\': 557948}, \'multiverseid\': 557948}]', '[{\'name\': \'Caldaia-Anpackerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Caldaia-Anpackerin ins Spiel kommt, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nBlitz {3}{G} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Blitz-Kosten wirkst, erhält er Eile und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, ziehe eine Karte." Opfere diese Kreatur zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555600&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1822380-70b1-42d2-867b-90ac32517fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 555600}, \'multiverseid\': 555600}, {\'name\': \'Intimidadora de Caldaia\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Intimidadora de Caldaia entre al campo de batalla, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\nIrrupción {3}{G}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de irrupción, gana la habilidad de prisa y "Cuando esta criatura muera, roba una carta". Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73aaf895-69f3-44ab-858d-393e3a24dc3e\', \'multiverseId\': 555861}, \'multiverseid\': 555861}, {\'name\': \'Fière-à-bras de Caldaïa\', \'text\': \'Quand la Fière-à-bras de Caldaïa arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\nBlitz {3}{G} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de blitz, il acquiert la célérité et « Quand cette créature meurt, piochez une carte. » Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5618365a-2225-4e98-8a9a-5cac05c2e51b\', \'multiverseId\': 556122}, \'multiverseid\': 556122}, {\'name\': \'Picchiatrice di Caldaia\', \'text\': \'Quando la Picchiatrice di Caldaia entra nel campo di battaglia, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\nBlitz {3}{G} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di blitz, ha rapidità e "Quando questa creatura muore, pesca una carta". Sacrificala all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddf365fa-a526-4c48-94a1-7dae7e95df3a\', \'multiverseId\': 556383}, \'multiverseid\': 556383}, {\'name\': \'カルダイヤの力自慢\', \'text\': \'カルダイヤの力自慢が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n奇襲{3}{G} （あなたがこの呪文を奇襲コストで唱えたなら、これは速攻と「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、カード１枚を引く。」を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3511a6-b7bd-45a6-ba4d-7d9aad5f5c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 556644}, \'multiverseid\': 556644}, {\'name\': \'칼다이아 차력사\', \'text\': \'칼다이아 차력사가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\\n기습 {3}{G} (기습 비용을 지불해서 이 주문을 발동했다면, 이 생물은 신속 및 "이 생물이 죽을 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 얻는다. 다음 종료단 시작에 이 생물을 희생한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb86eea-183e-489e-93d6-c4d2b2749191\', \'multiverseId\': 556905}, \'multiverseid\': 556905}, {\'name\': \'Valentona de Caldaia\', \'text\': \'Quando Valentona de Caldaia entrar no campo de batalha, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\\nBlitz {3}{G} (Se você conjura esta mágica por seu custo de blitz, ela ganha ímpeto e "Quando esta criatura morrer, compre um card". Sacrifique-a no início da próxima etapa final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1859e67-2e62-45c7-91c4-f0806dc43262\', \'multiverseId\': 557166}, \'multiverseid\': 557166}, {\'name\': \'Калдайская Силачка\', \'text\': \'Когда Калдайская Силачка выходит на поле битвы, положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо.\\nБлиц {3}{G} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за его стоимость Блица, оно получает Ускорение и способность «Когда это существо умирает, возьмите карту». Пожертвуйте его в начале следующего заключительного шага.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eed3089-8133-4b8b-8a29-2358c1ff7457\', \'multiverseId\': 557427}, \'multiverseid\': 557427}, {\'name\': \'柯达亚强人\', \'text\': \'当柯达亚强人进战场时，在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n急袭{3}{G}（如果你支付此咒语的急袭费用来施放之，则它获得敏捷与「当此生物死去时，抓一张牌。」在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30c4e7e-2e05-4b34-8108-132022e228c8\', \'multiverseId\': 557688}, \'multiverseid\': 557688}, {\'name\': \'柯達亞強人\', \'text\': \'當柯達亞強人進戰場時，在目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n急襲{3}{G}（如果你支付此咒語的急襲費用來施放之，則它獲得敏捷與「當此生物死去時，抽一張牌。」在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它犧牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4783e1f3-4d8d-4723-8e91-023f74f0277f\', \'multiverseId\': 557949}, \'multiverseid\': 557949}]', '[{\'name\': \'Capenna-Express\', \'text\': \'Opfere einen Schatz: Der Capenna-Express wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.\\nBemannen 3 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 3 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f3d31ba-e912-4981-8029-84ca4bbbbcfe\', \'multiverseId\': 555601}, \'multiverseid\': 555601}, {\'name\': \'Capenna Express\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar un Tesoro: El Capenna Express se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.\\nTripular 3. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 3 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac9d9d4b-55d9-462f-a0fa-613082e76f85\', \'multiverseId\': 555862}, \'multiverseid\': 555862}, {\'name\': \'Express de Capenna\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez un trésor : l\'Express de Capenna devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPilotage 3 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 3 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a38b574a-ad2f-42c6-8d6c-8128c4ffb32c\', \'multiverseId\': 556123}, \'multiverseid\': 556123}, {\'name\': \'Espresso di Capenna\', \'text\': "Sacrifica un Tesoro: L\'Espresso di Capenna diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.\\nManovrare 3 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 3: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f252d426-0f1f-4b95-ab03-a32e7b37f9e9\', \'multiverseId\': 556384}, \'multiverseid\': 556384}, {\'name\': \'カペナ特急\', \'text\': \'宝物１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、カペナ特急はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\\n搭乗３（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が３以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7379e42-da4d-4e02-be56-b3ebcafae157\', \'multiverseId\': 556645}, \'multiverseid\': 556645}, {\'name\': \'카펜나 특급열차\', \'text\': \'보물 토큰 한 개를 희생한다: 카펜나 특급열차는 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.\\n탑승 3 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 3 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'720b1bda-4694-4709-a3e8-aa72d3869673\', \'multiverseId\': 556906}, \'multiverseid\': 556906}, {\'name\': \'Expresso de Capenna\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique um Tesouro: Expresso de Capenna torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.\\nTripular 3 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 3: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b82515b0-bbdd-4eb7-a36f-f113889b12f1\', \'multiverseId\': 557167}, \'multiverseid\': 557167}, {\'name\': \'Капеннский Экспресс\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте Клад: Капеннский Экспресс становится артефактом существом до конца хода.\\nЭкипаж 3 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 3 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eacd631-5096-497e-9c79-f4c209e7a6db\', \'multiverseId\': 557428}, \'multiverseid\': 557428}, {\'name\': \'卡佩纳特快\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个珍宝：卡佩纳特快成为神器生物直到回合结束。\\n搭载3（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于3的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c1aaac-9ab4-4b7d-a985-5fec4b9f8749\', \'multiverseId\': 557689}, \'multiverseid\': 557689}, {\'name\': \'卡佩納特快\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個珍寶：卡佩納特快成為神器生物直到回合結束。\\n搭載3（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於3的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e11fda01-121f-4f37-a06e-339cda9c250b\', \'multiverseId\': 557950}, \'multiverseid\': 557950}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaos-Patrouille\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nImmer wenn die Chaos-Patrouille angreift, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nBlitz {1}{R} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Blitz-Kosten wirkst, erhält er Eile und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, ziehe eine Karte." Opfere diese Kreatur zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e29d9d72-4c1c-4940-9224-4385e31dbc38\', \'multiverseId\': 555576}, \'multiverseid\': 555576}, {\'name\': \'Patrulla caótica\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\nSiempre que la Patrulla caótica ataque, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nIrrupción {1}{R}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de irrupción, gana la habilidad de prisa y "Cuando esta criatura muera, roba una carta". Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero diablo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd01bc3b-3efa-4322-81af-00bc6eddf6d8\', \'multiverseId\': 555837}, \'multiverseid\': 555837}, {\'name\': \'Patrouille du chaos\', \'text\': "Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Patrouille du chaos attaque, une créature ciblée gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nBlitz {1}{R} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de blitz, il acquiert la célérité et « Quand cette créature meurt, piochez une carte. » Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.)", \'type\': \'Créature : diable et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7956ab75-3052-4245-a7d1-0a0bb5de659b\', \'multiverseId\': 556098}, \'multiverseid\': 556098}, {\'name\': \'Pattuglia del Pandemonio\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Pattuglia del Pandemonio attacca, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nBlitz {1}{R} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di blitz, ha rapidità e "Quando questa creatura muore, pesca una carta". Sacrificala all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Diavolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce426c66-55d2-49b0-b53e-3491d8e213b6\', \'multiverseId\': 556359}, \'multiverseid\': 556359}, {\'name\': \'騒乱の巡回者\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\n騒乱の巡回者が攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n奇襲{1}{R} （あなたがこの呪文を奇襲コストで唱えたなら、これは速攻と「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、カード１枚を引く。」を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62671094-b786-48d8-bdeb-d3b421408834\', \'multiverseId\': 556620}, \'multiverseid\': 556620}, {\'name\': \'아수라장 순찰대\', \'text\': \'호전적 (이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)\\n아수라장 순찰대가 공격할 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\\n기습 {1}{R} (기습 비용을 지불해서 이 주문을 발동했다면, 이 생물은 신속 및 "이 생물이 죽을 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 얻는다. 다음 종료단 시작에 이 생물을 희생한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악령 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edca0faf-2832-481a-9756-29a9bd06dd8b\', \'multiverseId\': 556881}, \'multiverseid\': 556881}, {\'name\': \'Patrulheira do Pandemônio\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\\nToda vez que Patrulheira do Pandemônio ataca, a criatura alvo recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\nBlitz {1}{R} (Se você conjura esta mágica por seu custo de blitz, ela ganha ímpeto e "Quando esta criatura morrer, compre um card". Sacrifique-a no início da próxima etapa final.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabo Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52669748-d26c-4e60-b572-2b2378480741\', \'multiverseId\': 557142}, \'multiverseid\': 557142}, {\'name\': \'Патрульная Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Угроза (Это существо не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Патрульная Хаоса атакует, целевое существо получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\\nБлиц {1}{R} (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за его стоимость Блица, оно получает Ускорение и способность «Когда это существо умирает, возьмите карту». Пожертвуйте его в начале следующего заключительного шага.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дьявол Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d127ae3-ee31-420c-8a96-0147f77dee03\', \'multiverseId\': 557403}, \'multiverseid\': 557403}, {\'name\': \'破坏巡卫\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n每当破坏巡卫攻击时，目标生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n急袭{1}{R}（如果你支付此咒语的急袭费用来施放之，则它获得敏捷与「当此生物死去时，抓一张牌。」在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e2c3db-69c2-4e45-870c-e8978b7b3891\', \'multiverseId\': 557664}, \'multiverseid\': 557664}, {\'name\': \'破壞巡衛\', \'text\': \'威懾（此生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\\n每當破壞巡衛攻擊時，目標生物得+1/+0直到回合結束。\\n急襲{1}{R}（如果你支付此咒語的急襲費用來施放之，則它獲得敏捷與「當此生物死去時，抽一張牌。」在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它犧牲。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84ab6056-bcee-4d48-a181-8cfda5a18ab2\', \'multiverseId\': 557925}, \'multiverseid\': 557925}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromkatze\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Chromkatze ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sage immer ‚Wenn es atmet, lügt es.\\\' Zum Glück tut mein Freund hier weder das eine noch das andere."\\n—Fürst Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555698&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c812ba3f-47bb-43da-b4ba-be93b4e50390\', \'multiverseId\': 555698}, \'multiverseid\': 555698}, {\'name\': \'Gato de cromo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gato de cromo entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre digo que si respira, miente. Menos mal que este amigo mío no hace ninguna de las dos cosas".\\n—Don Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa1969b-5316-4051-93b0-d47a49811506\', \'multiverseId\': 555959}, \'multiverseid\': 555959}, {\'name\': \'Chat de chrome\', \'text\': \'Quand Le Chat de chrome arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : chat\', \'flavor\': \'« Je dis toujours : "si ça respire, c\\\'est que ça ment." Heureusement, mon ami ici présent ne fait aucun des deux. »\\n—Seigneur Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abfc4a90-fc06-4a54-b9de-4dc5dc190f89\', \'multiverseId\': 556220}, \'multiverseid\': 556220}, {\'name\': \'Gatto Cromato\', \'text\': \'Quando il Gatto Cromato entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Come dico sempre: \\\'Se respira, sta mentendo.\\\' Fortunatamente il mio amico qui non fa né l\\\'uno né l\\\'altro."\\n—Lord Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16580682-c88f-48fc-a188-c2f7ae2a64d5\', \'multiverseId\': 556481}, \'multiverseid\': 556481}, {\'name\': \'金属猫\', \'text\': \'金属猫が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'「私は常々言っている、『息をしている奴は嘘をついている。』とね。幸いなことに、この私の友人はどちらもしていないのだよ。」\\n――ザンダー卿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac3c0e0-1df4-4947-a8a1-9850c5c2ac24\', \'multiverseId\': 556742}, \'multiverseid\': 556742}, {\'name\': \'크롬 고양이\', \'text\': \'크롬 고양이가 전장에 들어올 때, 점술 1을 한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': \'"난 항상 \\\'숨을 쉬는 녀석은, 거짓말을 한다.\\\'고 말하곤 하지. 운 좋게도 여기 있는 내 친구는 그 두 개를 다 안 해."\\n—잰더 경\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'620befde-01b9-4b9b-aff0-eb44a9df8683\', \'multiverseId\': 557003}, \'multiverseid\': 557003}, {\'name\': \'Gato Cromado\', \'text\': \'Quando Gato Cromado entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu sempre digo: \\\'Se está respirando, está mentindo.\\\' Por sorte meu amigo aqui não faz nenhum dos dois."\\n— Don Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efc541af-c11b-4d58-8af4-7b204fff056e\', \'multiverseId\': 557264}, \'multiverseid\': 557264}, {\'name\': \'Хромированная Кошка\', \'text\': \'Когда Хромированная Кошка выходит на поле битвы, предскажите 1.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'«Я всегда говорю: если кто-то дышит, то он лжет. К счастью, мой друг не делает ни того, ни другого».\\n— Лорд Зандер\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113c9557-4ffc-4b49-8111-aea769d0ee0e\', \'multiverseId\': 557525}, \'multiverseid\': 557525}, {\'name\': \'铬亮猫\', \'text\': \'当铬亮猫进战场时，占卜1。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': \'「我常说，『只要是会呼吸的，都会撒谎。』幸好我这位朋友都不会。」\\n～尚夺尔勋爵\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7067fcef-53c8-49e5-aabc-c665e10454bb\', \'multiverseId\': 557786}, \'multiverseid\': 557786}, {\'name\': \'鉻亮貓\', \'text\': \'當鉻亮貓進戰場時，占卜1。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～貓\', \'flavor\': \'「我常說，『只要是會呼吸的，都會撒謊。』幸好我這位朋友都不會。」\\n～尚奪爾勳爵\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f5d66af-2eeb-43b1-b509-02dbc11fb2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 558047}, \'multiverseid\': 558047}]', "[{'name': 'Comitato di Benvenuto al Galà', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558111&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '460db3d4-5c50-4c2c-a066-a4e264ecbb1e', 'multiverseId': 558111}, 'multiverseid': 558111}]", '[{\'name\': \'Cormela die Glamour-Diebin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}{R}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Spontanzauber und/oder Hexereien zu wirken.\\nWenn Cormela die Glamour-Diebin stirbt, bringe bis zu eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Sie sieht die Welt als Geschenk, das für sie bestimmt ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555639&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f16e70-c414-4a09-b75b-44962cdb36ae\', \'multiverseId\': 555639}, \'multiverseid\': 555639}, {\'name\': \'Cormela, ladrona de glamur\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}{R}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de instantáneo y/o de conjuro.\\nCuando Cormela, ladrona de glamur muera, regresa hasta una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Ve el mundo como un regalo solo para ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81fedb5a-c8da-4cdd-8464-926fdf905ce2\', \'multiverseId\': 555900}, \'multiverseid\': 555900}, {\'name\': \'Cormela, voleuse majestueuse\', \'text\': "Célérité\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}{R}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel.\\nQuand Cormela, voleuse majestueuse meurt, renvoyez jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Elle voit le monde comme un cadeau qui lui est destiné.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd74c5fb-0eac-420b-ac26-42f242427bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 556161}, \'multiverseid\': 556161}, {\'name\': \'Cormela, Ladra Affascinante\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}{R}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie istantaneo e/o stregoneria.\\nQuando Cormela, Ladra Affascinante muore, riprendi in mano fino a una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Vede il mondo come un dono destinato a lei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae33292f-f186-4daa-adc7-d883efa1e042\', \'multiverseId\': 556422}, \'multiverseid\': 556422}, {\'name\': \'妖艶な泥棒、コルメラ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n{1}, {T}：{U}{B}{R}を加える。このマナはインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\\n妖艶な泥棒、コルメラが死亡したとき、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード最大１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は世界を、自分への贈り物と見ている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a8b44c-2977-45b9-9601-f690e7d65e81\', \'multiverseId\': 556683}, \'multiverseid\': 556683}, {\'name\': \'화려함을 훔치는 도둑, 코르멜라\', \'text\': \'신속\\n{1}, {T}: {U}{B}{R}를 추가한다. 이 마나는 순간마법 및/또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하는 데에만 사용할 수 있다.\\n화려함을 훔치는 도둑, 코르멜라가 죽을 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 흡혈귀 도적\', \'flavor\': \'그녀는 이 세계가 자신에게 주어진 선물이라고 생각한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f49ec80b-5b3c-465d-aba2-689a59e7545b\', \'multiverseId\': 556944}, \'multiverseid\': 556944}, {\'name\': \'Cormela, Ladra de Glamour\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{B}{R}. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas instantâneas e/ou feitiços.\\nQuando Cormela, Ladra de Glamour, morrer, devolva até um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Ela vê o mundo como um presente destinado a ela.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3762d1a8-f708-4f96-b35d-131e133454de\', \'multiverseId\': 557205}, \'multiverseid\': 557205}, {\'name\': \'Кормела, Очаровательная Воровка\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\n{1}, {T}: добавьте {U}{B}{R}. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание мгновенных заклинаний и/или заклинаний волшебства.\\nКогда Кормела, Очаровательная Воровка умирает, верните не более одной целевой карты мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Она воспринимает мир как приготовленный для нее подарок.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91972283-cfe0-4916-8d77-bde000d97694\', \'multiverseId\': 557466}, \'multiverseid\': 557466}, {\'name\': \'美魅盗贼科梅拉\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}{R}。此法术力只能用来施放瞬间和／或法术咒语。\\n当美魅盗贼科梅拉死去时，将至多一张目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'她将世界视作献给她的赠礼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d2d7ed2-2cec-4543-8e7f-7898d09a5c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 557727}, \'multiverseid\': 557727}, {\'name\': \'美魅盜賊科梅拉\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}{R}。此魔法力只能用來施放瞬間和／或巫術咒語。\\n當美魅盜賊科梅拉死去時，將至多一張目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'她將世界視作獻給她的贈禮。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37e3d589-7c91-43d7-b4e0-5899cc802f3d\', \'multiverseId\': 557988}, \'multiverseid\': 557988}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cormela die Glamour-Diebin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}{R}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Spontanzauber und/oder Hexereien zu wirken.\\nWenn Cormela die Glamour-Diebin stirbt, bringe bis zu eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558744&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd898151-1ec5-4f45-853e-0f72b40c1795\', \'multiverseId\': 558744}, \'multiverseid\': 558744}, {\'name\': \'Cormela, ladrona de glamur\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}{R}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de instantáneo y/o de conjuro.\\nCuando Cormela, ladrona de glamur muera, regresa hasta una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7506bca2-3f73-45c3-bce2-fc0250840121\', \'multiverseId\': 558789}, \'multiverseid\': 558789}, {\'name\': \'Cormela, voleuse majestueuse\', \'text\': "Célérité\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}{R}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel.\\nQuand Cormela, voleuse majestueuse meurt, renvoyez jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4d49ce-92f7-4d5c-9088-5f00092221d5\', \'multiverseId\': 558834}, \'multiverseid\': 558834}, {\'name\': \'Cormela, Ladra Affascinante\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}{R}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie istantaneo e/o stregoneria.\\nQuando Cormela, Ladra Affascinante muore, riprendi in mano fino a una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01f2fb2-5577-4b56-83b3-b1b86b0c590a\', \'multiverseId\': 558879}, \'multiverseid\': 558879}, {\'name\': \'妖艶な泥棒、コルメラ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n{1}, {T}：{U}{B}{R}を加える。このマナはインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\\n妖艶な泥棒、コルメラが死亡したとき、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード最大１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe7a088-fd96-48e6-b1ec-6844cb8a7dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 558924}, \'multiverseid\': 558924}, {\'name\': \'화려함을 훔치는 도둑, 코르멜라\', \'text\': \'신속\\n{1}, {T}: {U}{B}{R}를 추가한다. 이 마나는 순간마법 및/또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하는 데에만 사용할 수 있다.\\n화려함을 훔치는 도둑, 코르멜라가 죽을 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 흡혈귀 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42d633cd-1ba5-4438-bda5-47dd651a8c25\', \'multiverseId\': 558969}, \'multiverseid\': 558969}, {\'name\': \'Cormela, Ladra de Glamour\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{B}{R}. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas instantâneas e/ou feitiços.\\nQuando Cormela, Ladra de Glamour, morrer, devolva até um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Vampiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a11a021c-cdb8-4ca0-929b-5cf2551dd774\', \'multiverseId\': 559014}, \'multiverseid\': 559014}, {\'name\': \'Кормела, Очаровательная Воровка\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\n{1}, {T}: добавьте {U}{B}{R}. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание мгновенных заклинаний и/или заклинаний волшебства.\\nКогда Кормела, Очаровательная Воровка умирает, верните не более одной целевой карты мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Вампир Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96c5a00c-3939-4c03-9a30-de33399ffad2\', \'multiverseId\': 559059}, \'multiverseid\': 559059}, {\'name\': \'美魅盗贼科梅拉\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}{R}。此法术力只能用来施放瞬间和／或法术咒语。\\n当美魅盗贼科梅拉死去时，将至多一张目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac6e32de-8491-4453-9787-ae2a34f443dd\', \'multiverseId\': 559104}, \'multiverseid\': 559104}, {\'name\': \'美魅盜賊科梅拉\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}{R}。此魔法力只能用來施放瞬間和／或巫術咒語。\\n當美魅盜賊科梅拉死去時，將至多一張目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0665398-9096-4068-a0a3-8250756e8f08\', \'multiverseId\': 559149}, \'multiverseid\': 559149}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dame mit Begleitung\', \'text\': \'Allianz — Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält die Dame mit Begleitung +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Begrüße meinen kleinen Freund."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555595&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e28126-e8ec-47f2-b576-e2beb25dea89\', \'multiverseId\': 555595}, \'multiverseid\': 555595}, {\'name\': \'Mujer de mundo acompañada\', \'text\': \'Asociación — Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la Mujer de mundo acompañada obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Saluden a mi pequeña amiga".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8754693c-b3a8-4ac0-9004-79ae852d1581\', \'multiverseId\': 555856}, \'multiverseid\': 555856}, {\'name\': \'Mondaine accompagnée\', \'text\': "Alliance — À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la Mondaine accompagnée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Dites bonjour à mon petit ami. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82dd8a7e-d5f3-4328-adb3-51f6fb75f688\', \'multiverseId\': 556117}, \'multiverseid\': 556117}, {\'name\': \'Aristocratica Accompagnata\', \'text\': "Alleanza — Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, l\'Aristocratica Accompagnata prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Saluta il mio nuovo amichetto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d3a9d5f-68a6-49e6-b9be-568c53978c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 556378}, \'multiverseid\': 556378}, {\'name\': \'従者つきの社交家\', \'text\': \'団結 ― これでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、従者つきの社交家は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「私の小さなお友達にご挨拶しなさい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f93efdfd-e671-41a9-8a55-90edfa745178\', \'multiverseId\': 556639}, \'multiverseid\': 556639}, {\'name\': \'수행원을 거느린 사교계 명사\', \'text\': \'연대 — 다른 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 수행원을 거느린 사교계 명사는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"내 꼬마 친구에게 인사해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8fea7d9-25ce-4e18-b2b3-7a14f7ff6c49\', \'multiverseId\': 556900}, \'multiverseid\': 556900}, {\'name\': \'Socialite Acompanhada\', \'text\': \'Aliança — Toda vez que outra criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Socialite Acompanhada recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Diz oi pro meu amiguinho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bcb3807-b42c-4c8a-9e25-92277fafa16d\', \'multiverseId\': 557161}, \'multiverseid\': 557161}, {\'name\': \'Дама с Сопровождением\', \'text\': \'Альянс — Каждый раз, когда другое существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Дама с Сопровождением получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Поздоровайся с моим дружочком».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'365fec94-4ec6-43d0-9f67-e8f951cb2c49\', \'multiverseId\': 557422}, \'multiverseid\': 557422}, {\'name\': \'偕伴名流\', \'text\': \'联手～每当另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，偕伴名流得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「来向我的小宝贝打个招呼吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e32ef967-6a09-4463-8b6f-725f9818b363\', \'multiverseId\': 557683}, \'multiverseid\': 557683}, {\'name\': \'偕伴名流\', \'text\': \'聯手～每當另一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，偕伴名流得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「來向我的小寶貝打個招呼吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec600f8c-9bc6-40fb-a3ca-36a92f6bf1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 557944}, \'multiverseid\': 557944}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dein Schweigen erkaufen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Mikey „die Lippe" behielt seinen Spitznamen auch nach seinem Deal mit Gregorio bei, obwohl er nie wieder ein Wort sprach.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17369e0f-501c-4f94-a8ae-1ee87e244b0e\', \'multiverseId\': 555468}, \'multiverseid\': 555468}, {\'name\': \'Comprar tu silencio\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra. Su controlador crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mikey el Bocazas conservó su apodo después de llegar a un acuerdo con Gregorio, a pesar de que no volvió a pronunciar palabra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8ec472-2f5d-434f-8760-ed389299bb2c\', \'multiverseId\': 555729}, \'multiverseid\': 555729}, {\'name\': \'Acheter votre silence\', \'text\': "Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Mikey « la Parlotte » garda son surnom après son contrat avec Gregorio, même s\'il ne prononça jamais plus un autre mot.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555990&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8ff212-2ce1-4d0e-a8b4-b7d65999ac8f\', \'multiverseId\': 555990}, \'multiverseid\': 555990}, {\'name\': \'Comprare il Silenzio\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Mikey "la Bocca" mantenne il suo soprannome dopo aver stretto un accordo con Gregorio, anche se non proferì mai più un\\\'altra parola.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e400b08-6a42-44ee-828c-6c12e2d50f20\', \'multiverseId\': 556251}, \'multiverseid\': 556251}, {\'name\': \'口止め\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'一言しか発していないにもかかわらず、グレゴーリオとの取引成立にこぎつけた後、「口達者」のマイキーの異名をとるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e6f368-9808-47ff-be0c-dd5f5e1ed066\', \'multiverseId\': 556512}, \'multiverseid\': 556512}, {\'name\': \'돈으로 산 침묵\', \'text\': \'대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다. 그 지속물의 조종자는 보물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (보물 토큰은 "{T}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다."를 가진 마법물체이다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"입담꾼" 마이키는 그레고리오와 계약을 매듭짓고 난 뒤로는 한 마디도 입 밖에 내지 않았음에도 자신의 별명을 유지했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb3ef9e-d491-41c5-abd5-c7299e1fd45d\', \'multiverseId\': 556773}, \'multiverseid\': 556773}, {\'name\': \'Comprar Seu Silêncio\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo não de terreno. O controlador dela cria uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Mikey, o "Bocão", não perdeu o apelido depois de fazer seu acordo com Gregorio, mesmo jamais tendo dito outra palavra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9907757b-0513-46df-ad1d-c5863e37aad1\', \'multiverseId\': 557034}, \'multiverseid\': 557034}, {\'name\': \'Купить Молчание\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент. Контролирующий его игрок создает одну фишку Клада. (Это артефакт со способностью «{T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: добавьте одну ману любого цвета».)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'У Майка, заключившего сделку с Грегорио, так и осталась его старая кличка «Большеротый», хоть с тех пор он не произнес ни единого слова.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18fa7f19-ad86-45ee-a62a-d9d080510452\', \'multiverseId\': 557295}, \'multiverseid\': 557295}, {\'name\': \'付钱堵嘴\', \'text\': \'放逐目标非地永久物。其操控者派出一个珍宝衍生物。（珍宝衍生物是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'大嘴米奇的名号在他和葛古理奥达成交易后依旧保留了下来，虽然他此后再也没说过半句话。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37d3573b-531b-42e4-9a80-8e020d2ac7c9\', \'multiverseId\': 557556}, \'multiverseid\': 557556}, {\'name\': \'付錢堵嘴\', \'text\': \'放逐目標非地永久物。其操控者派出一個珍寶衍生物。（珍寶衍生物是具有「{T}，犧牲此神器：加一點任意顏色的魔法力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'大嘴米奇的名號在他和葛古理奧達成交易後依舊保留了下來，雖然他此後再也沒說過半句話。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ec30cb0-f921-41c3-b42b-8afb362a39fb\', \'multiverseId\': 557817}, \'multiverseid\': 557817}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Maestros beitreten\', \'text\': \'Todesopfer 2 (Sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 2 oder mehr opfern. Wenn du dies tust, kopiere diesen Zauberspruch.)\\nErzeuge einen 4/3 schwarzen Oger-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Du gehörst jetzt zur Familie, mein Großer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db1a1071-f0d2-4929-b64c-5eb86df0d20c\', \'multiverseId\': 555547}, \'multiverseid\': 555547}, {\'name\': \'Unirse a los Maestros\', \'text\': \'Victimizar 2. (Al lanzar este hechizo, puedes sacrificar una criatura con fuerza de 2 o más. Cuando lo hagas, copia este hechizo.)\\nCrea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Ogro negra 4/3.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora somos familia, campeón".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3731bdf-71d7-46b4-acdb-1c87c1a256a7\', \'multiverseId\': 555808}, \'multiverseid\': 555808}, {\'name\': \'Joindre les Maestros\', \'text\': \'Victime 2 (Au moment où vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez sacrifier une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 2. Quand vous faites ainsi, copiez ce sort.)\\nCréez un jeton de créature 4/3 noire Ogre et Guerrier.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Bienvenue dans la famille, mon grand. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556069&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b91c441-044d-46fb-9dd2-d0ce785d87e0\', \'multiverseId\': 556069}, \'multiverseid\': 556069}, {\'name\': \'Unirsi ai Maestro\', \'text\': \'Danno collaterale 2 (Mentre lanci questa magia, puoi sacrificare una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 2. Quando lo fai, copia questa magia.)\\nCrea una pedina creatura Guerriero Ogre 4/3 nera.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Adesso fai parte della famiglia, ragazzone."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a5b726f-97df-4940-b5ef-da139e355c66\', \'multiverseId\': 556330}, \'multiverseid\': 556330}, {\'name\': \'貴顕廊一家への入団\', \'text\': \'犠牲2（あなたがこの呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはパワーが2以上であるクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、この呪文をコピーする。）\\n黒の４/３のオーガ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「晴れて一家の仲間入りだな、デカいの。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcef71b1-274f-4d6e-86af-3ff901cf6f98\', \'multiverseId\': 556591}, \'multiverseid\': 556591}, {\'name\': \'마에스트로스 가입\', \'text\': \'사상자 2 (이 주문을 발동하면서, 당신은 공격력이 2 이상인 생물 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 이 주문을 복사한다.)\\n4/3 흑색 오우거 전사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우린 이제 패밀리야, 덩치."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6edbfcdc-cd23-4624-987e-cd6ef4523605\', \'multiverseId\': 556852}, \'multiverseid\': 556852}, {\'name\': \'Ingressar nos Maestros\', \'text\': \'Baixa 2 (Conforme você conjura esta mágica, você pode sacrificar uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 2. Quando fizer isso, copie esta mágica.)\\nCrie uma ficha de criatura Ogro Guerreiro preta 4/3.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora você é da família, grandão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0feb07-b4c7-455c-9c90-623721506f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 557113}, \'multiverseid\': 557113}, {\'name\': \'Присоединиться к Маэстро\', \'text\': \'Потери 2 (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете пожертвовать существо с силой 2 или больше. Когда вы это делаете, скопируйте это заклинание.)\\nСоздайте одну фишку существа 4/3 черный Огр Воин.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Теперь мы одна семья, здоровяк».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9958a2b-4fea-4774-a43d-160b15f0242b\', \'multiverseId\': 557374}, \'multiverseid\': 557374}, {\'name\': \'投身绝艺盟\', \'text\': \'催命2（于你施放此咒语时，你可以牺牲一个力量等于或大于2的生物。当你如此作时，复制此咒语。）\\n派出一个4/3黑色食人魔／战士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「大块头，我们现在是一家人了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c72cb51-9509-4d3d-af8e-315ba3e62b32\', \'multiverseId\': 557635}, \'multiverseid\': 557635}, {\'name\': \'投身絕藝盟\', \'text\': \'催命2（於你施放此咒語時，你可以犧牲一個力量等於或大於2的生物。當你如此作時，複製此咒語。）\\n派出一個4/3黑色食人魔／戰士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「大塊頭，我們現在是一家人了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'499674aa-5947-4072-9a42-e7e7dc2f86b5\', \'multiverseId\': 557896}, \'multiverseid\': 557896}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Wahrheit extrahieren\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt seine Hand offen vor. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturen-, Verzauberungs- oder Planeswalkerkarte bestimmen. Der Spieler wirft die bestimmte Karte ab.\\n• Ein Gegner deiner Wahl opfert eine Verzauberung.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555540&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e735d477-6494-459c-bcbe-9e7af5640a80\', \'multiverseId\': 555540}, \'multiverseid\': 555540}, {\'name\': \'Sonsacar la verdad\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Puedes elegir de ahí una carta de criatura, encantamiento o planeswalker. Ese jugador descarta esa carta.\\n• El oponente objetivo sacrifica un encantamiento.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c67acca4-4232-45fe-aeda-b71e0969b5c3\', \'multiverseId\': 555801}, \'multiverseid\': 555801}, {\'name\': \'Extraction de la vérité\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Un adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous pouvez y choisir une carte de créature, d\'enchantement ou de planeswalker. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte.\\n• Un adversaire ciblé sacrifie un enchantement.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556062&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2b4d219-5889-4c61-b561-444abec51982\', \'multiverseId\': 556062}, \'multiverseid\': 556062}, {\'name\': \'Estrarre la Verità\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Puoi scegliere una carta creatura, incantesimo o planeswalker da quella mano. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta.\\n• Un avversario bersaglio sacrifica un incantesimo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed70b111-c1bc-42cb-a16d-c0e4cae64e81\', \'multiverseId\': 556323}, \'multiverseid\': 556323}, {\'name\': \'真実の抽出\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中からクリーチャーやエンチャントやプレインズウォーカーであるカード１枚を選んでもよい。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。\\n• 対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはエンチャント１つを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bb1c618-4304-4a4c-b066-d42af318574c\', \'multiverseId\': 556584}, \'multiverseid\': 556584}, {\'name\': \'진실 추출\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 당신은 그중 생물, 부여마법 또는 플레인즈워커 카드 한 장을 선택할 수 있다. 그 플레이어는 그 카드를 버린다.\\n• 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 부여마법 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d2edc7b-aebc-4e17-827a-c98e2fd9e972\', \'multiverseId\': 556845}, \'multiverseid\': 556845}, {\'name\': \'Extrair a Verdade\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• O oponente alvo revela a própria mão. Você pode escolher dela um card de criatura, encantamento ou planeswalker. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card.\\n• O oponente alvo sacrifica um encantamento.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19574ba1-265c-4475-81ab-92ac9b279879\', \'multiverseId\': 557106}, \'multiverseid\': 557106}, {\'name\': \'Извлечение Истины\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Целевой оппонент показывает свою руку. Вы можете выбрать из нее карту существа, чар или planeswalker\'а. Тот игрок сбрасывает ту карту.\\n• Целевой оппонент жертвует чары.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce895db4-6e73-42dd-b444-9882aa10745c\', \'multiverseId\': 557367}, \'multiverseid\': 557367}, {\'name\': \'萃取真相\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标对手展示其手牌。你可以选择其中一张生物，结界或鹏洛客牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。\\n•目标对手牺牲一个结界。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb802d7b-531b-447a-b7cc-689a399af98a\', \'multiverseId\': 557628}, \'multiverseid\': 557628}, {\'name\': \'萃取真相\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標對手展示其手牌。你可以選擇其中一張生物，結界或鵬洛客牌。該玩家棄掉該牌。\\n•目標對手犧牲一個結界。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef15f3ad-f610-4f9e-8786-5850e67c2ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 557889}, \'multiverseid\': 557889}]', '[{\'name\': \'Disziplinierter Duellant\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nDer Disziplinierte Duellant kommt mit einer Schildmarke ins Spiel. (Falls ihm Schaden zugefügt oder er zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen eine Schildmarke von ihm.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bürger\', \'flavor\': \'Brokers-Agenten verteidigen ihre Schützlinge mit allen verfügbaren Mitteln, von komplizierter Logik bis hin zu stumpfer Gewalt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e850508-6664-4231-8962-60cdf48c7c60\', \'multiverseId\': 555644}, \'multiverseid\': 555644}, {\'name\': \'Duelista disciplinado\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nEl Duelista disciplinado entra al campo de batalla con un contador de escudo sobre él. (Si fuera a recibir daño o a ser destruido, en vez de eso, remueve un contador de escudo de él.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los agentes de los Mediadores defienden sus cargos de todas las formas posibles, ya sea haciendo uso de una lógica compleja o de la fuerza bruta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1139f1f5-cae4-4cd1-8867-179d53c95b96\', \'multiverseId\': 555905}, \'multiverseid\': 555905}, {\'name\': \'Duelliste discipliné\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nLe Duelliste discipliné arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « bouclier » sur lui. (S\'il devait subir des blessures ou être détruit, retirez-lui un marqueur « bouclier » à la place.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et citoyen\', \'flavor\': \'Les agents des Courtiers défendent leurs intérêts par tous les moyens disponibles, de la logique élaborée au traumatisme physique violent.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284423c7-58e3-43bd-a046-02cbefe744dc\', \'multiverseId\': 556166}, \'multiverseid\': 556166}, {\'name\': \'Duellante Disciplinato\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco\\nIl Duellante Disciplinato entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino scudo. (Se sta per subire danno o sta per essere distrutto, rimuovi invece un segnalino scudo da esso.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gli agenti degli Intermediari difendono le loro cariche con tutti i mezzi disponibili, dalla logica intricata al trauma contundente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bee00b19-5422-45bc-8588-7a1342386642\', \'multiverseId\': 556427}, \'multiverseid\': 556427}, {\'name\': \'規律正しい決闘者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\n規律正しい決闘者は盾カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。（これがダメージを受けるか破壊されるなら、代わりにこれの上から盾カウンター１個を取り除く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・市民\', \'flavor\': \'斡旋屋一家の工作員は、緻密な論理から殴られたトラウマまで利用可能なあらゆる手段を講じて責務を全うする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c6f58f-b83b-4a3c-a9e3-b36f3e6c25e1\', \'multiverseId\': 556688}, \'multiverseid\': 556688}, {\'name\': \'단련된 결투가\', \'text\': \'이단공격\\n단련된 결투가는 방패 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다. (이 생물이 피해를 입거나 파괴되려 한다면, 대신 이 생물에서 방패 카운터 한 개를 제거한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 시민\', \'flavor\': \'브로커즈 요원들은 복잡한 논리부터 둔기에 의한 외상에 이르기까지, 모든 수단을 동원해서 자신의 혐의를 변호한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'263296f8-a8d5-452e-b68b-397076e8665b\', \'multiverseId\': 556949}, \'multiverseid\': 556949}, {\'name\': \'Duelista Disciplinado\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nDuelista Disciplinado entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de escudo. (Se ele sofreria dano ou seria destruído, em vez disso, remova um marcador de escudo dele.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cidadão\', \'flavor\': \'Os agentes dos Mediadores defendem seus clientes de todas as formas disponíveis, da lógica intrincada à força bruta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d018f261-624d-49c1-8ea9-bc4d49d5d92c\', \'multiverseId\': 557210}, \'multiverseid\': 557210}, {\'name\': \'Дисциплинированный Дуэлянт\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар\\nДисциплинированный Дуэлянт выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном щита на нем. (Если он должен получить повреждения или быть уничтожен, вместо этого удалите с него один жетон щита.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Гражданин\', \'flavor\': \'Агенты Брокеров оспаривают претензии всеми возможными способами, начиная от замысловатой логики и заканчивая тяжелыми травмами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4062975a-2c81-4571-85ec-44f4d1da8e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 557471}, \'multiverseid\': 557471}, {\'name\': \'守矩斗客\', \'text\': \'连击\\n守矩斗客进战场时上面有一个后盾指示物。（如果它将受到伤害或将被消灭，则改为从其上移去一个后盾指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／市民\', \'flavor\': \'从编造难懂逻辑到制造钝器重击，扶济社密探会用一切手段来摆脱控罪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c683af7-9252-48d9-8cff-1e949570d824\', \'multiverseId\': 557732}, \'multiverseid\': 557732}, {\'name\': \'守矩鬥客\', \'text\': \'連擊\\n守矩鬥客進戰場時上面有一個後盾指示物。（如果它將受到傷害或將被消滅，則改為從其上移去一個後盾指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／市民\', \'flavor\': \'從編造難懂邏輯到製造鈍器重擊，扶濟社密探會用一切手段來擺脫控罪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a524b3a-5e45-4852-b2b7-7c17071c620a\', \'multiverseId\': 557993}, \'multiverseid\': 557993}]', "[{'name': 'Disziplinierter Duellant', 'text': 'Doppelschlag\\nDer Disziplinierte Duellant kommt mit einer Schildmarke ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Bürger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558747&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30190ea6-2ebf-4fef-b217-805c4fb9fa3a', 'multiverseId': 558747}, 'multiverseid': 558747}, {'name': 'Duelista disciplinado', 'text': 'Daña dos veces.\\nEl Duelista disciplinado entra al campo de batalla con un contador de escudo sobre él.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ciudadano humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558792&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cb87729-b799-48eb-a3d0-50eccd8bee7b', 'multiverseId': 558792}, 'multiverseid': 558792}, {'name': 'Duelliste discipliné', 'text': 'Double initiative\\nLe Duelliste discipliné arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « bouclier » sur lui.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et citoyen', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558837&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '594c75d6-7dc3-4b80-8cf1-8f233b139206', 'multiverseId': 558837}, 'multiverseid': 558837}, {'name': 'Duellante Disciplinato', 'text': 'Doppio attacco\\nIl Duellante Disciplinato entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino scudo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Cittadino Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558882&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b4934b0-14a8-4e4e-a271-a65e92b0d1a7', 'multiverseId': 558882}, 'multiverseid': 558882}, {'name': '規律正しい決闘者', 'text': '二段攻撃\\n規律正しい決闘者は盾カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・市民', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558927&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9350efe8-6489-47c9-a123-5b4a595dd5e5', 'multiverseId': 558927}, 'multiverseid': 558927}, {'name': '단련된 결투가', 'text': '이단공격\\n단련된 결투가는 방패 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 시민', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558972&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '978d26d1-1c0f-4089-85fc-9d00c8a0e374', 'multiverseId': 558972}, 'multiverseid': 558972}, {'name': 'Duelista Disciplinado', 'text': 'Golpe duplo\\nDuelista Disciplinado entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de escudo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Cidadão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559017&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48a2fc94-cff7-410a-9948-d4aa4bf4a3d6', 'multiverseId': 559017}, 'multiverseid': 559017}, {'name': 'Дисциплинированный Дуэлянт', 'text': 'Двойной удар\\nДисциплинированный Дуэлянт выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном щита на нем.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Гражданин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559062&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd968974f-adeb-4464-a827-017b9e1c0205', 'multiverseId': 559062}, 'multiverseid': 559062}, {'name': '守矩斗客', 'text': '连击\\n守矩斗客进战场时上面有一个后盾指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／市民', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559107&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6a9b06f-1e16-482e-83a0-627a7b093270', 'multiverseId': 559107}, 'multiverseid': 559107}, {'name': '守矩鬥客', 'text': '連擊\\n守矩鬥客進戰場時上面有一個後盾指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～人類／市民', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559152&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0499f455-2239-4e08-8381-ccdfc1a4ca5f', 'multiverseId': 559152}, 'multiverseid': 559152}]", '[{\'name\': \'Durch den Hinterausgang\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie destabilisiert sich. (Behandle sie und alles, was an sie angelegt ist, bis zum Beginn des nächsten Zuges ihres Beherrschers, als würde es nicht existieren.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich war nie hier."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3817f4e-8b43-4e4b-aa23-4b1da155f0bf\', \'multiverseId\': 555524}, \'multiverseid\': 555524}, {\'name\': \'Escabullirse\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Sale de fase. (Trátala a ella y a cualquier objeto anexado a ella como si no existiese hasta el próximo turno de su controlador.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca estuve aquí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12838ea2-d76c-4f45-9409-a4e245092560\', \'multiverseId\': 555785}, \'multiverseid\': 555785}, {\'name\': \'Sortir par derrière\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée. Elle passe hors phase. (Traitez-la et tout ce qui lui est attaché comme s\'ils n\'existaient pas jusqu\'au prochain tour de son contrôleur.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« En fait, vous ne m\'avez pas vue. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ceb4afb-0207-48f5-8fa2-45a2f667df40\', \'multiverseId\': 556046}, \'multiverseid\': 556046}, {\'name\': \'Svignarsela dal Retro\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. La creatura scompare. (Tratta quella creatura e qualsiasi permanente ad essa assegnato come se non esistessero fino al prossimo turno del controllore della creatura.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sono mai stata qui."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f132c169-2a25-4797-b44d-521eefc3a8f4\', \'multiverseId\': 556307}, \'multiverseid\': 556307}, {\'name\': \'とんずら\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。それはフェイズ・アウトする。（次のそれのコントローラーのターンまで、それやそれについているすべてのものは存在しないかのように扱う。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私ははじめからここにいなかったよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83c7b580-46d3-4302-98cd-580f3c3fa414\', \'multiverseId\': 556568}, \'multiverseid\': 556568}, {\'name\': \'감쪽같이 사라지다\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 페이즈 아웃한다. (그 생물의 조종자의 다음 턴까지 그 생물 및 그 생물에 부착되어 있는 것들이 존재하지 않는 것처럼 취급한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"난 여기 온 적이 없어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd27749c-2cde-4db2-9dce-70425baeb18b\', \'multiverseId\': 556829}, \'multiverseid\': 556829}, {\'name\': \'Saída pelos Fundos\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Ela sai de fase. (Trate-a, assim como qualquer coisa anexada a ela, como se não existisse até o próximo turno de seu controlador.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Você nunca me viu."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'515c3845-fd3a-434c-9b0e-1530c4bb6343\', \'multiverseId\': 557090}, \'multiverseid\': 557090}, {\'name\': \'Ускользнуть Через Черный Ход\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо. Оно уходит в противофазу. (До следующего хода контролирующего его игрока обращайтесь с ним и всеми прикрепленными к нему объектами, как будто они не существуют.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Меня здесь не было».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc4d0904-6c97-47c9-9541-6dacccecabf8\', \'multiverseId\': 557351}, \'multiverseid\': 557351}, {\'name\': \'悄声离开\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。令它跃离。（直到其操控者的下一个回合，该生物及贴附于其上的所有东西都视作不存在。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我没来过。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04316b06-028a-479c-8b3a-659694b34f84\', \'multiverseId\': 557612}, \'multiverseid\': 557612}, {\'name\': \'悄聲離開\', \'text\': \'在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。令它躍離。（直到其操控者的下一個回合，該生物及貼附於其上的所有東西都視作不存在。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我沒來過。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'295c5aff-7f3b-40c0-8203-0a9eb1641dec\', \'multiverseId\': 557873}, \'multiverseid\': 557873}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerreißer\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur, wirf eine Karte ab oder bezahle 4 Lebenspunkte als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nWenn der Dämmerreißer ins Spiel kommt, opfert jeder Gegner eine Kreatur, wirft eine Karte ab und verliert 4 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'794ddcfe-560a-4a75-b4fa-eda6bf148e9e\', \'multiverseId\': 555539}, \'multiverseid\': 555539}, {\'name\': \'Mutilador del anochecer\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura, descarta una carta o paga 4 vidas.\\nCuando el Mutilador del anochecer entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente sacrifica una criatura, descarta una carta y pierde 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'233b277c-fc87-4592-9ed5-76e8abeadb81\', \'multiverseId\': 555800}, \'multiverseid\': 555800}, {\'name\': \'Déchiqueteur du crépuscule\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature, défaussez-vous d\'une carte ou payez 4 points de vie.\\nQuand le Déchiqueteur du crépuscule arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature, se défausse d\'une carte et perd 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556061&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4488abe0-f004-427f-8dfb-a076e22f1afb\', \'multiverseId\': 556061}, \'multiverseid\': 556061}, {\'name\': \'Stritolatore del Crepuscolo\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura, scarta una carta o paga 4 punti vita.\\nQuando lo Stritolatore del Crepuscolo entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura, scarta una carta e perde 4 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d7e3ef6-5815-495c-af62-509da94af22f\', \'multiverseId\': 556322}, \'multiverseid\': 556322}, {\'name\': \'薄暮の刻み獣\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げるか、カード１枚を捨てるか、４点のライフを支払う。\\n薄暮の刻み獣が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げ、カード１枚を捨て、４点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7788cbd7-b7ca-4bdb-8220-0fada17bf32c\', \'multiverseId\': 556583}, \'multiverseid\': 556583}, {\'name\': \'땅거미 훼손자\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생하거나, 카드 한 장을 버리거나, 생명 4점을 지불한다.\\n땅거미 훼손자가 전장에 들어올 때, 각 상대는 생물 한 개를 희생하고, 카드 한 장을 버리며, 생명 4점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 괴수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2548fdf-75aa-4087-8f25-e17bb3149770\', \'multiverseId\': 556844}, \'multiverseid\': 556844}, {\'name\': \'Desmembrador do Ocaso\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura, descarte um card ou pague 4 pontos de vida.\\nQuando Desmembrador do Ocaso entra no campo de batalha, cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura, descarta um card e perde 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf724755-f6b8-473a-ae58-b8ea5ffbc0c4\', \'multiverseId\': 557105}, \'multiverseid\': 557105}, {\'name\': \'Сумеречный Кромсатель\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте существо, сбросьте карту или заплатите 4 жизни.\\nКогда Сумеречный Кромсатель выходит на поле битвы, каждый оппонент жертвует существо, сбрасывает карту и теряет 4 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a816128-6031-49bc-aab4-db161714c2c3\', \'multiverseId\': 557366}, \'multiverseid\': 557366}, {\'name\': \'薄暮破坏妖\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，弃一张牌或支付4点生命，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n当薄暮破坏妖进战场时，每位对手各牺牲一个生物、弃一张牌且失去4点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d8e9780-069d-40ff-b282-b187cc1b791d\', \'multiverseId\': 557627}, \'multiverseid\': 557627}, {\'name\': \'薄暮破壞妖\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，棄一張牌或支付4點生命，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n當薄暮破壞妖進戰場時，每位對手各犧牲一個生物、棄一張牌且失去4點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8271d177-59a5-4aad-b25e-f40fbb36f09e\', \'multiverseId\': 557888}, \'multiverseid\': 557888}]', "[{'name': 'Dämonische Schulden', 'text': 'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann zwei Karten. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Ob Nixilis reicht dir seine Hand nicht als Partner, sondern um sich deiner Unterwürfigkeit zu versichern.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555537&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9820d5fc-fb6a-42e9-835f-df316298d635', 'multiverseId': 555537}, 'multiverseid': 555537}, {'name': 'Cuota del demonio', 'text': 'Adivina 2, luego roba dos cartas. Pierdes 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Ob Nixilis no tiende la mano por camaradería, sino para demostrar tu sumisión.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555798&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95860a1a-3979-4690-add2-fdfeb80c6e8f', 'multiverseId': 555798}, 'multiverseid': 555798}, {'name': 'Échéance du démon', 'text': 'Regard 2, puis piochez deux cartes. Vous perdez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Ob Nixilis ne tend pas la main pour devenir votre associé, mais pour confirmer votre asservissement.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556059&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92738ee4-c79c-4abb-b40c-71f55d5ce81c', 'multiverseId': 556059}, 'multiverseid': 556059}, {'name': 'Dazio del Demone', 'text': 'Profetizza 2, poi pesca due carte. Perdi 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Ob Nixilis tende la mano non in segno di collaborazione, bensì per sancire la tua sottomissione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556320&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7cf840f6-7e37-430b-a1dd-fcfcae4f8ecb', 'multiverseId': 556320}, 'multiverseid': 556320}, {'name': '悪魔の本分', 'text': '占術２を行う。その後、カード２枚を引く。あなたは２点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'オブ・ニクシリスが手を差し伸べるのは友情を示すためではなく、服従の確認のためである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556581&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45cee976-0015-4323-a464-08d280b60ea4', 'multiverseId': 556581}, 'multiverseid': 556581}, {'name': '악마의 요구', 'text': '점술 2를 한 후, 카드 두 장을 뽑는다. 당신은 생명 2점을 잃는다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '오브 닉실리스는 동업자로서가 아니라 복종을 확인하기 위해 손을 내뻗는다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556842&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c24fe826-90f9-473e-9ea1-b4a2e60ab9d0', 'multiverseId': 556842}, 'multiverseid': 556842}, {'name': 'Quota do Demônio', 'text': 'Use vidência 2 e depois compre dois cards. Você perde 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Ob Nixilis estende a mão não em parceria, mas para afirmar a sua subserviência.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557103&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8714d6cd-90cf-4ce5-ba90-097525f3cca3', 'multiverseId': 557103}, 'multiverseid': 557103}, {'name': 'Вознаграждение Демона', 'text': 'Предскажите 2, затем возьмите две карты. Вы теряете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Об-Никсилис протягивает руку не для того, чтобы заключить партнерство, а чтобы утвердить твое подчинение.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557364&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '959c4fd4-70c6-4b28-8439-fb2b7cbf2f32', 'multiverseId': 557364}, 'multiverseid': 557364}, {'name': '恶魔获物', 'text': '占卜2，然后抓两张牌。你失去2点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '欧尼希兹伸手不是跟你合作，而是要你效忠。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557625&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fce0c4eb-3cd6-46cf-8b1a-1b82adb91e43', 'multiverseId': 557625}, 'multiverseid': 557625}, {'name': '惡魔獲物', 'text': '占卜2，然後抽兩張牌。你失去2點生命。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '歐尼希茲伸手不是跟你合作，而是要你效忠。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557886&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '135b536c-0cc4-4e99-91b1-5d33f4b525ad', 'multiverseId': 557886}, 'multiverseid': 557886}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559355&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f95b871f-0d53-43a7-b676-1e20faecfdcd', 'multiverseId': 559355}, 'multiverseid': 559355}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559375&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8eb21ad5-b409-46b7-bb6c-e9966695280b', 'multiverseId': 559375}, 'multiverseid': 559375}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559385&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f69e2f30-3f9f-4568-8b92-8c8fbd80bb00', 'multiverseId': 559385}, 'multiverseid': 559385}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559395&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afed230b-c6be-4faa-933b-21c7c8415047', 'multiverseId': 559395}, 'multiverseid': 559395}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559405&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4768d318-7679-47ce-816a-1ff17e71681b', 'multiverseId': 559405}, 'multiverseid': 559405}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559415&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bb2e3af-2172-44fb-a010-26f4afdfc2de', 'multiverseId': 559415}, 'multiverseid': 559415}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559445&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6bb332d3-c6a8-415a-95db-36d55574a655', 'multiverseId': 559445}, 'multiverseid': 559445}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559356&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ab7556b-1da3-491b-bee5-046c84a8018a', 'multiverseId': 559356}, 'multiverseid': 559356}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559366&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b67f6d2-6562-