', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '851431f0-beca-4942-a947-d5f621bafd22', 'multiverseId': 558516}, 'multiverseid': 558516}, {'name': '尚夺尔的酒廊', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}，{B}或{R}。）\\n尚夺尔的酒廊须横置进战场。\\n循环{3}', 'type': '地 ～海岛／沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558527&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8d9d340-7d26-4099-ae8b-64cf042b8d9a', 'multiverseId': 558527}, 'multiverseid': 558527}, {'name': '尚奪爾的酒廊', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}，{B}或{R}。）\\n尚奪爾的酒廊須橫置進戰場。\\n循環{3}', 'type': '地 ～海島／沼澤／山脈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558538&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1afdae8a-ed32-4226-b622-58ef20c0d4bd', 'multiverseId': 558538}, 'multiverseid': 558538}]", "[{'name': 'Xanders Salon', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {U}, {B} oder {R}.)\\nXanders Salon kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {3}', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559253&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cab32d69-4749-4675-8683-5b3d33bb0083', 'multiverseId': 559253}, 'multiverseid': 559253}, {'name': 'Salón de Xander', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {U}, {B} o {R}.)\\nEl Salón de Xander entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCiclo {3}.', 'type': 'Tierra — Isla pantano montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559263&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b371f5d-9338-48da-a01f-3165bbd49422', 'multiverseId': 559263}, 'multiverseid': 559263}, {'name': 'Bar de Xander', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {U}, {B} ou {R}.)\\nLe Bar de Xander arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nRecyclage {3}', 'type': 'Terrain : île et marais et montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559273&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '612af070-068c-4102-9cae-0530a02a10b8', 'multiverseId': 559273}, 'multiverseid': 559273}, {'name': 'Salotto di Xander', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {U}, {B} o {R}.)\\nIl Salotto di Xander entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nCiclo {3}', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Palude Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559283&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a1ef97b-8776-4853-9754-a83041093301', 'multiverseId': 559283}, 'multiverseid': 559283}, {'name': 'ザンダーの居室', 'text': '（{T}：{U}か{B}か{R}を加える。）\\nザンダーの居室はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{3}', 'type': '土地 — 島・沼・山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559293&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ca69924-e250-4a19-968f-367c50b74655', 'multiverseId': 559293}, 'multiverseid': 559293}, {'name': '잰더의 라운지', 'text': '({T}: {U}, {B} 또는 {R}를 추가한다.)\\n잰더의 라운지는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n순환 {3}', 'type': '대지 — 섬 늪 산', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559303&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcad0132-9192-4d7a-8af8-3a2f47260279', 'multiverseId': 559303}, 'multiverseid': 559303}, {'name': 'Saguão de Xander', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {U}, {B} ou {R}.)\\nSaguão de Xander entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nReciclar {3}', 'type': 'Terreno — Ilha Pântano Montanha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559313&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '631856a4-9c49-4a67-8f6e-2387a566c9c7', 'multiverseId': 559313}, 'multiverseid': 559313}, {'name': 'Салон Зандера', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {U}, {B} или {R}.)\\nСалон Зандера выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nЦикл {3}', 'type': 'Земля — Остров Болото Гора', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559323&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f2bd4a8-d75a-401b-ac8c-b5e83d545f77', 'multiverseId': 559323}, 'multiverseid': 559323}, {'name': '尚夺尔的酒廊', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}，{B}或{R}。）\\n尚夺尔的酒廊须横置进战场。\\n循环{3}', 'type': '地 ～海岛／沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559333&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b01605f1-3731-40d7-b1b9-cf0a426c0740', 'multiverseId': 559333}, 'multiverseid': 559333}, {'name': '尚奪爾的酒廊', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}，{B}或{R}。）\\n尚奪爾的酒廊須橫置進戰場。\\n循環{3}', 'type': '地 ～海島／沼澤／山脈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559343&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51e95373-7ace-4b75-a9d1-8f2f202619a1', 'multiverseId': 559343}, 'multiverseid': 559343}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zementschuhe\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+3 und hat „Zu Beginn deines Endsegments tappst du diese Kreatur."\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555697&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2332bdcc-e669-4d51-84b4-3c3b11b55dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 555697}, \'multiverseid\': 555697}, {\'name\': \'Zapatos de cemento\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+3 y tiene "Al comienzo de tu paso final, gira esta criatura".\\nLa criatura equipada no se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f480bca-04ff-4d08-bcbe-e5a07f3682c1\', \'multiverseId\': 555958}, \'multiverseid\': 555958}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de ciment\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +3/+3 et a « Au début de votre étape de fin, engagez cette créature. »\\nLa créature équipée ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556219&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1c33ca7-1814-462c-9119-9285da60ddec\', \'multiverseId\': 556219}, \'multiverseid\': 556219}, {\'name\': \'Scarpe di Cemento\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+3 e ha "All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, TAPpa questa creatura".\\nLa creatura equipaggiata non STAPpa durante lo STAP del suo controllore.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ba1387-af6e-4a91-ac19-4ab214998021\', \'multiverseId\': 556480}, \'multiverseid\': 556480}, {\'name\': \'セメントの靴\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け「あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このクリーチャーをタップする。」を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4221be7a-0456-44e1-888b-d8a203391eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 556741}, \'multiverseid\': 556741}, {\'name\': \'시멘트 신발\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +3/+3을 받고 "당신의 종료단 시작에, 이 생물을 탭한다."를 가진다.\\n장착된 생물은 조종자의 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\\n장착 {2} ({2}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 집중마법 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c775b3a-de47-4ef9-aa6c-220591116603\', \'multiverseId\': 557002}, \'multiverseid\': 557002}, {\'name\': \'Sapatos de Cimento\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+3 e tem "No início de sua etapa final, vire esta criatura".\\nA criatura equipada não é desvirada durante a etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31f312ac-05da-4c5e-b96c-7fbd4530c22e\', \'multiverseId\': 557263}, \'multiverseid\': 557263}, {\'name\': \'Цементные Башмаки\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +3/+3 и имеет способность «В начале вашего заключительного шага поверните это существо».\\nСнаряженное существо не разворачивается во время шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\\nСнарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402a9dc5-9f56-40dd-9203-9e73fe243220\', \'multiverseId\': 557524}, \'multiverseid\': 557524}, {\'name\': \'水泥护鞋\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+3且具有「在你的结束步骤开始时，横置此生物。」\\n佩带此武具的生物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c53b8dd0-b54f-478a-afb7-2e3770b1a98f\', \'multiverseId\': 557785}, \'multiverseid\': 557785}, {\'name\': \'水泥護鞋\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+3/+3且具有「在你的結束步驟開始時，橫置此生物。」\\n佩帶此武具的生物於其操控者的重置步驟中不能重置。\\n佩帶{2}（{2}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345d9d31-850c-4e75-acfe-6eb8a3cfbd60\', \'multiverseId\': 558046}, \'multiverseid\': 558046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerbrochener Seraph\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Zerbrochene Seraph ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{2}, schicke den Zerbrochenen Seraph aus deiner Hand ins Exil: Ein Land deiner Wahl erhält „{T}: Erzeuge {W}, {U} oder {B}", bis der Zerbrochene Seraph aus dem Exil gewirkt wird. Solange der Zerbrochene Seraph im Exil bleibt, kannst du ihn wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555683&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0abd7d6-540e-4c40-9d86-2a3ec0bc4c20\', \'multiverseId\': 555683}, \'multiverseid\': 555683}, {\'name\': \'Serafín quebrada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Serafín quebrada entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas.\\n{2}, exiliar la Serafín quebrada de tu mano: La tierra objetivo gana "{T}: Agrega {W}, {U} o {B}" hasta que la Serafín quebrada se lance desde el exilio. Puedes lanzar la Serafín quebrada mientras permanezca exiliada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3bac6f-794c-46c7-b132-e70a512970eb\', \'multiverseId\': 555944}, \'multiverseid\': 555944}, {\'name\': \'Séraphine fracassée\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Séraphine fracassée arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\n{2}, exilez la Séraphine fracassée depuis votre main : Un terrain ciblé acquiert « {T} : Ajoutez {W}, {U} ou {B} » jusqu\'à ce que la Séraphine fracassée soit lancée depuis l\'exil. Vous pouvez lancer la Séraphine fracassée tant qu\'elle reste exilée.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a87c26b-0c5a-4838-a2e4-a6616ea15b09\', \'multiverseId\': 556205}, \'multiverseid\': 556205}, {\'name\': \'Serafina Frantumata\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Serafina Frantumata entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita.\\n{2}, Esilia la Serafina Frantumata dalla tua mano: Una terra bersaglio ha "{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {U} o {B}" finché la Serafina Frantumata non viene lanciata dall\\\'esilio. Puoi lanciare la Serafina Frantumata fintanto che rimane esiliata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60619d34-f2d1-47cd-b669-b10e60c83bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 556466}, \'multiverseid\': 556466}, {\'name\': \'砕かれた熾天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n砕かれた熾天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\n{2}, あなたの手札にある砕かれた熾天使を追放する：土地１つを対象とする。砕かれた熾天使が追放領域から唱えられるまで、それは「{T}：{W}か{U}か{B}を加える。」を得る。砕かれた熾天使が追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはこれを唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'965115f6-a991-405c-9c67-516a9e75ba1f\', \'multiverseId\': 556727}, \'multiverseid\': 556727}, {\'name\': \'산산조각난 치품천사\', \'text\': \'비행\\n산산조각난 치품천사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\\n{2}, 당신의 손에서 산산조각난 치품천사를 추방한다: 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지는 산산조각난 치품천사가 추방 영역에서 발동될 때까지 "{T}: {W}, {U}, 또는 {B}를 추가한다."를 얻는다. 산산조각난 치품천사가 추방되어 있는 한 당신은 산산조각난 치품천사를 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bfe440-da03-4337-a495-fb8c64f17009\', \'multiverseId\': 556988}, \'multiverseid\': 556988}, {\'name\': \'Serafim Despedaçada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Serafim Despedaçada entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\n{2}, exile Serafim Despedaçada de sua mão: O terreno alvo ganha "{T}: Adicione {W}, {U} ou {B}" até que Serafim Despedaçada seja conjurada do exílio. Você poderá conjurar Serafim Despedaçada enquanto ela permanecer exilada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a197e207-0d39-4d1a-b495-4c88c8eb13e4\', \'multiverseId\': 557249}, \'multiverseid\': 557249}, {\'name\': \'Расколотый Серафим\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Расколотый Серафим выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 3 жизни.\\n{2}, изгоните Расколотого Серафима из вашей руки: целевая земля получает способность «{T}: добавьте {W}, {U} или {B}» до тех пор, пока Расколотый Серафим не будет разыгран из изгнания. Вы можете разыграть Расколотого Серафима, пока он остается в изгнании.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86e3d198-09b5-4807-81c7-126406d11d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 557510}, \'multiverseid\': 557510}, {\'name\': \'碎翼炽天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当碎翼炽天使进战场时，你获得3点生命。\\n{2}，从你手上放逐碎翼炽天使：直到从放逐区施放碎翼炽天使为止，目标地获得「{T}：加{W}，{U}或{B}。」于碎翼炽天使持续放逐的时段内，你可以施放它。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e189a6ee-875f-41b1-b9ee-415966773084\', \'multiverseId\': 557771}, \'multiverseid\': 557771}, {\'name\': \'碎翼熾天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當碎翼熾天使進戰場時，你獲得3點生命。\\n{2}，從你手上放逐碎翼熾天使：直到從放逐區施放碎翼熾天使為止，目標地獲得「{T}：加{W}，{U}或{B}。」於碎翼熾天使持續放逐的時段內，你可以施放它。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3540d3-437a-449e-82e5-2157e7c0d29e\', \'multiverseId\': 558032}, \'multiverseid\': 558032}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerbrochener Seraph\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Zerbrochene Seraph ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{2}, schicke den Zerbrochenen Seraph aus deiner Hand ins Exil: Ein Land deiner Wahl erhält „{T}: Erzeuge {W}, {U} oder {B}", bis der Zerbrochene Seraph aus dem Exil gewirkt wird. Solange der Zerbrochene Seraph im Exil bleibt, kannst du ihn wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558776&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'878b2fc8-4e64-4235-961f-2f21a3840ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 558776}, \'multiverseid\': 558776}, {\'name\': \'Serafín quebrada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Serafín quebrada entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas.\\n{2}, exiliar la Serafín quebrada de tu mano: La tierra objetivo gana "{T}: Agrega {W}, {U} o {B}" hasta que la Serafín quebrada se lance desde el exilio. Puedes lanzar la Serafín quebrada mientras permanezca exiliada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3c11a50-aaee-415e-b4d1-c20346e13a02\', \'multiverseId\': 558821}, \'multiverseid\': 558821}, {\'name\': \'Séraphine fracassée\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Séraphine fracassée arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\n{2}, exilez la Séraphine fracassée depuis votre main : Un terrain ciblé acquiert « {T} : Ajoutez {W}, {U} ou {B} » jusqu\'à ce que la Séraphine fracassée soit lancée depuis l\'exil. Vous pouvez lancer la Séraphine fracassée tant qu\'elle reste exilée.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab1d29f5-2607-4527-a384-9e44a77cc571\', \'multiverseId\': 558866}, \'multiverseid\': 558866}, {\'name\': \'Serafina Frantumata\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Serafina Frantumata entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita.\\n{2}, Esilia la Serafina Frantumata dalla tua mano: Una terra bersaglio ha "{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {U} o {B}" finché la Serafina Frantumata non viene lanciata dall\\\'esilio. Puoi lanciare la Serafina Frantumata fintanto che rimane esiliata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0615b369-4a21-4e35-9971-0834b1cba620\', \'multiverseId\': 558911}, \'multiverseid\': 558911}, {\'name\': \'砕かれた熾天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n砕かれた熾天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\n{2}, あなたの手札にある砕かれた熾天使を追放する：土地１つを対象とする。砕かれた熾天使が追放領域から唱えられるまで、それは「{T}：{W}か{U}か{B}を加える。」を得る。砕かれた熾天使が追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはこれを唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab6b5356-49fc-4b9c-b76a-cd6160229058\', \'multiverseId\': 558956}, \'multiverseid\': 558956}, {\'name\': \'산산조각난 치품천사\', \'text\': \'비행\\n산산조각난 치품천사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\\n{2}, 당신의 손에서 산산조각난 치품천사를 추방한다: 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지는 산산조각난 치품천사가 추방 영역에서 발동될 때까지 "{T}: {W}, {U}, 또는 {B}를 추가한다."를 얻는다. 산산조각난 치품천사가 추방되어 있는 한 당신은 산산조각난 치품천사를 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d96b2926-f625-4c53-ba32-c80d5a79b019\', \'multiverseId\': 559001}, \'multiverseid\': 559001}, {\'name\': \'Serafim Despedaçada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Serafim Despedaçada entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\n{2}, exile Serafim Despedaçada de sua mão: O terreno alvo ganha "{T}: Adicione {W}, {U} ou {B}" até que Serafim Despedaçada seja conjurada do exílio. Você poderá conjurar Serafim Despedaçada enquanto ela permanecer exilada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a4d104f-932e-4325-b6a4-371744e23763\', \'multiverseId\': 559046}, \'multiverseid\': 559046}, {\'name\': \'Расколотый Серафим\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Расколотый Серафим выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 3 жизни.\\n{2}, изгоните Расколотого Серафима из вашей руки: целевая земля получает способность «{T}: добавьте {W}, {U} или {B}» до тех пор, пока Расколотый Серафим не будет разыгран из изгнания. Вы можете разыграть Расколотого Серафима, пока он остается в изгнании.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0468511-720e-4553-a176-866ce590dacb\', \'multiverseId\': 559091}, \'multiverseid\': 559091}, {\'name\': \'碎翼炽天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当碎翼炽天使进战场时，你获得3点生命。\\n{2}，从你手上放逐碎翼炽天使：直到从放逐区施放碎翼炽天使为止，目标地获得「{T}：加{W}，{U}或{B}。」于碎翼炽天使持续放逐的时段内，你可以施放它。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad070842-70db-4edb-989b-30fd58dcbfcc\', \'multiverseId\': 559136}, \'multiverseid\': 559136}, {\'name\': \'碎翼熾天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當碎翼熾天使進戰場時，你獲得3點生命。\\n{2}，從你手上放逐碎翼熾天使：直到從放逐區施放碎翼熾天使為止，目標地獲得「{T}：加{W}，{U}或{B}。」於碎翼熾天使持續放逐的時段內，你可以施放它。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dab2910a-8a7d-4e2b-9bd6-33558a0f9298\', \'multiverseId\': 559181}, \'multiverseid\': 559181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zeremonieller Spaten\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+1 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAusrüsten eines Bürgers {1}\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Bauarbeiten in Neu-Capenna sind durchtränkt von Tradition und Ritual.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555637&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad397341-355d-4661-b0b6-54701f7c7ddc\', \'multiverseId\': 555637}, \'multiverseid\': 555637}, {\'name\': \'Cavatierras ceremonial\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+1 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\\nEquipar Ciudadano {1}.\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'En Nueva Capenna, la construcción está impregnada de tradiciones y rituales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ac3c1f-179a-4b02-b17c-b00e89bb98d7\', \'multiverseId\': 555898}, \'multiverseid\': 555898}, {\'name\': \'Pelle de cérémonie\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+1 et a le piétinement.\\nÉquipement de citoyen {1}\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'À la Nouvelle-Capenna, la construction est imprégnée de traditions et de rituels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1201c8f-5467-471e-8f7e-652096ee5fac\', \'multiverseId\': 556159}, \'multiverseid\': 556159}, {\'name\': \'Pala Cerimoniale\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+1 e ha travolgere.\\nEquipaggia Cittadino {1}\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "L\'edilizia a Nuova Capenna è intrisa di tradizione e rituali.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e3ee043-065f-4033-883d-e2730998a5d6\', \'multiverseId\': 556420}, \'multiverseid\': 556420}, {\'name\': \'儀礼用シャベル\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを持つ。\\n市民に装備{1}\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'ニューカペナでの建設作業は伝統と儀式で満ち溢れている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2bc1855-6bdc-4382-9eaf-030bee409d8e\', \'multiverseId\': 556681}, \'multiverseid\': 556681}, {\'name\': \'의식용 지면파괴기\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+1을 받고 돌진을 가진다.\\n시민에 장착 {1}\\n장착 {3} ({3}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 집중마법 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'뉴 카펜나의 건축 양식에는 전통과 의식이 가득 차 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6559292-7d94-408f-b2c4-2d1a8c8560ea\', \'multiverseId\': 556942}, \'multiverseid\': 556942}, {\'name\': \'Quebra-chão Cerimonial\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+1 e tem atropelar.\\nEquipar Cidadão {1}\\nEquipar {3} ({3}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'O ramo da construção em Nova Capenna segue uma tradição e um ritual.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3437032-cac3-4fb1-bae8-146abe562848\', \'multiverseId\': 557203}, \'multiverseid\': 557203}, {\'name\': \'Церемониальная Лопата\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+1 и имеет Пробивной удар.\\nСнарядить Гражданина {1}\\nСнарядить {3} ({3}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Строительство в Новой Капенне сопряжено со множеством традиций и ритуалов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09a5be8a-a18f-4188-8b48-ae6a546fc0b3\', \'multiverseId\': 557464}, \'multiverseid\': 557464}, {\'name\': \'动土仪式锹\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+1且具有践踏异能。\\n佩带市民{1}\\n佩带{3}（{3}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'新卡佩纳的建设工作充满着传统和仪式感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e37e41-8cd1-4236-94f0-886ddc49d118\', \'multiverseId\': 557725}, \'multiverseid\': 557725}, {\'name\': \'動土儀式鍬\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+1且具有踐踏異能。\\n佩帶市民{1}\\n佩帶{3}（{3}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'新卡佩納的建設工作充滿著傳統和儀式感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a68d7ffe-7aac-43f0-9db5-6f4b4d5c2eff\', \'multiverseId\': 557986}, \'multiverseid\': 557986}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zeugenschutz\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur verliert alle Fähigkeiten und ist eine grüne und weiße Bürger-Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 1/1 namens Seriöse Geschäftsperson. (Sie verliert alle anderen Farben, Kartentypen, Kreaturentypen und Namen.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6874f17-7a64-4e51-8220-ce6656597f5d\', \'multiverseId\': 555528}, \'multiverseid\': 555528}, {\'name\': \'Protección de testigos\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada pierde todas las habilidades y es una criatura Ciudadano verde y blanca con fuerza y resistencia base de 1/1 llamada Comerciante legal. (Pierde todos sus otros colores, tipos de carta, tipos de criatura y nombres.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a875319-acf1-43a8-8b10-3138c667ce21\', \'multiverseId\': 555789}, \'multiverseid\': 555789}, {\'name\': \'Protection de témoin\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée perd toutes ses capacités et est une créature verte et blanche Citoyen avec une force et une endurance de base de 1/1 appelée Homme d\'affaires légitime. (Elle perd toutes ses autres couleurs, ses types de carte, ses types de créature et ses noms.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556050&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea4fe89e-0469-4b42-9c95-5ef82e3cd3ad\', \'multiverseId\': 556050}, \'multiverseid\': 556050}, {\'name\': \'Protezione Testimoni\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata perde tutte le abilità ed è una creatura Cittadino verde e bianca con forza e costituzione base 1/1 chiamata Rispettabile Affarista. (Perde tutti gli altri colori, tipi di carta, tipi di creatura e nomi.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bfc8cad-b39d-4aa9-8b29-1b273a3d137e\', \'multiverseId\': 556311}, \'multiverseid\': 556311}, {\'name\': \'証人保護\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーはすべての能力を失い、「れっきとした実業家」という名前で基本のパワーとタフネスが１/１である緑白の市民・クリーチャーである。（それはそれ以外のすべての色やカード・タイプやクリーチャー・タイプや名前を失う。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96d5319b-912c-4bfd-b29d-38a14c51db82\', \'multiverseId\': 556572}, \'multiverseid\': 556572}, {\'name\': \'증인 보호\', \'text\': \'생물에 부여\\n부여된 생물은 모든 능력을 잃고 기본 공격력과 방어력이 1/1이며 이름이 견실한 사업가인 녹색 및 백색 시민 생물이다. (그 생물은 다른 모든 색, 카드 유형, 생물 유형 및 이름을 잃는다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'440959b7-47bb-431d-819a-ea3b0a89be45\', \'multiverseId\': 556833}, \'multiverseid\': 556833}, {\'name\': \'Proteção de Testemunhas\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada perde todas as habilidades e é uma criatura Cidadão verde e branca com poder e resistência básicos 1/1 com o nome Comerciante Respeitável. (Ele perde todas as outras cores, tipos de card, tipos de criatura e nomes.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d9b357-4e8c-463a-a754-cdd2b9aee58a\', \'multiverseId\': 557094}, \'multiverseid\': 557094}, {\'name\': \'Защита Свидетеля\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо теряет все способности и является существом зеленый и белый Гражданин с базовой силой и выносливостью 1/1 с именем Законопослушный Делец. (Оно теряет все другие цвета, типы карты, типы существа и имена.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'447f7d9c-b84b-4873-917a-5ba094a8572d\', \'multiverseId\': 557355}, \'multiverseid\': 557355}, {\'name\': \'证人保护\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物失去所有异能，且是基础力量与防御力为1/1，名称为合法商人的绿白双色市民生物。（它失去所有其他颜色、牌张类别、生物类别以及名称。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9ceb818-58ef-4a92-b13b-eb02cc4b95f3\', \'multiverseId\': 557616}, \'multiverseid\': 557616}, {\'name\': \'證人保護\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物失去所有異能，且是基礎力量與防禦力為1/1，名稱為合法商人的綠白雙色市民生物。（它失去所有其他顏色、牌張類別、生物類別以及名稱。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54d8cd69-5906-4066-9512-fc0d7ab7a4c4\', \'multiverseId\': 557877}, \'multiverseid\': 557877}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ziatora die Einäscherin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Wenn du dies tust, fügt Ziatora die Einäscherin einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur zu und du erzeugst drei Schatz-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dämon, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555693&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a09fe5-8144-4825-b89a-9aaecdb4a0a4\', \'multiverseId\': 555693}, \'multiverseid\': 555693}, {\'name\': \'Ziatora, la Incineradora\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, puedes sacrificar otra criatura. Cuando lo hagas, Ziatora, la Incineradora hace una cantidad de daño igual a la fuerza de esa criatura a cualquier objetivo y tú creas tres fichas de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d85c45b1-b96c-4d6c-bdb4-e1b73f0e2318\', \'multiverseId\': 555954}, \'multiverseid\': 555954}, {\'name\': "Ziatora, l\'incinératrice", \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Quand vous faites ainsi, Ziatora, l\'incinératrice inflige un nombre de blessures égal à la force de cette créature à n\'importe quelle cible et vous créez trois jetons Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : démon et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e3d637-18ea-4e7b-839c-99e5ccc7a724\', \'multiverseId\': 556215}, \'multiverseid\': 556215}, {\'name\': "Ziatora, l\'Inceneritrice", \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi sacrificare un\'altra creatura. Quando lo fai, Ziatora, l\'Inceneritrice infligge danno pari alla forza di quella creatura a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu crei tre pedine Tesoro.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2573ce7a-63b2-43f5-ba3b-434fe0d1804d\', \'multiverseId\': 556476}, \'multiverseid\': 556476}, {\'name\': \'焼却するもの、ジアトラ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたはこれでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。焼却するもの、ジアトラはそれにその生贄に捧げたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与え、あなたは宝物・トークン３つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — デーモン・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4904a484-4db2-47b7-844b-ddbb83fc4eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 556737}, \'multiverseid\': 556737}, {\'name\': \'소각자, 지아토라\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신은 다른 생물 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 소각자, 지아토라는 그 목표에게 그 생물의 공격력만큼 피해를 입히고 당신은 보물 토큰 세 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 악마 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83cbd8f1-01d6-42c7-8c0e-c565c5e210bd\', \'multiverseId\': 556998}, \'multiverseid\': 556998}, {\'name\': \'Ziatora, a Incineradora\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua etapa final, você pode sacrificar outra criatura. Quando você faz isso, Ziatora, a Incineradora, causa a qualquer alvo dano igual ao poder daquela criatura e você cria três fichas de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Demônio Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4849e5fc-ee40-4a72-8d36-79502bae7412\', \'multiverseId\': 557259}, \'multiverseid\': 557259}, {\'name\': \'Зиатора, Испепелительница\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага вы можете пожертвовать другое существо. Когда вы это делаете, Зиатора, Испепелительница наносит любой цели повреждения, равные силе того существа, а вы создаете три фишки Клада.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Демон Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7e5162-6717-4d30-b35a-302654d2c8c3\', \'multiverseId\': 557520}, \'multiverseid\': 557520}, {\'name\': \'焚炎魔齐朵拉\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。当你如此作时，焚炎魔齐朵拉对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于所牺牲生物的力量，且你派出三个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～恶魔／龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0001cbd0-e8c5-47ca-97b2-2984276366c4\', \'multiverseId\': 557781}, \'multiverseid\': 557781}, {\'name\': \'焚炎魔齊朵拉\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，你可以犧牲另一個生物。當你如此作時，焚炎魔齊朵拉對任意一個目標造成傷害，其數量等同於所犧牲生物的力量，且你派出三個珍寶衍生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～惡魔／龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3feea116-48de-4fd7-9c2e-b483c8b28eab\', \'multiverseId\': 558042}, \'multiverseid\': 558042}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ziatora die Einäscherin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Wenn du dies tust, fügt Ziatora die Einäscherin einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur zu und du erzeugst drei Schatz-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dämon, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558782&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d65f719d-82ff-497f-a9e4-8f244fb96b4d\', \'multiverseId\': 558782}, \'multiverseid\': 558782}, {\'name\': \'Ziatora, la Incineradora\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, puedes sacrificar otra criatura. Cuando lo hagas, Ziatora, la Incineradora hace una cantidad de daño igual a la fuerza de esa criatura a cualquier objetivo y tú creas tres fichas de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6449b098-9918-4dab-8a5b-d60a2deb72a0\', \'multiverseId\': 558827}, \'multiverseid\': 558827}, {\'name\': "Ziatora, l\'incinératrice", \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Quand vous faites ainsi, Ziatora, l\'incinératrice inflige un nombre de blessures égal à la force de cette créature à n\'importe quelle cible et vous créez trois jetons Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : démon et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6cb2a8-808f-4c81-8681-54e6a01a3387\', \'multiverseId\': 558872}, \'multiverseid\': 558872}, {\'name\': "Ziatora, l\'Inceneritrice", \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi sacrificare un\'altra creatura. Quando lo fai, Ziatora, l\'Inceneritrice infligge danno pari alla forza di quella creatura a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu crei tre pedine Tesoro.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3b779da-9b11-4320-8cdb-0974fa0b395c\', \'multiverseId\': 558917}, \'multiverseid\': 558917}, {\'name\': \'焼却するもの、ジアトラ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたはこれでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。焼却するもの、ジアトラはそれにその生贄に捧げたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与え、あなたは宝物・トークン３つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — デーモン・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8916f4f-14ff-4383-a266-68ef5e52057c\', \'multiverseId\': 558962}, \'multiverseid\': 558962}, {\'name\': \'소각자, 지아토라\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신은 다른 생물 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 소각자, 지아토라는 그 목표에게 그 생물의 공격력만큼 피해를 입히고 당신은 보물 토큰 세 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 악마 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7beb3ea-f29a-4973-aa3c-cf11e0f4175e\', \'multiverseId\': 559007}, \'multiverseid\': 559007}, {\'name\': \'Ziatora, a Incineradora\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua etapa final, você pode sacrificar outra criatura. Quando você faz isso, Ziatora, a Incineradora, causa a qualquer alvo dano igual ao poder daquela criatura e você cria três fichas de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Demônio Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdaa3d28-fd03-4c5f-b9d9-4afe3d44afd5\', \'multiverseId\': 559052}, \'multiverseid\': 559052}, {\'name\': \'Зиатора, Испепелительница\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага вы можете пожертвовать другое существо. Когда вы это делаете, Зиатора, Испепелительница наносит любой цели повреждения, равные силе того существа, а вы создаете три фишки Клада.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Демон Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a23c6533-50f4-4f7c-bb6a-73285aa97d77\', \'multiverseId\': 559097}, \'multiverseid\': 559097}, {\'name\': \'焚炎魔齐朵拉\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。当你如此作时，焚炎魔齐朵拉对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于所牺牲生物的力量，且你派出三个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～恶魔／龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'457e8773-aac1-48cc-a0d2-529ea0737050\', \'multiverseId\': 559142}, \'multiverseid\': 559142}, {\'name\': \'焚炎魔齊朵拉\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，你可以犧牲另一個生物。當你如此作時，焚炎魔齊朵拉對任意一個目標造成傷害，其數量等同於所犧牲生物的力量，且你派出三個珍寶衍生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～惡魔／龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2cfe8c3-1689-4c6e-ad6b-8ed5115db1e2\', \'multiverseId\': 559187}, \'multiverseid\': 559187}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ziatoras Boxring\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {B}, {R} oder {G}.)\\nZiatoras Boxring kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {3} ({3}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge, Wald\', \'flavor\': \'Im weitläufigen Treza-Lagerhaus finden ruhelose Umnieter immer einen Sparringpartner.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555723&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a4488c6-6224-4941-a639-c6168e335db2\', \'multiverseId\': 555723}, \'multiverseid\': 555723}, {\'name\': \'Zona de entrenamiento de Ziatora\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {B}, {R} o {G}.)\\nLa Zona de entrenamiento de Ziatora entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCiclo {3}. ({3}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Pantano montaña bosque\', \'flavor\': \'En el extenso almacén Treza, los Remachadores que no saben estarse quietos siempre encuentran a alguien con quien entrenar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'635699c1-579c-4b57-b4a1-c65428ee9525\', \'multiverseId\': 555984}, \'multiverseid\': 555984}, {\'name\': \'Salle de recrutement de Ziatora\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {B}, {R} ou {G}.)\\nLa Salle de recrutement de Ziatora arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nRecyclage {3} ({3}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Terrain : marais et montagne et forêt\', \'flavor\': "Les Riveteurs agités trouvent toujours un partenaire d\'entraînement dans le tentaculaire entrepôt de Treza.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556245&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca89284b-3578-4080-bba7-0f4d8b05630d\', \'multiverseId\': 556245}, \'multiverseid\': 556245}, {\'name\': \'Ring di Prova di Ziatora\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {B}, {R} o {G}.)\\nIl Ring di Prova di Ziatora entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nCiclo {3} ({3}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Terra — Palude Montagna Foresta\', \'flavor\': \'I Rivettatori irrequieti possono sempre trovare uno sparring partner nel sovraffollato magazzino di Treza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'763af98f-ea51-4801-9e37-880a161e5d5c\', \'multiverseId\': 556506}, \'multiverseid\': 556506}, {\'name\': \'ジアトラの試練場\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{B}か{R}か{G}を加える。）\\nジアトラの試練場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{3}（{3}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'土地 — 沼・山・森\', \'flavor\': \'落ち着かないとき、土建組一家の一員は乱雑に広がるトレザの倉庫でいつでも手合わせの相手を見つけることができる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ef8b75-2c41-4757-90c8-c0d7eb2ddaf9\', \'multiverseId\': 556767}, \'multiverseid\': 556767}, {\'name\': \'지아토라의 시험장\', \'text\': \'({T}: {B}, {R} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.)\\n지아토라의 시험장은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n순환 {3} ({3}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'대지 — 늪 산 숲\', \'flavor\': \'쉴 생각이 없는 리베티어즈는 이리저리 뻗어 나가는 트레자 창고에서 스파링 상대를 찾을 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67e127d-7084-4f46-ad1d-395d0c842c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 557028}, \'multiverseid\': 557028}, {\'name\': \'Campo de Provas de Ziatora\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {B}, {R} ou {G}.)\\nCampo de Provas de Ziatora entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nReciclar {3} ({3}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Pântano Montanha Floresta\', \'flavor\': \'Os Rebiteiros inquietos sempre encontram parceiros de treino no gigantesco armazém Treza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b4e9199-8328-41a2-8b12-9b93ce57f644\', \'multiverseId\': 557289}, \'multiverseid\': 557289}, {\'name\': \'Испытательный Ринг Зиаторы\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {B}, {R} или {G}.)\\nИспытательный Ринг Зиаторы выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nЦикл {3} ({3}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Земля — Болото Гора Лес\', \'flavor\': \'На просторном складе Треза неугомонные Клепальщики всегда могут найти себе партнера для товарищеского поединка.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b628bb57-6d29-48b8-a13d-772ea05c68ba\', \'multiverseId\': 557550}, \'multiverseid\': 557550}, {\'name\': \'齐朵拉的校场\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{B}，{R}或{G}。）\\n齐朵拉的校场须横置进战场。\\n循环{3}（{3}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'地 ～沼泽／山脉／树林\', \'flavor\': \'坐不住的勤工联成员总能在庞杂的崔栅窟仓库里找到切磋对手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed8fa1eb-547e-4360-8e1a-c7f319200e84\', \'multiverseId\': 557811}, \'multiverseid\': 557811}, {\'name\': \'齊朵拉的校場\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{B}，{R}或{G}。）\\n齊朵拉的校場須橫置進戰場。\\n循環{3}（{3}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'地 ～沼澤／山脈／樹林\', \'flavor\': \'坐不住的勤工聯成員總能在龐雜的崔柵窟倉庫裡找到切磋對手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b944a4cf-724e-4d4b-870b-bb67503854cb\', \'multiverseId\': 558072}, \'multiverseid\': 558072}]', "[{'name': 'Ziatoras Boxring', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {B}, {R} oder {G}.)\\nZiatoras Boxring kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {3}', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge, Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558440&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7ecd412-0402-4df2-8ff6-97273c79b36a', 'multiverseId': 558440}, 'multiverseid': 558440}, {'name': 'Zona de entrenamiento de Ziatora', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B}, {R} o {G}.)\\nLa Zona de entrenamiento de Ziatora entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCiclo {3}.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558451&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2dbbd4d-3c80-4a9a-97cc-5cf4d372f3cf', 'multiverseId': 558451}, 'multiverseid': 558451}, {'name': 'Salle de recrutement de Ziatora', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B}, {R} ou {G}.)\\nLa Salle de recrutement de Ziatora arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nRecyclage {3}', 'type': 'Terrain : marais et montagne et forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558462&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba58ca11-a517-4d64-92f9-667aaa4ed610', 'multiverseId': 558462}, 'multiverseid': 558462}, {'name': 'Ring di Prova di Ziatora', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {B}, {R} o {G}.)\\nIl Ring di Prova di Ziatora entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nCiclo {3}', 'type': 'Terra — Palude Montagna Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558473&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7ee9088-55f1-4e7a-b3d4-ee888b924cfd', 'multiverseId': 558473}, 'multiverseid': 558473}, {'name': 'ジアトラの試練場', 'text': '（{T}：{B}か{R}か{G}を加える。）\\nジアトラの試練場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{3}', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山・森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558484&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9eb70524-c5f9-4814-8a02-8e664525bf62', 'multiverseId': 558484}, 'multiverseid': 558484}, {'name': '지아토라의 시험장', 'text': '({T}: {B}, {R} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.)\\n지아토라의 시험장은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n순환 {3}', 'type': '대지 — 늪 산 숲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558495&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd25356c7-0f25-45b6-a1c2-5501e932ea1e', 'multiverseId': 558495}, 'multiverseid': 558495}, {'name': 'Campo de Provas de Ziatora', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {B}, {R} ou {G}.)\\nCampo de Provas de Ziatora entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nReciclar {3}', 'type': 'Terreno — Pântano Montanha Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558506&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac83c2ef-157f-4233-908f-ff3b9cbb90e0', 'multiverseId': 558506}, 'multiverseid': 558506}, {'name': 'Испытательный Ринг Зиаторы', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {B}, {R} или {G}.)\\nИспытательный Ринг Зиаторы выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nЦикл {3}', 'type': 'Земля — Болото Гора Лес', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558517&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14317ba4-9a6b-449b-b318-72c14a23f45c', 'multiverseId': 558517}, 'multiverseid': 558517}, {'name': '齐朵拉的校场', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}，{R}或{G}。）\\n齐朵拉的校场须横置进战场。\\n循环{3}', 'type': '地 ～沼泽／山脉／树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558528&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b99849a-1c9c-42fe-a9d9-f68b10315e2d', 'multiverseId': 558528}, 'multiverseid': 558528}, {'name': '齊朵拉的校場', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}，{R}或{G}。）\\n齊朵拉的校場須橫置進戰場。\\n循環{3}', 'type': '地 ～沼澤／山脈／樹林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558539&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed3b3e09-6b5c-4978-aa8d-d836217e42cd', 'multiverseId': 558539}, 'multiverseid': 558539}]", "[{'name': 'Ziatoras Boxring', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {B}, {R} oder {G}.)\\nZiatoras Boxring kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {3}', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge, Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559254&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3703c07-f7b7-481a-beb4-04668d3a51e3', 'multiverseId': 559254}, 'multiverseid': 559254}, {'name': 'Zona de entrenamiento de Ziatora', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B}, {R} o {G}.)\\nLa Zona de entrenamiento de Ziatora entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCiclo {3}.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559264&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5afbc8f-1295-4cd6-8673-b1cd23a4a10a', 'multiverseId': 559264}, 'multiverseid': 559264}, {'name': 'Salle de recrutement de Ziatora', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B}, {R} ou {G}.)\\nLa Salle de recrutement de Ziatora arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nRecyclage {3}', 'type': 'Terrain : marais et montagne et forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559274&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c48e93c3-e8d8-4af9-bb97-6983cc21ac79', 'multiverseId': 559274}, 'multiverseid': 559274}, {'name': 'Ring di Prova di Ziatora', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {B}, {R} o {G}.)\\nIl Ring di Prova di Ziatora entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nCiclo {3}', 'type': 'Terra — Palude Montagna Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559284&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f8ccbeb-687c-4fc3-a5c0-e75f3df275eb', 'multiverseId': 559284}, 'multiverseid': 559284}, {'name': 'ジアトラの試練場', 'text': '（{T}：{B}か{R}か{G}を加える。）\\nジアトラの試練場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{3}', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山・森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559294&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2ea195a-7b99-40ff-aecc-c1a5f51a7f5f', 'multiverseId': 559294}, 'multiverseid': 559294}, {'name': '지아토라의 시험장', 'text': '({T}: {B}, {R} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.)\\n지아토라의 시험장은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n순환 {3}', 'type': '대지 — 늪 산 숲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559304&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9988e7f0-8fb6-488c-94ba-f5bd52d6c2ef', 'multiverseId': 559304}, 'multiverseid': 559304}, {'name': 'Campo de Provas de Ziatora', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {B}, {R} ou {G}.)\\nCampo de Provas de Ziatora entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nReciclar {3}', 'type': 'Terreno — Pântano Montanha Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559314&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd467af86-b017-48a4-8b83-f1d943d4eb1a', 'multiverseId': 559314}, 'multiverseid': 559314}, {'name': 'Испытательный Ринг Зиаторы', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {B}, {R} или {G}.)\\nИспытательный Ринг Зиаторы выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nЦикл {3}', 'type': 'Земля — Болото Гора Лес', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559324&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '890cfd49-ba73-42e9-b7a4-b8d17e112fd2', 'multiverseId': 559324}, 'multiverseid': 559324}, {'name': '齐朵拉的校场', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}，{R}或{G}。）\\n齐朵拉的校场须横置进战场。\\n循环{3}', 'type': '地 ～沼泽／山脉／树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559334&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6132c0bb-4f1e-46d3-9028-624d203f40bd', 'multiverseId': 559334}, 'multiverseid': 559334}, {'name': '齊朵拉的校場', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}，{R}或{G}。）\\n齊朵拉的校場須橫置進戰場。\\n循環{3}', 'type': '地 ～沼澤／山脈／樹林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559344&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f3d7c9b-3b3a-48f7-9e7f-6aa501948e74', 'multiverseId': 559344}, 'multiverseid': 559344}]", "[{'name': 'Zum Verschwinden bringen', 'text': 'Todesopfer 1 (Sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 1 oder mehr opfern. Wenn du dies tust, kopiere diesen Zauberspruch. Du kannst ein neues Ziel für die Kopie bestimmen.)\\nNeutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {2}.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555511&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1dd0e35b-f077-486a-b7d7-98f7380f29e6', 'multiverseId': 555511}, 'multiverseid': 555511}, {'name': 'Hacer desaparecer', 'text': 'Victimizar 1. (Al lanzar este hechizo, puedes sacrificar una criatura con fuerza de 1 o más. Cuando lo hagas, copia este hechizo y puedes elegir un nuevo objetivo para la copia.)\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {2}.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555772&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '461eaabb-cba0-4c3b-b41c-b3cbeaee8e01', 'multiverseId': 555772}, 'multiverseid': 555772}, {'name': 'Faire disparaître', 'text': 'Victime 1 (Au moment où vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez sacrifier une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 1. Quand vous faites ainsi, copiez ce sort et vous pouvez choisir une nouvelle cible pour cette copie.)\\nContrecarrez un sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {2}.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556033&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5dcd7f62-33d5-4770-981d-144b133bf14c', 'multiverseId': 556033}, 'multiverseid': 556033}, {'name': 'Far Sparire', 'text': 'Danno collaterale 1 (Mentre lanci questa magia, puoi sacrificare una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 1. Quando lo fai, copia questa magia e puoi scegliere un nuovo bersaglio per la copia.)\\nNeutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {2}.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556294&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '454ffb33-a86e-4e45-88ac-76bb47fecf61', 'multiverseId': 556294}, 'multiverseid': 556294}, {'name': 'かき消し', 'text': '犠牲１（あなたがこの呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはパワーが１以上であるクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、この呪文をコピーし、あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\\n呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556555&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc33d977-4451-43b4-8d1c-54aa50646f60', 'multiverseId': 556555}, 'multiverseid': 556555}, {'name': '사라지게 만들기', 'text': '사상자 1 (이 주문을 발동하면서, 당신은 공격력이 1 이상인 생물 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 이 주문을 복사하고 당신은 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.)\\n주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {2}를 지불하지 않으면 그 주문을 무효화한다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556816&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd068f86d-c1e0-4202-8fb1-f0ed76f8e8c1', 'multiverseId': 556816}, 'multiverseid': 556816}, {'name': 'Fazer Desaparecer', 'text': 'Baixa 1 (Conforme você conjura esta mágica, você pode sacrificar uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 1. Quando fizer isso, copie esta mágica e você pode escolher um novo alvo para a cópia.)\\nAnule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2}.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557077&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78616813-6ae0-443f-ae36-f9e730748af4', 'multiverseId': 557077}, 'multiverseid': 557077}, {'name': 'Заставить Исчезнуть', 'text': 'Потери 1 (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете пожертвовать существо с силой 1 или больше. Когда вы это делаете, скопируйте это заклинание, и вы можете выбрать новую цель для той копии.)\\nОтмените целевое заклинание, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {2}.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557338&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22c6421c-c820-4abf-9e71-cf5e645dbd4c', 'multiverseId': 557338}, 'multiverseid': 557338}, {'name': '人间消失', 'text': '催命1（于你施放此咒语时，你可以牺牲一个力量等于或大于1的生物。当你如此作时，复制此咒语，且你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。）\\n除非目标咒语的操控者支付{2}，否则反击之。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557599&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1d327a7-f720-4f5a-a621-c42bad547c15', 'multiverseId': 557599}, 'multiverseid': 557599}, {'name': '人間消失', 'text': '催命1（於你施放此咒語時，你可以犧牲一個力量等於或大於1的生物。當你如此作時，複製此咒語，且你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。）\\n除非目標咒語的操控者支付{2}，否則反擊之。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557860&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1dee765f-6646-442d-ab5f-25a80c4de90b', 'multiverseId': 557860}, 'multiverseid': 557860}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zunehmendes Gedränge\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Zunehmende Gedränge ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an Karten namens Zunehmendes Gedränge durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bürger\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Begleitperson ist einfach nicht genug.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555475&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a43e546e-c4ea-4a3c-a526-412662314721\', \'multiverseId\': 555475}, \'multiverseid\': 555475}, {\'name\': \'Multitud reunida\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Multitud reunida entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca cualquier cantidad de cartas llamadas Multitud reunida, mostrarlas, ponerlas en tu mano y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano humano\', \'flavor\': \'Un solo acompañante no es suficiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cebba5e-7f67-46f3-ad26-ca608d11b84b\', \'multiverseId\': 555736}, \'multiverseid\': 555736}, {\'name\': \'Cohue mondaine\', \'text\': "Quand la Cohue mondaine arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque n\'importe quel nombre de cartes appelées Cohue mondaine, les révéler, les mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et citoyen\', \'flavor\': "Venir accompagné d\'une seule personne, c\'est trop peu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555997&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b48edb3f-2ac2-45fe-8900-9c79cf46c7c9\', \'multiverseId\': 555997}, \'multiverseid\': 555997}, {\'name\': \'Calca Crescente\', \'text\': \'Quando la Calca Crescente entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per un qualsiasi numero di carte chiamate Calca Crescente, rivelarle e aggiungerle alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cittadino Umano\', \'flavor\': \'A volte un solo accompagnatore non è proprio sufficiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ace18b59-848f-4014-80ae-a415b8f349cb\', \'multiverseId\': 556258}, \'multiverseid\': 556258}, {\'name\': \'集まる群衆\', \'text\': \'集まる群衆が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから『集まる群衆』という名前を持つ望む枚数のカードを探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・市民\', \'flavor\': \'一人同伴可では、単純に足りない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a95d144b-284a-401a-9751-7028b1f0d609\', \'multiverseId\': 556519}, \'multiverseid\': 556519}, {\'name\': \'모여드는 인파\', \'text\': \'모여드는 인파가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 이름이 모여드는 인파인 카드를 원하는 수만큼 찾아 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 시민\', \'flavor\': \'동반인 한 명으로는 충분하지 않다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee84ae4-bf5e-4558-8d26-44fc01807e1c\', \'multiverseId\': 556780}, \'multiverseid\': 556780}, {\'name\': \'Turba em Formação\', \'text\': \'Quando Turba em Formação entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório qualquer número de cards com o nome Turba em Formação, revelá-los, colocá-los em sua mão e depois embaralhar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cidadão\', \'flavor\': \'Só mais um não basta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cb3b246-c5e8-4595-9fb7-386dc88b3a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 557041}, \'multiverseid\': 557041}, {\'name\': \'Собирающаяся Толпа\', \'text\': \'Когда Собирающаяся Толпа выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке любое количество карт с именем Собирающаяся Толпа, показать их, положить их в вашу руку, затем перетасовать библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Гражданин\', \'flavor\': \'«Плюс один» бывает просто недостаточно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d520fef-5a0c-411c-875f-aaf3383b6213\', \'multiverseId\': 557302}, \'multiverseid\': 557302}, {\'name\': \'集群民众\', \'text\': \'当集群民众进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻任意数量名称为集群民众的牌，展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／市民\', \'flavor\': \'只有一人说「我也来」远远不够。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebcd11f-f9a0-4500-8b94-d8b6bfd356c5\', \'multiverseId\': 557563}, \'multiverseid\': 557563}, {\'name\': \'集群民眾\', \'text\': \'當集群民眾進戰場時，你可以從你牌庫中搜尋任意數量名稱為集群民眾的牌，展示這些牌，將它們置於你手上，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／市民\', \'flavor\': \'只有一人說「我也來」遠遠不夠。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'334d29f3-2fcc-4b9d-9f9c-10d42fdd51ef\', \'multiverseId\': 557824}, \'multiverseid\': 557824}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zäher Außenseiter\', \'text\': \'Blitz — {2}{B}{B}, bezahle 2 Lebenspunkte. (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Blitz-Kosten wirkst, erhält er Eile und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, ziehe eine Karte." Opfere diese Kreatur zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.)\\nDu kannst den Zähen Außenseiter mithilfe seiner Blitz-Fähigkeit aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4377791-a638-4033-b193-8966122e087f\', \'multiverseId\': 555559}, \'multiverseid\': 555559}, {\'name\': \'Subestimado tenaz\', \'text\': \'Irrupción—{2}{B}{B}, pagar 2 vidas. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de irrupción, gana la habilidad de prisa y "Cuando esta criatura muera, roba una carta". Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.)\\nPuedes lanzar el Subestimado tenaz desde tu cementerio usando su habilidad de irrupción.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=555820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c5bbc7b-5fcb-4a21-8290-8ab50fb9f548\', \'multiverseId\': 555820}, \'multiverseid\': 555820}, {\'name\': \'Outsider tenace\', \'text\': "Blitz — {2}{B}{B}, payez 2 points de vie. (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de blitz, il acquiert la célérité et « Quand cette créature meurt, piochez une carte. » Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.)\\nVous pouvez lancer l\'Outsider tenace depuis votre cimetière en utilisant sa capacité de blitz.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556081&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e02f2d50-ff09-46b2-8e31-e79eb09f828e\', \'multiverseId\': 556081}, \'multiverseid\': 556081}, {\'name\': \'Sfavorito Tenace\', \'text\': \'Blitz—{2}{B}{B}, Paga 2 punti vita. (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di blitz, ha rapidità e "Quando questa creatura muore, pesca una carta". Sacrificala all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.)\\nPuoi lanciare lo Sfavorito Tenace dal tuo cimitero usando la sua abilità blitz.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acc5fa00-dec9-4205-8daf-74d9c98743ac\', \'multiverseId\': 556342}, \'multiverseid\': 556342}, {\'name\': \'しつこい負け犬\', \'text\': \'奇襲—{2}{B}{B}, ２点のライフを支払う。（あなたがこの呪文を奇襲コストで唱えたなら、これは速攻と「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、カード１枚を引く。」を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\\nあなたは、あなたの墓地にあるしつこい負け犬をこれの奇襲能力で唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c5a84d7-62b9-4e8f-a561-2def87fe1aad\', \'multiverseId\': 556603}, \'multiverseid\': 556603}, {\'name\': \'집요한 약자\', \'text\': \'기습—{2}{B}{B}, 생명 2점을 지불한다. (기습 비용을 지불해서 이 주문을 발동했다면, 이 생물은 신속 및 "이 생물이 죽을 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 얻는다. 다음 종료단 시작에 이 생물을 희생한다.)\\n당신은 집요한 약자의 기습 비용을 지불하는 것으로 집요한 약자를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=556864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e94ce99d-c325-4bf9-a07b-11dd916260a5\', \'multiverseId\': 556864}, \'multiverseid\': 556864}, {\'name\': \'Azarão Tenaz\', \'text\': \'Blitz — {2}{B}{B}, pague 2 pontos de vida. (Se você conjura esta mágica por seu custo de blitz, ela ganha ímpeto e "Quando esta criatura morrer, compre um card". Sacrifique-a no início da próxima etapa final.)\\nVocê pode conjurar Azarão Tenaz do seu cemitério usando sua habilidade blitz.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90cf8be7-dd3d-46f8-a3fa-20b4db99471e\', \'multiverseId\': 557125}, \'multiverseid\': 557125}, {\'name\': \'Упорный Аутсайдер\', \'text\': \'Блиц — {2}{B}{B}, заплатите 2 жизни. (Если вы разыгрываете это заклинание за его стоимость Блица, оно получает Ускорение и способность «Когда это существо умирает, возьмите карту». Пожертвуйте его в начале следующего заключительного шага.)\\nВы можете разыграть Упорного Аутсайдера из вашего кладбища, используя его способность Блица.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73235ee4-c09c-48eb-a754-fcd2aaa9d78f\', \'multiverseId\': 557386}, \'multiverseid\': 557386}, {\'name\': \'顽强败犬\', \'text\': \'急袭～{2}{B}{B}，支付2点生命。（如果你支付此咒语的急袭费用来施放之，则它获得敏捷与「当此生物死去时，抓一张牌。」在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。）\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中利用顽强败犬的急袭异能来施放之。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'769e0a01-2db7-49c4-bc37-bc623020eda8\', \'multiverseId\': 557647}, \'multiverseid\': 557647}, {\'name\': \'頑強敗犬\', \'text\': \'急襲～{2}{B}{B}，支付2點生命。（如果你支付此咒語的急襲費用來施放之，則它獲得敏捷與「當此生物死去時，抽一張牌。」在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它犧牲。）\\n你可以從你的墳墓場中利用頑強敗犬的急襲異能來施放之。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=557908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9834ca7-fc8e-43d3-b348-a817ef9f1cf3\', \'multiverseId\': 557908}, \'multiverseid\': 557908}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zäher Außenseiter\', \'text\': \'Blitz — {2}{B}{B}, bezahle 2 Lebenspunkte.\\nDu kannst den Zähen Außenseiter mithilfe seiner Blitz-Fähigkeit aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6ac7b8-ef85-430f-bd41-8e5071bf17ea\', \'multiverseId\': 558553}, \'multiverseid\': 558553}, {\'name\': \'Subestimado tenaz\', \'text\': \'Irrupción—{2}{B}{B}, pagar 2 vidas.\\nPuedes lanzar el Subestimado tenaz desde tu cementerio usando su habilidad de irrupción.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'374ff4a4-12a2-4749-83b1-9bf2db537384\', \'multiverseId\': 558562}, \'multiverseid\': 558562}, {\'name\': \'Outsider tenace\', \'text\': "Blitz — {2}{B}{B}, payez 2 points de vie.\\nVous pouvez lancer l\'Outsider tenace depuis votre cimetière en utilisant sa capacité de blitz.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc13429-8c7f-45bc-95f8-81dd20c1cb20\', \'multiverseId\': 558571}, \'multiverseid\': 558571}, {\'name\': \'Sfavorito Tenace\', \'text\': \'Blitz—{2}{B}{B}, Paga 2 punti vita.\\nPuoi lanciare lo Sfavorito Tenace dal tuo cimitero usando la sua abilità blitz.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'972f8706-2c8f-40ad-b022-d19e18a85951\', \'multiverseId\': 558580}, \'multiverseid\': 558580}, {\'name\': \'しつこい負け犬\', \'text\': \'奇襲—{2}{B}{B}, ２点のライフを支払う。\\nあなたは、あなたの墓地にあるしつこい負け犬をこれの奇襲能力で唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1322898-f404-487c-90f5-2f1a249b7764\', \'multiverseId\': 558589}, \'multiverseid\': 558589}, {\'name\': \'집요한 약자\', \'text\': \'기습—{2}{B}{B}, 생명 2점을 지불한다.\\n당신은 집요한 약자의 기습 비용을 지불하는 것으로 집요한 약자를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'441fa0a0-f667-421b-930e-4e4061f05fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 558598}, \'multiverseid\': 558598}, {\'name\': \'Azarão Tenaz\', \'text\': \'Blitz — {2}{B}{B}, pague 2 pontos de vida.\\nVocê pode conjurar Azarão Tenaz do seu cemitério usando sua habilidade blitz.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea355cfb-1a33-406a-ae65-d5278e22be55\', \'multiverseId\': 558607}, \'multiverseid\': 558607}, {\'name\': \'Упорный Аутсайдер\', \'text\': \'Блиц — {2}{B}{B}, заплатите 2 жизни.\\nВы можете разыграть Упорного Аутсайдера из вашего кладбища, используя его способность Блица.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b355081c-58a2-464c-8000-ae4083e5daa0\', \'multiverseId\': 558616}, \'multiverseid\': 558616}, {\'name\': \'顽强败犬\', \'text\': \'急袭～{2}{B}{B}，支付2点生命。\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中利用顽强败犬的急袭异能来施放之。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33310533-7d39-41e9-bd6b-698664b81e5c\', \'multiverseId\': 558625}, \'multiverseid\': 558625}, {\'name\': \'頑強敗犬\', \'text\': \'急襲～{2}{B}{B}，支付2點生命。\\n你可以從你的墳墓場中利用頑強敗犬的急襲異能來施放之。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=558634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5879a706-0460-406d-9bc0-4876f1c62f48\', \'multiverseId\': 558634}, \'multiverseid\': 558634}]', "[{'name': '|DYrbreLh,$hDyhk,psewtr.', 'text': '|zvE&EhclYvDh.\\n|besYf,dceb&CpOnYA,DEEstiYDC co tuhtZFsYt,DEEtAGvEnyg,AsFTYD. |Tu,GFGvEng,JhEGFronz,bYBYK.\\n|besYf,FsnUCA,dceb&CpunyA DEEstiYDC beCEcs,GFronuz GnekRGvEnyg,mpreLuv coCEt tuhtZFsut,DEEtAGvEnyg,AsFtuD. |Tu,GFGvEng,JhEGFronz,bYhuK.', 'type': '|MewkfuDs fyrs,psewtr.', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=559234&type=card', 'language': 'Phyrexian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '979eee11-9843-49c0-8a1e-bb0616926f90', 'multiverseId': 559234}, 'multiverseid': 559234}]"]
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFR', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANA', 'ANB', 'ARC', 'ARN', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BLB', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CST', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DKM', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DTK', 'DVD', 'E01', 'ELD', 'EMN', 'EVG', 'F15', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'G17', 'GDY', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GRN', 'GS1', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'ITP', 'J14', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JVC', 'KHM', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LCI', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LRW', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'MD1', 'ME1', 'ME3', 'MH2', 'MH3', 'MID', 'MIR', 'MKM', 'MMQ', 'MOM', 'MRD', 'NEO', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'ONE', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTJ', 'OTP', 'P02', 'P23', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PAL03', 'PAL04', 'PAL05', 'PAL06', 'PAL99', 'PALP', 'PANA', 'PARL', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PCBB', 'PD2', 'PD3', 'PDGM', 'PELP', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PGPX', 'PGRU', 'PHUK', 'PIP', 'PL24', 'PLST', 'PM19', 'PMPS', 'PMPS06', 'PMPS07', 'PMPS08', 'PMPS09', 'PMPS10', 'PMPS11', 'POR', 'PPP1', 'PRM', 'PRW2', 'PRWK', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSNC', 'PSS2', 'PSS3', 'PSS4', 'PTC', 'PTK', 'PWCS', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SCH', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SLD', 'SLP', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TPR', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UGL', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'VOW', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ["({T}: Add {B}, {R}, or {G}.)\\nZiatora's Proving Ground enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3}", "({T}: Add {B}, {R}, or {G}.)\\nZiatora's Proving Ground enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", "({T}: Add {G}, {W}, or {U}.)\\nSpara's Headquarters enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3}", "({T}: Add {G}, {W}, or {U}.)\\nSpara's Headquarters enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", "({T}: Add {R}, {G}, or {W}.)\\nJetmir's Garden enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3}", "({T}: Add {R}, {G}, or {W}.)\\nJetmir's Garden enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", "({T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.)\\nXander's Lounge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3}", "({T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.)\\nXander's Lounge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", "({T}: Add {W}, {U}, or {B}.)\\nRaffine's Tower enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3}", "({T}: Add {W}, {U}, or {B}.)\\nRaffine's Tower enters the battlefield tapped.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", '+1: Choose up to one target creature. Put a +1/+1 counter and a counter from among flying, first strike, lifelink, or vigilance on it.\\n−3: Look at the top seven cards of your library. You may put a permanent card with mana value 3 or less from among them onto the battlefield with a shield counter on it. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\n−7: Create five 3/3 white Angel creature tokens with flying.', "+2: You may sacrifice a creature. If you do, search your library for a creature card with mana value equal to 1 plus the sacrificed creature's mana value, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\\n+1: Mill five cards, then put any number of creature cards milled this way into your hand.\\n−1: Create a 4/4 green Rhino Warrior creature token.", 'Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Attended Socialite gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Venom Connoisseur gains deathtouch until end of turn. If this is the second time this ability has resolved this turn, all creatures you control gain deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Witty Roastmaster deals 1 damage to each opponent.', "Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, choose one that hasn't been chosen this turn —\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on Gala Greeters.\\n• Create a tapped Treasure token.\\n• You gain 2 life.", 'Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Celebrity Fencer.', 'Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, scry 1. If this is the second time this ability has resolved this turn, draw a card instead.', "Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, target creature an opponent controls can't block this turn. If this is the second time this ability has resolved this turn, that creature attacks during its controller's next combat phase if able.", 'Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, target creature other than Elegant Entourage gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Alliance — Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.', "As Scheming Fence enters the battlefield, you may choose a nonland permanent.\\nActivated abilities of the chosen permanent can't be activated.\\nScheming Fence has all activated abilities of the chosen permanent except for loyalty abilities. You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to activate those abilities.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards and create two Treasure tokens. (They\'re artifacts with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile a creature card from your graveyard.\\nCorpse Explosion deals damage equal to the exiled card's power to each creature and each planeswalker.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature, discard a card, or pay 4 life.\\nWhen Dusk Mangler enters the battlefield, each opponent sacrifices a creature, discards a card, and loses 4 life.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a nonland permanent.\\nEach opponent chooses a permanent they control that shares a type with the sacrificed permanent and sacrifices it.\\nDraw a card.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control two or more multicolored permanents, Scuttling Butler gains double strike until end of turn.', 'At the beginning of your end step, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control and a loyalty counter on each planeswalker you control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Black Market Tycoon deals 2 damage to you for each Treasure you control.\\n{T}: Create a Treasure token.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, look at the top card of your library. If it's a creature or planeswalker card, you may reveal it and put it into your hand. If you don't put the card into your hand, you may put it on the bottom of your library.", 'Blitz—{2}{B}{B}, Pay 2 life. (If you cast this spell for its blitz cost, it gains haste and "When this creature dies, draw a card." Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.)\\nYou may cast Tenacious Underdog from your graveyard using its blitz ability.', 'Blitz—{2}{B}{B}, Pay 2 life.\\nYou may cast Tenacious Underdog from your graveyard using its blitz ability.', 'Botanical Plaza enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Botanical Plaza: Draw a card.', 'Casualty 1 (As you cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 1 or greater. When you do, copy this spell and you may choose a new target for the copy.)\\nChoose target creature or planeswalker. If it was dealt noncombat damage this turn, Grisly Sigil deals 3 damage to it and you gain 3 life. Otherwise, Grisly Sigil deals 1 damage to it and you gain 1 life.', 'Casualty 1 (As you cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 1 or greater. When you do, copy this spell and you may choose a new target for the copy.)\\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.', "Casualty 1 (As you cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 1 or greater. When you do, copy this spell and you may choose a new target for the copy.)\\nTap target creature. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\\nDraw a card.", 'Casualty 1 (As you cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 1 or greater. When you do, copy this spell.)\\nExile the top two cards of your library. You may play those cards this turn.', 'Casualty 1 (As you cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 1 or greater. When you do, copy this spell.)\\nLook at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library.', 'Casualty 1 (As you cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 1 or greater. When you do, copy this spell.)\\nMill two cards, then you may return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand. (To mill a card, put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)', "Casualty 2 (As you cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 2 or greater. When you do, copy this spell and you may choose a new target for the copy.)\\nLight 'Em Up deals 2 damage to target creature or planeswalker.", 'Casualty 2 (As you cast this spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 2 or greater. When you do, copy this spell and you may choose a new target for the copy.)\\nTarget player mills half their library, rounded down.', 'Casualty 2 (As you cast